translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_5ba6d5be:

    # s "You didn't even get to the mellow part! Ales are supposed to be quaffed, not sipped on."
    s "你连醇厚的部分都还没尝到呢！麦芽酒就该大口畅饮，不能小口抿！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_75ab91e4:

    # e "W-wait..."
    e "等、等等……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_a726564e:

    # e "hmm... Alright, I'll go with you guys."
    e "嗯……好吧，我跟你们去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_db09b689:

    # o "That's great news, Seb's got a new drinking buddy now."
    o "这可是个好消息，塞巴斯现在有新酒友了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_b90bd54d:

    # "The lizard squats down, laying his head on the counter. He has the look of a man finally seeing the light at the end of a tunnel."
    "蜥蜴蹲了下来，把头搁在柜台上。他看起来就像一个终于看见隧道尽头曙光的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_8160c2ba:

    # s "Ha, we'll see, we'll see. The winner gets tea."
    s "哈，走着瞧，走着瞧。赢家喝茶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_d78e4863:

    # s "...for Ole. We'll get a bunch of fucking beer!"
    s "……给奥利。我们要弄一大堆他妈的啤酒！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_3d87b731:

    # e "Ahem... so! What's the plan...?"
    e "呃……那么！计划是什么……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_50187609:

    # o "As usual, we'll meet at the Tavern."
    o "像平常一样，我们在酒馆碰头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_6938f316:

    # s "Meet us there at night time. Alright."
    s "晚上到那里和我们见面。好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_b3a9474f:

    # s "Uh... No need to bring anything, we've got gold."
    s "呃……不用带任何东西，我们有金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_4e00d00e:

    # s "But bring some for yourself so you can actually bet on something."
    s "不过你还是带点自己的，这样才有东西可押。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_5cfad1f0:

    # o "I suppose that bat friend of yours can get you a bag of coins if you ever need one."
    o "我想，要是你什么时候需要一袋金币，你那位蝙蝠朋友应该能给你弄来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_c736099d:

    # o "Don't bring too much, you're gonna lose it to Cane anyway."
    o "别带太多，反正你会输给凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_b656cdae:

    # "Ole chuckles, casually fidgeting with his dewlap."
    "奥利轻笑起来，漫不经心地拨弄着自己的喉垂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_430e4bc0:

    # "You haven't ever seen Ole look this... this relaxed. He's always seemed so cautious, so attentive."
    "你从没见过奥利这么……这么放松。他平时总是显得格外谨慎，时刻留意着周遭。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_7bd8df44:

    # "It Somehow comes as a surprise to you that he can actually relax, even as he closes his eyes in front of you."
    "即使当着你的面闭上眼睛，他居然真的能放松下来，这还是让你有些意外。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_c2716d5c:

    # s "Well buddy, we'll see you there then."
    s "那好，伙计，到时候见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_4ae8394a:

    # e "See you, Seb and Ole."
    e "回头见，塞巴斯，奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_27dcabc5:

    # o "Hmmph... I've told you this a few times, but, it's good to have you here."
    o "哼……这话我都跟你说过好几次了，不过，有你在这里真好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_dd99fd32:

    # "Ole stands back up, and gets back to work."
    "奥利重新站起身，又回去继续工作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_6ce79733:

    # o "Remember to come tonight. We'll be waiting for you."
    o "记得今晚过来。我们会等你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_b988d61b:

    # e "Well I'd maybe, uh. I'll- Uhem..."
    e "嗯，我也许，呃。我——咳嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_d979735b:

    # "You have no idea what your brain is doing, but it's not going great. Only a mush of words comes out of your mouth, leaving the lion confused."
    "你完全不知道自己的脑子在搞什么，但情况显然不太妙。你嘴里只挤出一团乱七八糟的话，把那头狮子弄得一头雾水。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_7b40b6b8:

    # e "I'll go with you guys next tim-"
    e "下次我也跟你们一——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_2772e2e6:

    # s "Why?"
    s "为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_e7c62786:

    # "The sudden injection of the lion caught you off guard. His tone is much more firm and stern than you're used to."
    "那头狮子突然插话，让你措手不及。他的语气比你平时听到的更加坚定而严厉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_0c2167bd:

    # e "I'll need to uhm... attend other businesses."
    e "我还得，呃……去处理别的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_48ee2f5e:

    # s "But I'm your buddy, right?"
    s "可我可是你的朋友，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_9dab544e:

    # e "Seb. I'm still here, I'll go with you whenever I'm ready."
    e "塞巴斯。我还在这儿，等我准备好了就会跟你去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_3f62caac:

    # s "But I have been always ready for you."
    s "可我一直都准备好陪你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_e3b78845:

    # "Sebas stares at you, his mouth hangs agape. All the while Ole furrows his brows, interjecting."
    "塞巴斯瞪着你，嘴巴大张着。与此同时，奥利皱起眉头，插话道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_b9dc0dbc:

    # o "Stop with the whining, Seb. Let him decide for himself."
    o "别再抱怨了，塞巴斯。让他自己决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_13f9f9d1:

    # "The shop soon becomes silent as Ole finishes his sentence."
    "奥利说完后，店里很快安静下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_94cdc7f3:

    # "Sebas is still in shock. You didn't expect his reaction to be this strong. But he slowly calms down."
    "塞巴斯仍处于震惊之中。你没想到他的反应会这么强烈。但他慢慢平静了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_27e73340:

    # s "I- uhm... yes. Well, sorry if I acted strange."
    s "我、呃……是的。刚才我表现得有点奇怪，抱歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_568de443:

    # e "You're fine with this... right?"
    e "你没问题吧……对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_1dfecf4f:

    # s "I am. I'll probably just wait until the frivolous lizard is done with his inventory and we'll go to the Tavern."
    s "没问题。我大概会等那条轻浮的蜥蜴清点完货，然后我们一起去酒馆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_8b3306bf:

    # "The lion shifts back to his lively self quite quickly, as opposed to your expectation."
    "没想到那头狮子这么快就恢复了平时的活泼劲儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_6cf859cd:

    # o "Well, this frivolous lizard isn't going to bring your drunk butt back home if you're still bubbling with your gabby mouth."
    o "不过，如果你那张嘴还在喋喋不休，这条轻浮的蜥蜴可不会把你这个醉鬼背回家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_3e7345d4:

    # s "Ha, he can't even beat a drunk lion in that disk game."
    s "哈，在那种掷盘游戏里，他连喝醉的狮子都赢不了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_840e3118:

    # s "He lost to me last time we did, it was soooo embarrassing. I was drunk as hell and I drank like a full barrel of that beer."
    s "上次我们玩的时候，他输给了我，真是丢脸死了。我当时醉得不行，还喝了整整一桶那种啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_dca3d84f:

    # o "I only lost because you begged me to take it easy to impress that someone else."
    o "我只是因为你求我手下留情，好在别人面前显摆，才输掉的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_b76b0d97:

    # s "Excuses!"
    s "借口！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_73679941:

    # o "Believe it or not, there was one time when we went there, you got so drunk you basically fell on the pile of bottles."
    o "信不信由你，有一次我们去那儿时，你醉得几乎直接栽进了那堆瓶子里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_dfe223d8:

    # s "That's not relevant to what we're talking about, you lost!"
    s "这和我们现在说的事没关系，你输了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_aec64dd0:

    # "You are not sure if Seb is still angry over your answer... but seeing him back to his old self is certainly a bit of relief."
    "你不确定塞巴斯是不是还在为你的回答生气……但看到他恢复原状，确实让你松了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_4d60299f:

    # e "Uhmm..." nointeract
    e "呃……" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_4e3b1024:

    # e "Give some credit to Seb, I think he may have really nailed the throw."
    e "替塞巴斯说句公道话吧，我觉得他那一掷可能真的投得很准。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_4955614c:

    # s "See? Even [e] agrees with my amazing talent at throwing."
    s "看吧？连[e]都认同我惊人的投掷天赋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_8eaac967:

    # o "Don't get flattered. [e] is just being polite after you threw a tantrum at him just minutes ago."
    o "别得意了。[e]只是在你几分钟前朝他发了一通脾气之后，出于礼貌才这么说的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_846da231:

    # s "Heh, if this is being polite then I'd gladly tantrum all over [e]... Is there something as tantruming?"
    s "嘿，要是这也算礼貌，那我倒乐意在[e]身上大闹一通……有“闹脾气”这种说法吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_7aa043d6:

    # s "Hey, that's not fair, I don't see him as rude at any point."
    s "嘿，这不公平，我可从没觉得他有哪怕一刻粗鲁过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_6b2c6c12:

    # e "I wasn't just being polite, I genuinely believe in Seb."
    e "我不只是出于礼貌，我是真心相信塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_0972165c:

    # s "Aww... Don't worry, [e]. Ole is just salty that I am your favourite roomie."
    s "呜……别担心，[e]。奥利只是因为我是你最喜欢的室友而吃醋罢了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_4190e869:

    # s "His aiming was so fucking bad he hit a dude's crotch from the other side of the tavern. It's amazing actually how you can do that."
    s "他的准头烂得他妈的离谱，隔着整个酒馆都能打中一个男人的裆部。说真的，居然能做到这种事，也算厉害。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_7c14b01d:

    # o "Ok, you should go back to attend your table now before I take over the shop and kick you out of it."
    o "好了，你现在该回去照看你的桌子了，不然我就接管这家店，再把你赶出去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_ad3df93e:

    # s "Oh No! I'm so scared!. Ha."
    s "哦，不！我好害怕啊！哈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_647b2edc:

    # "He turns back at you and gives your hand a huge squeeze."
    "他转身看向你，用力握了握你的手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_709f2726:

    # e "I don't think Ole's gonna unintentionally be that bad, and I doubt Seb's going to remember the score that vividly when he's drunk."
    e "我觉得奥利不至于在无意间表现得那么差，而且我也不觉得塞巴斯喝醉后还能把比分记得那么清楚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_82c985ec:

    # s "Really? Don't get fooled by this guy's appearance, he's a master of sucking at tavern games I tell you buddy."
    s "真的吗？可别被这家伙的外表骗了，他酒馆游戏玩得菜得很，我跟你说，伙计。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_4190e869_1:

    # s "His aiming was so fucking bad he hit a dude's crotch from the other side of the tavern. It's amazing actually how you can do that."
    s "他的准头烂得他妈的离谱，隔着酒馆都能打中一个人的胯下。说真的，你居然能做到这种事，也太神奇了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_b55f9515:

    # o "[e] said it. You're too complacent just because I played one game badly."
    o "[e]都这么说了。你不会就因为我有一场表现很差，就放松警惕了吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_c16d75f7:

    # "Wait, Ole, you actually lost to a drunk Seb?"
    "等等，奥利，你居然输给了喝醉的塞巴斯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_0af7971f:

    # o "No... I mean, the ball there was chipped, it steered off mid-way there."
    o "不……我的意思是，那里的球有缺口，中途自己偏了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_092a91d2:

    # s "See? I told you, it actually happened. Maybe you should join us next time so we can hang out, and see how bad this little lizard throws."
    s "看吧？我就说了，事情确实是这样。下次你也来跟我们一起玩吧，顺便看看这只小蜥蜴的投掷到底有多差。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_5b6a776e:

    # e "O-okay! But I'll bet on Ole over a drunk lion any other day."
    e "好、好吧！不过换作任何一天，我都会押奥利赢过一头醉醺醺的狮子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_fee87e41:

    # s "Ha, you'll see, you'll see, you naughty little roomie."
    s "哈，你等着瞧，你等着瞧，你这个调皮的小室友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_5fa0ad10:

    # o "At least [e] has my back."
    o "至少[e]是站在我这边的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_257b64f0:

    # "Ole gives you a gentle smile."
    "奥利朝你温和地笑了笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_54238028:

    # s "Anyway, we shouldn't keep [e] here too long."
    s "总之，我们不能让[e]在这里待太久。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_61578aba:

    # s "But you have to remember to let me know when you have time, alright?"
    s "不过你有空的时候一定要记得告诉我，好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_dbd14c20:

    # e "Yes, thanks Seb."
    e "好，谢谢你，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Quest_Begin_747ca868:

    # s "Hehe."
    s "嘿嘿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_e5c53a7f:

    # s "Gooooo-d Fu-"
    s "好——好他妈——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_81988f9c:

    # "Sebas pauses."
    "塞巴斯停了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_adb35810:

    # s "Anyway, [e]! we were just going to head out. Want to join us here?"
    s "总之，[e]！我们正准备出门呢。你要不要在这里和我们一起走？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_1e2e50da:

    # e "I thought you two were there...?"
    e "我还以为你们两个已经在那里了……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_0d1213a8:

    # o "If it didn't take Seb so long to pack his stuff we'd be there already."
    o "要不是塞巴斯收拾东西花了那么久，我们早就到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_5a19c34d:

    # s "You're making me so nervous here looking at me all the time."
    s "你一直盯着我看，搞得我好紧张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_e67c3e48:

    # "The lizard looks away as he opens the door for both you and Seb."
    "蜥蜴人移开视线，同时为你和塞巴斯打开门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_9d103852:

    # s "Forget it, let's go..."
    s "算了，我们走吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_467b9970:

    # "The bell on the door clanks as you three have arrived at the Nocturnal Trunk."
    "当你们三人来到“夜夜椿”时，门上的铃铛叮当作响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_5879c31b:

    # "You are beginning to anticipate the familiar scent of alcohol and meat, the frequented patrons wave at you, seemingly greeting a familiar face here."
    "你开始期待起那熟悉的酒肉香味，常来的客人纷纷向你挥手，仿佛在向一位熟面孔打招呼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_25febc16:

    # "Sebas swiftly finds an empty table at the center of the tavern."
    "塞巴斯迅速在酒馆中央找到一张空桌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_da63231b:

    # o "Well, take a seat here, [e]."
    o "来，坐这儿吧，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_6e6c7174:

    # "Ole drags out a chair gently, gesturing you to sit between Ole and Sebas."
    "奥利轻轻拉出一把椅子，示意你坐到他和塞巴斯中间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_Before_Tavern_b457f085:

    # "You take the empty seat between the lion and the lizard."
    "你在狮子和蜥蜴之间的空位上坐下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_In_Tavern_59eb1747:

    # s "H-hey! Goooooo-d Fuckin- Morning- [e]-."
    s "嘿——嘿！早——早他妈——早上好，[e]——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_In_Tavern_a44e2294:

    # o "Heya!"
    o "嘿！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_In_Tavern_a8687385:

    # "You notice the two familiar faces in the Tavern, one is Sebas, and the other Ole. You wave at them, heartily walking towards the two shopkeepers."
    "你注意到酒馆里的两张熟面孔，一个是塞巴斯，另一个是奥利。你向他们挥手，热情地朝两位店主走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_In_Tavern_da63231b:

    # o "Well, take a seat here, [e]."
    o "来，坐这儿吧，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_In_Tavern_6e6c7174:

    # "Ole drags out a chair gently, gesturing you to sit between Ole and Sebas."
    "奥利轻轻拉出一把椅子，示意你坐到他和塞巴斯中间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_In_Tavern_b457f085:

    # "You take the empty seat between the lion and the lizard."
    "你在狮子和蜥蜴之间的空位上坐下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_36503303:

    # "As you settle, you lean forwards in anticipation, waiting for shopkeepers to start talking."
    "你坐稳后，期待地向前倾身，等着两位店主开口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_12888e62:

    # "But immediately, you notice both of them are staring towards your posture, causing you to sit up straight."
    "但你立刻注意到，他们两个都盯着你的坐姿，让你连忙坐直了身子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_077e4f7e:

    # e "Are you two doing alright?"
    e "你们两个还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_fa3369f3:

    # s "Yep. So very alright, I've finally got my favorite roommate out."
    s "嗯，好得不得了，我终于把我最喜欢的室友带出来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_817bf605:

    # o "Not as so when I waited for almost an hour for Seb to actually get going."
    o "可不如我等塞巴斯终于准备好出门时那么好，我差不多等了一个小时。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_71274785:

    # s "Hey, that's not my problem at all. It wasn't even evening and you closed the shop much earlier than usual."
    s "嘿，那完全不是我的问题。那时候甚至还没到晚上，你却比平时早得多关了店。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f266a1e6:

    # o "That should give you more time to organize your bags, not the other way around."
    o "这样你就该有更多时间整理行李，怎么反倒成了这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_c8291b9a:

    # e "You two usually come here at this time right?"
    e "你们两个平时这个时间会来这里，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3ff5b22f:

    # s "Well, Ole and I come here on the weekend."
    s "我和奥利周末会来这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_789821da:

    # s "It's usually just me who comes to drink here on the weekend, sometimes I can get Ole to go with me, but it's not like he's drinking beer."
    s "通常周末只有我会来这里喝酒，有时我能叫上奥利一起，但他又不是来喝啤酒的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_377b4e17:

    # o "I'm just cruising, bread is good enough for me."
    o "我就是来闲逛的，面包对我来说就够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_77220bb9:

    # e "So, what are we doing here today?"
    e "所以，我们今天来这里做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_07aeee36:

    # s "We feast! That's what we do. That disk game looks available today, perhaps you should try it out."
    s "我们来大吃一顿！这就是我们来干的事。那个圆盘游戏今天好像能玩，也许你该试试。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_43f62810:

    # e "I suppose I have been in the Tavern more than a couple times."
    e "我想我来酒馆可不止两次了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_dd823823:

    # s "Yes but I can ask Cane to set up those little games here-"
    s "不过我可以让凯恩在这里安排那些小游戏——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4a2e9e09:

    # "Before Sebas finishes his sentence, you notice a familiar figure arriving to your table."
    "塞巴斯话还没说完，你就注意到一个熟悉的身影来到了你们桌边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_328bca85:

    # "It's Cane, you can smell his scent from afar without even looking at him."
    "是凯恩，不用看，你从老远就能闻到他的气味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_42a4f1c6:

    # s "Ha, talk of the devil."
    s "哈哈，说曹操曹操到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e2fcee74:

    # c "If it ain't my favorite customer and server on the same table! And the lizard fella too."
    c "哟，我最喜欢的客人和伙计居然坐在同一桌！还有这位蜥蜴老兄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e6f0d15c:

    # c "What'cha like, same one beer for the lion eh?"
    c "你要啥？给这位狮子老兄也来一杯啤酒，怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2982fb11:

    # s "The usual best dinner you have, and a pot of that hearty Hunter's Stew, with extra portions for my buddy right here."
    s "照常来你这儿最好的晚餐，再来一锅丰盛的猎人炖菜，给我这位兄弟多加一份。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0aea56b7:

    # s "And give me the best of the best beer! I'm gonna get so fucking drunk tonight."
    s "再给我来最好的啤酒！今晚我要他妈的喝个酩酊大醉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_d0ba4de7:

    # "Cane chuckles as he writes down his order on a piece of paper."
    "凯恩一边在纸上记下他的点单，一边咯咯笑着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0ed78ac8:

    # c "Sure, and lizard, ye in fer a treat today. We've got some rye bread fresh out of the oven."
    c "当然，蜥蜴，今天你有口福了。我们刚出炉的黑麦面包还热乎着呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_742c0d23:

    # o "Alright, then I'll have two... or three."
    o "好吧，那我就要两块……或者三块。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_9699b64d:

    # "Ole smirks."
    "奥利咧嘴一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_00e144f4:

    # o "And give me some water please."
    o "再给我来点水，谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_1b77bffb:

    # o "It's fine, I'll just get a piece of maslin as usual."
    o "没事，我照常吃一块马斯林就行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_26c33441:

    # "Ole looks around, before reluctantly turning back to Cane."
    "奥利环顾四周，然后不情不愿地转回去面对凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_fab51459:

    # c "We're on it."
    c "马上来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_08f29f2b:

    # c "And lad, anything yer like?" nointeract
    c "小伙子，你想来点什么？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_380e1b70:

    # e "I'll have some Ale."
    e "我要来点麦芽酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e23e59a8:

    # "Cane raises his brows slightly."
    "凯恩微微挑了挑眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_cfb5d9ba:

    # c "Ain't cha hardy little fella. Alright, ale it is."
    c "你还真是个硬气的小家伙。行，那就来麦芽酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_fec3a6c8:

    # e "I'll have a Beer."
    e "我要一杯啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2571af92:

    # s "You can have mine, heh. I've ordered lots of them just for me and you!"
    s "你可以喝我的，嘿嘿。我可是专门为你我俩点了好多杯呢！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b4aa80a0:

    # c "Then one more for the lad. How ya say, lion."
    c "那就再给这小伙子来一杯。狮子老兄，你说呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_9ed6a67b:

    # s "Well, my beer is his and his beer is mine."
    s "我的啤酒就是他的，他的啤酒就是我的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_090dd8da:

    # "Sebas gives you a wink."
    "塞巴斯朝你眨了眨眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_374dc113:

    # e "I'll just get some bread."
    e "我去拿点面包就好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3f23e772:

    # c "Oh? Not drinking tonight eh?"
    c "哦？今晚不喝酒了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5588b171:

    # o "He's staying sober so we can both drag Seb back home."
    o "他得保持清醒，这样我们俩才能把塞巴斯拖回家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_50ec86c1:

    # c "Well we have rooms here."
    c "不过我们在这儿有房间啊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b934df3b:

    # s "Not today, Cane. I have my best buddy [e] here, isn't that right."
    s "今天不行，凯恩。我有我最好的伙伴[e]在这儿，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b1600753:

    # c "Alright then, we've got yer order."
    c "好吧，那就按你们的点单来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_920aaa73:

    # c "And lad, remember to check us out more often, we've got a nice job fer ya."
    c "小伙子，记得常来照顾我们的生意，我们这儿有份不错的活儿给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f6d29648:

    # "Cane turns back towards his counter, preparing food and drinks for your table."
    "凯恩转身回到柜台，开始为你们这桌准备食物和饮料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b6a4e718:

    # e "So... what's a Hunter's Stew?"
    e "那么……什么是猎人炖菜？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4eeb26c6:

    # s "Oh? Didn't you work for the Tavern for quite a while? You should know that already."
    s "哦？你不是在酒馆干了挺长一段时间吗？这个你应该早就知道了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_d0ed9dcc:

    # e "Hmmph... I didn't work in the kitchen, and it's not like Cane let me eat here. But it seems like the ingredients change every time I work here."
    e "哼……我又不是在厨房工作，而且凯恩也没让我在这儿吃过。不过，我每次来这里干活，里面的食材似乎都会变。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3552fea9:

    # s "Damn, how can he do that to [e]. The Hunter's Stew is pretty good here, but it depends on the day."
    s "该死，他怎么能这样对[e]。这里的猎人炖菜相当不错，不过得看当天的运气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ef29efe3:

    # e "W-why's that?"
    e "为、为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_9c1e9ccf:

    # s "The hunters... namely, Lothar and others alike. Brings in meat and ingredients they collected today, and Cane puts them into a single stew."
    s "猎人们……就是洛萨尔他们。把今天收集到的肉和食材带回来，再由凯恩把它们全放进同一锅炖菜里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_d02978f8:

    # s "If they get something good today, we'll get to taste something good."
    s "如果他们今天弄到了好东西，我们就能尝到好东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e607f57e:

    # e "And if they get nothing..."
    e "要是他们什么都没弄到呢……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8ec97c0e:

    # o "You'll still get something to eat, the stew is never emptied all the way, but it's replenished every day."
    o "你还是会有东西吃的。这锅炖菜从来不会彻底见底，不过每天都会补充。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_bb744a10:

    # e "S-so... I'll have something from yesterday's hunt?"
    e "所、所以……我会吃到昨天狩猎来的东西？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_437183f5:

    # "Ole nods."
    "奥利点点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0d6af7c0:

    # "The lion looks away for a second, and he smiles."
    "狮子移开视线片刻，然后笑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7784c33f:

    # s "Well there he goes, and here he comes."
    s "好了，他走过去了，现在又回来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0e952bec:

    # "The tavern keeper arrives at your table with a plate full of beer, with some bread on the side."
    "酒馆老板来到你们桌边，端来一托盘满满的啤酒，旁边还放着些面包。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_34e06233:

    # "Another plate comes with a variety of glistening meat pies, a pot of stew and a basket of fruits and tarts."
    "另一只盘子里装着各种油光闪亮的肉馅派、一锅炖菜，还有一篮水果和馅饼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_42ef230c:

    # "Soon, the table is filled to brim with food and drinks, with a very happy lion on the side, drooling."
    "很快，桌上就堆满了食物和饮料，旁边那头开心得流口水的狮子也在一旁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_10e77e86:

    # c "There ya go, enjoy the night fer me, young lads."
    c "你们替我好好享受今晚吧，小伙子们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0c0b5748:

    # s "Thanks a lot, Cane."
    s "多谢你，凯恩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_bdfd99e4:

    # "Cane chuckles, he gives the lion a pat on the shoulder, before leaving to serve another table."
    "凯恩轻笑一声，拍了拍狮子的肩膀，随后离开去招待另一桌客人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8ac20559:

    # o "So, anything interesting going on lately, [e]?"
    o "那么，最近有没有发生什么有趣的事，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_933802a0:

    # "Ole says as he scoops up a spoonful of the pottage, you can see him gulping down different ingredients cheerfully."
    "奥利一边舀起一勺炖菜，一边说道。只见他兴高采烈地把各种食材大口咽下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_75eae884:

    # e "I ran some errands for Haskell lately."
    e "我最近替哈斯克尔跑了几趟腿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0ec5b764:

    # s "Haskell? You mean the potions for our shop, right."
    s "哈斯克尔？你是说给咱们店准备的那些药剂，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_92f16cc0:

    # e "Yeah."
    e "嗯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0c8596ca:

    # "Ole stands and scoops up another portion onto your bowl, dropping a huge chunk of meat inside."
    "奥利站起身，又舀了一份炖菜到你的碗里，还放进一大块肉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_9e76e8ab:

    # "He doesn't need to speak, just gestures for you to take the stew from his hand."
    "他不需要开口，只是示意你从他手里接过炖菜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_63827e3f:

    # "You extend your arm to accept the bowl, only to lightly scrape against his scaled paws."
    "你伸手去接碗，却不小心轻轻擦过了他覆着鳞片的爪子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0614e2b7:

    # "He gasps and flinches a little before you wrap your paws around it, feeling the warmth emanating from the handsome lizard."
    "在你用爪子环住碗之前，他倒吸一口气，略微瑟缩了一下；你感受着那只英俊蜥蜴身上散发出的温度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_bd926702:

    # "Ole looks completely flustered, he puts the stew in front of you, as he sits and nudges against the back of his claws for some time."
    "奥利看起来窘迫极了。他把炖菜放到你面前，坐下后又用另一只爪子蹭着爪背，好一阵子都没停。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_83e07547:

    # "You take the bowl of stew from Ole, thanking him with a slight nod."
    "你接过奥利递来的炖菜，微微点头向他道谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_70fd2ab2:

    # s "Ha, we were actually collecting materials for ourselves before you came along."
    s "哈，我们其实是在你来之前才开始为自己收集材料的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5d17f933:

    # s "But it really feels like you're part of the shop now, getting us materials and all."
    s "不过现在真的感觉你已经是店里的一份子了，还帮我们弄来各种材料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_70d88f4d:

    # o "Yeah, we've got a lot of the strength potions sold so I'm just grateful [e] is here."
    o "是啊，我们卖出了不少力量药剂，所以我真庆幸[e]在这儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_09c40593:

    # e "And I'm happy that you didn't mind it taking some extra long time."
    e "而且我很高兴，你也不介意这事花的时间久了些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_d32d1b18:

    # "You slurp up the stew from your spoon, and you can feel the warmth of the variety of ingredients nourishing your whole body."
    "你用勺子啜着炖菜，能感受到各种食材的温暖滋养着全身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b28b9ca9:

    # "Meanwhile Sebas takes a bite out of the meaty pie. He never hesitates to show his messy side as oil and meat drips from his maw."
    "与此同时，塞巴斯咬了一口肉馅派。他从不介意展现自己邋遢的一面，油脂和肉汁不断从他嘴边滴落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f5177e50:

    # s "Mhmm... yes."
    s "嗯……是的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7618b353:

    # "He wipes away the mess with his palm, the lion notices you staring at him and grins foolishly at you."
    "他用手掌擦去嘴边的狼藉，狮子注意到你正盯着他，便傻乎乎地朝你咧嘴一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ca17821d:

    # o "Well, I know it's just Haskell, he's mostly the one that takes his time, letting things go on their full course and all."
    o "嗯，我知道，这就是哈斯克尔。他大多时候都喜欢慢慢来，任事情完整地进行下去什么的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_977ef296:

    # o "He has been like this since I first met him, just habits of an old dragon."
    o "从我第一次认识他起，他就一直这样，只是老龙的习惯罢了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_cfc3cca9:

    # "Sebas burps as Ole continues talking."
    "奥利继续说着话，塞巴斯打了个嗝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_da20e945:

    # e "Yeah, and sometimes I just have tea with him in the forest."
    e "是啊，有时候我就和他在森林里喝茶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_1554f512:

    # o "Hmm... You know, Haskell picked up on tea making only after I met him."
    o "嗯……你知道吗，我遇见哈斯克尔之后，他才开始学着泡茶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_c7bc4f23:

    # o "He has a vast amount of knowledge on potion-making, but he grew bored of it at some point."
    o "他对药剂制作的知识可丰富了，只是后来不知什么时候开始对此感到厌倦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_d2e89d3a:

    # o "I never talked to him about the potions anyway, the quality dropped pretty drastically since I asked you to bring them over."
    o "反正我从没和他聊过药剂的事，自从我让你把药剂送过来后，质量就明显下降了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f217dcc9:

    # s "Ha- sch-we'll. I 'e-tsh he's b-ushy making ano-tshker round of tea for hims-schelf."
    s "哈——是啊，我猜他正忙着给自己再沏一轮茶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_23ac7fee:

    # o "The potions are still as good as ever, but he doesn't sound too pleased when I come over to his hut."
    o "药剂还是一如既往地好，不过我去他的小屋找他时，他听起来可不怎么高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_54d346c1:

    # s "Ye-r, he deed ent even off-shr me that herbal t-ehe was-sh mak-ching, wha'a a shel-bish jer-ksh."
    s "是啊，他甚至都没请我喝他泡的那种草药茶，真是个自私的混蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3f7741bc:

    # s "N-ot st-hat I 'refsh-er te-a over my 'rec-shious be'er, h-heh."
    s "倒不是说我会把茶看得比我珍贵的啤酒还重要，嘿嘿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_602dd357:

    # "The lion talks with full mouth as he continues chewing through the meat, he doesn't even bother to enunciate his word clearly."
    "那头狮子嘴里塞满了肉，边嚼边说话，连把话说清楚都懒得费劲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_bf1397d1:

    # "He also mutters something else, but it was too indistinguishable from the sputtering sound of the pie."
    "他还咕哝了些什么，但那声音和馅饼发出的噗嗤声混在一起，根本听不清。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_acb8ad3e:

    # "Ole gives Sebas a side eye, the messy lion looks away, before swallowing the content silently."
    "奥利斜眼瞥了塞巴斯一下，那头邋遢的狮子移开视线，然后默默咽下了嘴里的食物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_014d1738:

    # e "Perhaps he just likes making tea for himself."
    e "也许他就是喜欢给自己泡茶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_21d3b1b4:

    # o "Well, the dragon did promise us he'd help with the shop when the shop first opened."
    o "不过，店刚开张时，那条龙确实答应过要帮我们打理店铺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_64b43af2:

    # o "But I can't blame him for losing his passion..."
    o "但我也不能怪他失去了热情……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e2a6e272:

    # "A new idea comes across your mind, and that it might actually help both Ole and Haskell."
    "你突然有了个新想法，而且这或许真的能同时帮到奥利和哈斯克尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_1bfef146:

    # e "You know what? I think there's a way that both of you'd be satisfied..."
    e "你知道吗？我觉得有个办法能让你们两个都满意……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4accbf46:

    # e "How about, ask Haskell to sell his tea in your shop?"
    e "不如让哈斯克尔把他的茶拿到你的店里卖？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4f68d8a3:

    # s "Oh? That's a good idea! We can make him sell his tea leaves and herbs, else those teas are gonna expire very quickly."
    s "哦？这主意不错！我们可以让他卖茶叶和香草，不然那些茶很快就要过期了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_be551bc2:

    # o "You're right, just the plants would suffice."
    o "你说得对，只卖那些植物就够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5f6bd161:

    # o "It's not going to sell that much like potions, but I bet some people in the town are going to like it a lot."
    o "虽然它不会像药剂那样卖得多，但我敢说镇上的一些人肯定会非常喜欢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e4baf75d:

    # e "I assure you, his tea is really great!"
    e "我向你保证，他的茶真的很棒！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e67aa920:

    # s "I don't doubt that, roomie. We'll have to take some notes, perhaps we should talk to the sleazy old dragon later."
    s "我不怀疑，室友。我们得记点东西，也许之后该去和那条下流的老龙谈谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f9e1607e:

    # "Sebas takes a mouthful of the beer, leaving remnants of white foams on his snout."
    "塞巴斯喝了一大口啤酒，口鼻上留下了些许白色泡沫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_97897f02:

    # o "Alright, so... anything else?"
    o "好了，那么……还有别的事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f24f830b:

    # "You take a sip out of the Ale you ordered, the bitter and barley scent of the drink entices your snout, but the bitterness is too strong as you choke a bit."
    "你抿了一口自己点的麦芽酒，饮料苦涩的麦香钻进鼻腔，但苦味太重，你呛了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_945e6138:

    # "The lion and the lizard stare at you with concern before you gobble down the rest of the drink."
    "狮子和蜥蜴担忧地注视着你，然后你把剩下的饮料一饮而尽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_9f2eb790:

    # "Surprisingly, there's an aftertaste of the mellow and fruity sweetness emanating from within your throat, it was quite a refreshing drink."
    "没想到，喉咙深处还留着一股醇和果香的甜味，回味清爽得很。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_00fe2196:

    # "You know you collected rosemary and barleys for the Ale, but you still wonder what other ingredients were put in there..."
    "你知道自己收集了迷迭香和大麦来酿制麦酒，但还是忍不住好奇，里面究竟还放了什么材料……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0eec26aa:

    # s "Haha [e], I told you the ale here is really good! And I heard you collected the ingredients for Cane, so it's extra good!"
    s "哈哈，[e]，我都说了，这里的麦酒特别好喝！而且我听说你还收集了凯恩的材料，所以味道更棒！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_76db36cd:

    # o "Oh? Really. Sad I didn't get to taste [e]'s Ale."
    o "哦？真的吗。真遗憾，我没能尝到[e]的麦酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a517443d:

    # s "Well O, the Ale is right in front of you."
    s "奥利，麦酒不就在你面前吗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_cfd10b34:

    # "The lizard quickly shakes his head."
    "蜥蜴飞快地摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4a29487d:

    # o "No, no. I told you I don't drink."
    o "不，不。我说过了，我不喝酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_34a36fc3:

    # "You take a cup of beer from Sebas' pile. And begin gulping them down, a few drops of the beer spills right on your chest."
    "你从塞巴斯那堆酒里拿了一杯啤酒，开始大口灌下去，几滴啤酒顺着杯沿洒到了你的胸口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_32f524c2:

    # s "Hey, take it easy, I- I don't even drink that fast."
    s "嘿，慢点，我——我可没喝得那么快。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_69a115fa:

    # o "Well, I'm sure [e] is going to be a little more careful with his cup than you do with half a dozen cups of beer here."
    o "我敢肯定，[e]拿着他的杯子时，会比你在这里连喝六杯啤酒时小心得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5de6c720:

    # "You put down the empty cup, licking off the white foam around your lips."
    "你放下空杯，舔掉嘴唇周围的白色泡沫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_907235ef:

    # e "What were you guys talking about...?"
    e "你们刚才在聊什么……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_92dc00c9:

    # o "Nothing at all."
    o "什么都没聊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8c58229d:

    # "You take a huge bite out of the bread in front of you, it was surprisingly soft and emitting a light scent of sourdough."
    "你狠狠咬了一大口面前的面包，没想到它异常松软，还散发着淡淡的酸面团香气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3a8b54b5:

    # e "O-oh, this is pretty good."
    e "呃——这个味道真不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_6a42fddc:

    # s "Take it slowly [e]. Cane adds so much sourdough from this bread you might as well get drunk from it."
    s "慢点吃，[e]。凯恩在这面包里加了太多酸面团，吃多了你简直会醉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_d5ffda26:

    # o "Well maybe that's why they're so good."
    o "嗯，也许这就是它们这么好吃的原因吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_1f321c6b:

    # "Ole taps the side of his head in front of Sebas with a slight chuckle."
    "奥利轻笑一声，当着塞巴斯的面敲了敲自己的脑袋侧面。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_bcf662f1:

    # s "Ha, well, [e]. Anything else going on with you?"
    s "哈，说起来，[e]，你最近还有别的事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_6bf7acdd:

    # "Sebas doesn't hesitate to guzzle down another cup of beer, beer leaking from his mouth right down to his lower jaw."
    "塞巴斯毫不犹豫地又灌下一杯啤酒，酒液从他嘴里一直漏到下颌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_62723546:

    # "Some of it drizzles on his loincloth, but he doesn't even seem to notice."
    "有些酒液滴落在他的缠腰布上，但他似乎完全没有察觉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8193e1c3:

    # s "A-ah... so-o good."
    s "啊……太——太好喝了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_31f6d6c2:

    # s "Damn, it's really fun to hang out with you, [e]. Despite the bad stuff, at least we get to know what's going on with you more!"
    s "该死，和你待在一起真的很开心，[e]。虽说发生了些糟心事，但至少我们能更多地了解你的近况了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_fa2493c1:

    # o "Well, [e], whenever you're free, you can definitely hang out with us!"
    o "嗯，[e]，你什么时候有空，都可以来和我们一起聚聚！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_55971e7b:

    # e "Thank you, you both are really flattering sometimes."
    e "谢谢，你们两个有时候真是把我夸得不好意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_c928cd03:

    # s "I feel we're slowly becoming like a family. I remembered when I first met Ole, he was shy as hell! He was sitting in the forest alone there."
    s "我觉得我们正在慢慢变得像一家人。我还记得第一次遇见奥利时，他害羞得要命！那时他正独自坐在森林里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_99cc5dc5:

    # o "That... that was so long ago, Seb."
    o "那……那都是很久以前的事了，塞巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_91ec9748:

    # s "Anyway, Ole here doesn't really like me talking about ancient histories."
    s "总之，奥利这家伙不太喜欢我讲那些陈年往事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7235e8d8:

    # o "And neither do you too."
    o "你也不喜欢啊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e9bf51d8:

    # s "Uhm, anyway, we both settled in Lusterfield after his thing, and the thing is, we've been living together for like a decade, I see him just like a family."
    s "呃，总之，那件事之后，我们俩都在卢斯特菲尔德安顿了下来。算起来，我们一起生活也有十年左右了，我早就把他当成家人了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_60d8a7c4:

    # s "Sure, we took in roomies from time to time, but if you can settle here for the years to come, we'd just be like... family."
    s "当然，我们偶尔也会收留一些室友，不过，如果你愿意在这里一直住下去，我们就会像……一家人一样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b4c2a050:

    # "Sebas screams in excitement, you wonder if he's drunk or if he means what he said, but his usual bright grin convinces you it's the latter."
    "塞巴斯兴奋得大叫起来，你不禁怀疑他是喝醉了，还是当真这么想；但他一如往常的灿烂笑容让你确信，是后者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f5f146c5:

    # e "I would like to live here for a long time too, Seb."
    e "我也想在这里长住，塞巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4ee1cd36:

    # s "Yeah! Stay for as looooooong as you wis-."
    s "好啊！你想待多久都行——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e83453c6:

    # "Sebas lets out a huge burp."
    "塞巴斯打了个响亮的嗝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_1a956796:

    # "You chuckle slightly towards the embarrassed lion, as Ole takes another huge chunk out of his bread, finishing off the basket with a few bites."
    "你对着尴尬的狮子轻轻笑了笑，而奥利又从面包上狠狠咬下一大口，几口就把篮子里的面包吃光了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2332f108:

    # "The table is almost cleared all the way, only a few cup of beer left standing, and a stuffed roommate."
    "桌上的东西几乎都清空了，只剩下几杯啤酒，还有一个吃撑了的室友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ca8c72de:

    # o "Looks like we're finished."
    o "看来我们吃完了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5e249759:

    # s "We did, now it's time for Skittles, come on, [e]."
    s "吃完了，现在该玩撞柱戏了，来吧，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a6959cc0:

    # "Sebas says with his glistening eyes, you have seen it played a couple times from when you work in the Tavern, but you still don't know how it works."
    "塞巴斯两眼放光地说道。你以前在酒馆工作时见过几次别人玩这个游戏，但还是不知道它到底怎么玩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2c6fe809:

    # o "Right, let's go then."
    o "那好，我们走吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7868f6ee:

    # "You follow the two towards a long lane in between tables of talking patrons, the floor seems to be varnished with shiny wax."
    "你跟着两人穿过一条长长的通道，两旁的食客正围桌闲聊，地板似乎打过一层闪亮的蜡。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a719eab1:

    # s "Don't you walk on the lane buddy, you're gonna slip and snap your back like a twig in winter."
    s "伙计，可别走上那条道，你会滑倒，脊椎还会像冬天的树枝一样啪地折断。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b3c71459:

    # s "Should be good for some games... [e], have you played it before?"
    s "应该挺适合玩几局的……[e]，你以前玩过吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5be0435d:

    # e "I've peeked at some patrons playing the game before, but I haven't tried it myself..."
    e "我以前偷看过一些客人玩，但自己还没试过……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7e227ca1:

    # s "Well, you're missing a lot of fun in your work, aren't you. We just put bottles on the floor, and guess what. You have got to roll the disks towards the bull's eye, not the real one."
    s "哎呀，你工作时可错过了不少乐趣，不是吗？我们只要把瓶子摆在地上，然后猜猜怎么着——你得把圆盘滚向靶心，不是真的牛眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_04c1ac6f:

    # o "You don't roll the disk, Seb. You'd just throw it there."
    o "你不是把圆盘滚过去，塞巴。你只会直接把它扔过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7bd532aa:

    # s "I know. I know. I'm explaining it to [e]. Mister advisor lizard. Plus, rolling it sounds like a better game."
    s "我知道，我知道。我这是在给[e]解释呢，顾问蜥蜴先生。而且，滚过去听起来更有意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b41469c6:

    # o "That's the rule in the Nocturnal Trun-"
    o "那是夜行特伦-的规则。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_02ceae5f:

    # s "Anyway, you just score more points the closer you get to the center."
    s "总之，离中心越近，得分就越高。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5ee55d1c:

    # "Sebas pauses, you notice that he raises his head slightly, and you can feel a shadow looms over you."
    "塞巴斯停了下来，你注意到他微微抬起头，感觉有阴影笼罩在你身上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_91e600dc:

    # "The lion and the lizard do not look exactly surprised, or scared. So you turn around, and you are greeted by a leather glove right in front of your face."
    "那头狮子和蜥蜴看起来既不算惊讶，也不算害怕。于是你转过身，迎面看到一只皮手套正挡在脸前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_bea82f78:

    # l "Did someone say throwing disks?"
    l "有人说要扔飞盘？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5900b8f6:

    # s "Nobody said that, you can go now."
    s "没人这么说，你现在可以走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5c2e3c26:

    # e "Good evening, Lothar, good to see you in the Tavern. You wanna join us?"
    e "晚上好，洛萨尔，很高兴在酒馆见到你。要不要加入我们？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f55f4763:

    # s "Hey-"
    s "嘿——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_cf610db7:

    # l "Well, I'll have to say, apart from being the hero of Lusterfield. I am also a master of tavern games."
    l "我得说，除了是卢斯特菲尔德的英雄之外，我还是酒馆游戏的大师。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3a54cc08:

    # l "S-so, how can you throw disks without the hero's demonstration!"
    l "所、所以，没有英雄亲自示范，你们怎么扔飞盘！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_afd579d2:

    # s "The disks rented from Cane are only enough for three of us."
    s "从凯恩那里租来的飞盘只够我们三个人用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_36b5b3ad:

    # o "And we can get a few more from Cane, it's very cheap-"
    o "而且我们还可以再从凯恩那里弄几个，便宜得很——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_853fc61d:

    # s "Ole! The fuck are you talking about. We have no more disks."
    s "奥利！你他妈在说什么？我们已经没有飞盘了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7383db3c:

    # l "It's quite unfortunate that our little lion here has no dicks."
    l "咱们这只小狮子没有鸡巴，确实挺不幸的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2210cb89:

    # s "You deaf or somethi-"
    s "你聋了还是怎——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_cca3b408:

    # l "It does show how he's afraid of losing to the hero of the village in a tavern game."
    l "这倒是说明，他害怕在酒馆游戏里输给村里的英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0beca0a9:

    # s "Say that again Lothar and I will break your dick after that last time we met."
    s "你再说一遍，洛萨尔。就因为上次见面那档子事，我要把你的鸡巴掰断。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_93e5e115:

    # l "You think I have forgotten the last time you went for the kick? Ha, that's right, you didn't even manage to do that."
    l "你以为我忘了上次你想踢我的事吗？哈，说得没错，你连那一下都没踢出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2a86b4c3:

    # s "I'm not playing your stupid game, Lothar."
    s "我才不玩你那破游戏，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_1729c931:

    # "Ole glances at you, pointing at the lion and the wolf as he furrows his brows, and you both let out an awkward chuckle."
    "奥利瞥了你一眼，皱着眉指了指那头狮子和那匹狼，你们两人都尴尬地干笑起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0be971fe:

    # l "You already know who's going to win, Ha, ask my disciple, he knows who's a better skilled player."
    l "你已经知道谁会赢了。哈，问问我的徒弟，他知道谁的技术更好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_c1f73d0b:

    # s "I already know he's going to root for me, isn't it right, [e]?"
    s "我早就知道他会支持我，对吧，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a56e4394:

    # "Both of them suddenly look towards you, you look left and right, can't even believe you have to make the decision again..."
    "两人突然都看向你。你左右看了看，简直不敢相信自己又得做一次决定……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_da69e409:

    # e "U-uhmm...." nointeract
    e "呃、嗯……" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7423e89c:

    # e "I'd say... Lothar? He has... good aiming, afterall... I mean maybe."
    e "我觉得……洛萨尔？他的准头……不错，毕竟……我是说，也许吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_31773f76:

    # l "Ha, see, my disciple knows who's the best."
    l "哈，看吧，我的徒弟知道谁才是最厉害的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_d59b127a:

    # s "Well- let's see then, don't you lose this smug ass face when I beat you right here."
    s "好——那就看看吧，等我在这里打败你时，你这张自鸣得意的臭脸还能不能挂得住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_641aad9c:

    # "Sebas leaves as he walks to Cane and returns with some disks on his hand."
    "塞巴斯离开，走向凯恩，回来时手上带着几枚圆盘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_94de00ed:

    # s "Alright then."
    s "好，那就这样吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e1e1213f:

    # "He tosses the disks towards Lothar with full force, luckily Lothar catches them right before they smash into his face."
    "他使足全力把圆盘朝洛萨尔扔去，幸好洛萨尔在圆盘砸中他的脸之前接住了它们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ca6ed08a:

    # "Still surprised, you and Ole each take some disks from Sebas' pile."
    "你和奥利仍然有些惊讶，各自从塞巴斯那堆圆盘里拿了几枚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_19100b1d:

    # o "Looks like everything's all set up here. Any questions?"
    o "看起来一切都准备好了。还有什么问题吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_81e158e8:

    # e "Perhaps Sebas. H-he... is tough? I-I'm not sure."
    e "也许是塞巴斯。他、他很结实？我、我不太确定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7703985f:

    # l "My disciple, how does toughness even remotely play a role on one's bowlin-"
    l "我的徒弟，强韧怎么可能和保龄-"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ab4e63a8:

    # s "You've heard [e]. Now get the fuuu-ck off before embarrassing yourself."
    s "你听见了[e]。现在赶紧滚蛋，别再丢人现眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_78d52e56:

    # l "Uuuuugh-... Watch out for your balls, lion. I'll be sure to kick them off the next time I see you."
    l "呜呃——……小心你的蛋蛋，狮子。下次见到你时，我一定把它们踢掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3a2d9eb5:

    # "Lothar doesn't look pissed as you would imagine, instead he looks... defeated. His eyes unfocused."
    "洛萨尔看起来并没有像你想象中那样生气，反倒像是……被彻底击垮了。他的双眼失去了焦点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_affd37a6:

    # "A scaled hand latches on his shoulder, it's Ole."
    "一只覆鳞的手搭上他的肩膀，是奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_071b8a71:

    # o "Stay here, Lothar. I'll get you your disk."
    o "待在这儿，洛萨尔。我去拿你的圆盘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_32233a39:

    # l "W-well. At least someone knows to respect their hero."
    l "呃、好吧。至少还有人知道该尊重自己的英雄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7ad3dd54:

    # o "More people makes for more fun."
    o "人越多，乐子越多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_93bdcb28:

    # "As Ole walks towards the counter, Lothar stands in a weird pose between you and Sebas."
    "奥利朝柜台走去时，洛萨尔以一种古怪的姿势站在你和塞巴斯之间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_94f33275:

    # "Sebas looks away, and Lothar just stares at you silently. You are not even sure how you got into this position of choosing in between these two."
    "塞巴斯移开视线，洛萨尔只是默默地盯着你。你甚至不知道自己是怎么陷入在这两人之间做选择的境地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_cfebc4df:

    # "But you are constantly dragged into it. Deep down you want them to hang around nicely, at least not arguing and getting mad at each other all the time."
    "可你总是被卷进来。说到底，你希望他们能好好相处，至少别总是争吵、互相发火。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ebe08bff:

    # "You thought comes to a pause as Ole arrives with a few different coloured disks. He hands some to the flustered wolf before taking a few for himself."
    "奥利拿着几枚不同颜色的圆盘回来，你的思绪也暂时停了下来。他把几枚递给那只手足无措的狼，然后又拿了几枚给自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3a4dc32e:

    # o "Any questions...?"
    o "还有什么问题……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8cb648fa:

    # s "Well, there's one right there."
    s "嗯，那边不就有一个吗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_cdfe7c8d:

    # "He points towards the wolf."
    "他指向那只狼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3ac6429a:

    # l "Cry more, lion. You're gonna prepare for when you lose against the hero."
    l "尽管哭吧，狮子。你得为输给英雄做好准备。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f9d1612d:

    # "You awkwardly stand in between the arguing pair, as Ole hands you and Sebas each three disks."
    "你尴尬地站在这对争吵的两人中间，奥利则把三枚圆盘分别递给你和塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f4e43177:

    # e "Uh... one question... how do I get a good score?"
    e "呃……我有一个问题……怎样才能拿到高分？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_27b26c68:

    # s "Just aim, buddy."
    s "瞄准就行，老兄。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_83592bdf:

    # "Sebas smiles as Ole furrows his brows."
    "塞巴斯微笑着，奥利皱起了眉头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_dde4f362:

    # o "Well, aside from your aiming, you also need to have enough {color=#d1e431}Strength{/color} to knock them down. Of course, {color=#d1e431}Agility{/color} definitely can help you aim better."
    o "不过，除了准头，你还得有足够的{color=#d1e431}力量{/color}把它们击倒。当然，{color=#d1e431}敏捷{/color}也绝对能帮你瞄得更准。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5d1560c0:

    # o "Start at any position and just throw the disk out, see if you can get close to the bull's eye."
    o "从任意位置开始，把圆盘扔出去，看看能不能接近靶心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a08af25b:

    # o "And we'll play twelve rounds, three for each of us."
    o "我们要玩十二轮，每人三轮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5e402f5e:

    # l "Yeah, we know how to play the game, let's get started already."
    l "对，我们都知道怎么玩，赶紧开始吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_d7f3f7b5:

    # o "I'll go first then, Lothar next. [e]'s the third, and Sebas last."
    o "那我先来，接着是洛萨尔。[e]排第三，塞巴斯最后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8d288ac4:

    # "Ole says as he writes down your names on a piece of yellow paper, before holding a disk for himself."
    "奥利说着，把你们的名字写在一张黄色纸上，然后拿起一个圆盘。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_fef43b66:

    # "The game is finished, as Sebas and Lothar finish the last sips of their beer."
    "游戏结束了，塞巴斯和洛萨尔喝完了啤酒的最后几口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_239da954:

    # "Their cheeks are all red now, eyes barely open, you're almost surprised how they're more peaceful after drinking."
    "他们的脸颊都红了，眼睛几乎睁不开；你差点要惊讶于他们喝酒后反而更加平静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b7684bc4:

    # "Ole reads out the score he gets from the paper..."
    "奥利照着纸念出自己的得分……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_9a940510:

    # o "Ahem..."
    o "咳嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f3ae1574:

    # l "Well, unsurprisingly we all know who's going to win..."
    l "嗯，毫不意外，大家都知道谁会赢……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_63329c07:

    # o "Ehrem, you're right, Lothar with [winnerScore] score won the game."
    o "呃，你说得对，洛萨尔以[winnerScore]分赢下了比赛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_31835e28:

    # "Ole claps with the paper still in his hand, Sebas soon follows suit, albeit sluggishly."
    "奥利手里还拿着那张纸，却拍起手来；塞巴斯很快也跟着拍了起来，只是动作有些迟缓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_58d1b620:

    # s "Mhmmm..."
    s "嗯嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7da75df6:

    # e "Congrats!"
    e "恭喜！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_dd8ac827:

    # o "Oh! I won, alright, with [winnerScore] score, congratulations to me!"
    o "哦！我赢了，没错，以[winnerScore]分获胜，恭喜我自己！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_31835e28_1:

    # "Ole claps with the paper still in his hand, Sebas soon follows suit, albeit sluggishly."
    "奥利手里还拿着那张纸，却拍起手来；塞巴斯很快也跟着拍了起来，只是动作有些迟缓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a109afb3:

    # l "Did we just lost to this fucking lizard, what is even going on..."
    l "我们刚刚输给了这只该死的蜥蜴？到底怎么回事……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8ccf3541:

    # l "Hey, lion. You just lost."
    l "喂，狮子。你刚输了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_991700df:

    # o "Hey! [e] just won the game with [winnerScore] score. That's quite a lot of score."
    o "嘿！[e]刚赢了比赛，得了[winnerScore]分。这分数可真高。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_31835e28_2:

    # "Ole claps with the paper still in his hand, Sebas soon follows suit, albeit sluggishly."
    "奥利手里还拿着那张纸，却拍起手来；塞巴斯很快也跟着拍了起来，只是动作有些迟缓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_c7e16cdc:

    # e "Aw... thanks."
    e "啊……谢谢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f0a2101b:

    # l "Ugh, I swear my disciple has not surpassed me in any other form except this useless game."
    l "啧，我敢发誓，我的弟子除了这场毫无意义的游戏，其他方面从未超过我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_9d88eefa:

    # l "It's for fun anyway."
    l "反正只是玩玩而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ae29b257:

    # l "As long as the winner is not this lion."
    l "只要获胜者不是这头狮子就行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8a0c400a:

    # o "Seb won with [winnerScore] score, hmm."
    o "塞巴斯以[winnerScore]分获胜，嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_31835e28_3:

    # "Ole claps with the paper still in his hand, Sebas soon follows suit, albeit sluggishly."
    "奥利手里还拿着那张纸拍手，塞巴斯很快也跟着拍了起来，只是动作有些迟缓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_d554f216:

    # l "Why are you clapping to yourself... lion. Ugh, the ego on this guy."
    l "你干吗对着自己鼓掌……狮子。啧，这家伙自我感觉也太良好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ed0637d0:

    # "Lothar shakes Sebas' shoulder, who is still licking up the beer foam from the obviously empty cup."
    "洛萨尔摇了摇塞巴斯的肩膀，而塞巴斯还在舔那只明显已经空了的杯子里的啤酒泡沫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b8ec32b7:

    # e "I think he's drunk."
    e "我觉得他喝醉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ba837cd5:

    # o "The second place is [fstrunner] with [fstrunnerScore] score."
    o "第二名是[fstrunner]，得分[fstrunnerScore]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_eefa8452:

    # l "At least I'm still better than this stupid lion..."
    l "至少我还是比这头蠢狮子强……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f60f4ff0:

    # o "That's me! What a pleasant surprise."
    o "是我！真是个愉快的惊喜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_6188cf18:

    # l "Ugh, I just got a little rusty."
    l "啧，只是有点生疏了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4e9d0473:

    # "Lothar turns to the drunk lion again as he collapses and passes out on the floor."
    "洛萨尔再次转向那头醉醺醺的狮子，这时狮子倒在地上，昏了过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0dee1666:

    # e "Is... Seb alright?"
    e "塞巴斯没事吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8cc0eb0c:

    # o "Yeah, I think so. He's just sleeping."
    o "嗯，我想没事。他只是睡着了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b28fbf16:

    # l "And he's not listening to me. Hey, dumbass lion. Stupid ass lion. Say nothing if you love dicks."
    l "而且他根本没在听我说。喂，你这蠢狮子。笨蛋狮子。喜欢鸡巴就别说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8d12f8e6:

    # "It doesn't seem like Sebas is answering him anytime soon."
    "看起来塞巴斯一时半会儿是不会回应他了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3c3869c0:

    # l "Yes we all know that, hmm... Give me your pen, lizard."
    l "是啊，我们都知道，嗯……把你的笔给我，蜥蜴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_589b751f:

    # o "Oh? Don't go overboard with the drawing, Lot."
    o "哦？画画可别太过火了，洛特。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_18f985a3:

    # l "Hah- You can hope."
    l "哈——你做梦吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_046062c3:

    # e "W-what are you doing, Lothar?"
    e "洛、洛萨尔，你在干什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_aecaf94c:

    # l "Revenge."
    l "报仇。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_22d875df:

    # "Lothar takes the pen from Ole's hand, and he sits on top of Sebas' chest, getting incredibly close to Sebas face."
    "洛萨尔从奥利手中拿过笔，坐到塞巴斯胸口上，凑得离他的脸极近。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_cb164bd2:

    # "He's not being subtle, neither is he afraid of Sebas waking up, Lothar begins to scribble, staining Sebas' orange fur with black ink."
    "他毫不遮掩，也不怕把塞巴斯弄醒，便开始胡乱涂画，黑色墨水染上了塞巴斯的橙色毛发。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_09c75d17:

    # l "This is good, look."
    l "这个不错，你看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b64cb21c:

    # "Watching from behind Lothar, you can see a... cock-shaped doodle being drawn dangerously close to the lion's mouth."
    "从洛萨尔身后看去，你能看到一个阴茎形状的涂鸦，正被画在离这头狮子的嘴巴极近、危险的位置。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_794da077:

    # "Looking from afar, Ole seems to be laughing along with you and Ole as he stares at Lothar's scribblings."
    "远远看去，奥利盯着洛萨尔的涂鸦，似乎正和你一起笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f216c6f4:

    # "And Lothar draws a knot at the base of the shaft."
    "洛萨尔还在那根肉棒的根部画了个结。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_48ca783a:

    # l "That's my cock in your face, stupid lion."
    l "那是我的鸡巴，正对着你的脸，蠢狮子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_9d50ba3c:

    # "You can see Sebas feeling something itchy on his face, his tongue sticks out and licks around the... cock-shaped doodle."
    "你看见塞巴斯似乎觉得脸上有点痒，伸出舌头舔着那……鸡巴形状的涂鸦周围。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_04ac6c56:

    # l "Ha, he likes it, how does it taste, S-Seb."
    l "哈，他喜欢上了。味道怎么样，塞、塞巴斯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_45659dcd:

    # "Lothar stands back up, returning Ole his pen. He looks at both of you, unaware that you both are staring at the slight bulge in his crotch."
    "洛萨尔重新站直，把笔还给奥利。他看向你们两人，却没意识到你们都在盯着他胯下微微隆起的部位。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_20cf17cc:

    # o "Uhm... Alright. We should take Sebas home, Tavern people are watching us."
    o "呃……好吧。我们该带塞巴斯回家了，酒馆里的人都在看我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_23f58107:

    # l "Alright, but don't you clean that masterpiece off, it's too funny."
    l "行，但别把那幅杰作擦掉，太好笑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a4d3a316:

    # s "m-mpph..."
    s "唔—唔……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_fc590117:

    # "Sebas turns and tugs on Lothar's leg, drooling on his leather shoes."
    "塞巴斯转过身，拽着洛萨尔的腿，还把口水流到了他的皮鞋上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_934e1724:

    # l "Ugh, you really need to bring him home now. Why was he drinking so much beer if he can't even handle it."
    l "啧，你现在真得把他带回家了。他既然喝不了那么多，干吗还喝这么多啤酒？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_43528d6f:

    # "Lothar turns his attention to you."
    "洛萨尔把注意力转向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2d87b042:

    # l "Regardless, I'll stay in the Tavern for a while."
    l "不管怎样，我会在酒馆待一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_95b4b8f4:

    # e "Your cheeks are still red, Lothar."
    e "你的脸颊还是红红的，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ddab4664:

    # l "Disciple, do I look like I'm gonna collapse at any moment?"
    l "弟子，我看起来像是随时会倒下吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_13be631e:

    # o "No, but you seem like you need to rest."
    o "不，但你看起来需要休息。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_fe390d70:

    # "Lothar chides, and he points his finger towards your direction."
    "洛萨尔斥责道，手指朝你这边指来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_904e3637:

    # l "Lizard can bring the lion back, you want to stay here for a while?" nointeract
    l "蜥蜴能把狮子带回去，你想在这里待一会儿吗？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3b4410f8:

    # e "I can stay for a while."
    e "我可以待一会儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a23c26a2:

    # o "Hmm... I'll take Seb home by myself then."
    o "嗯……那我就自己带塞巴斯回家了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e2d8abfa:

    # o "And you two, don't stay up for too long."
    o "还有你们两个，别熬太晚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_1be2aaff:

    # "You and Ole nod towards each other, and Ole begins tugging at Sebas."
    "你和奥利相互点了点头，奥利开始拉扯塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_1431c8b4:

    # "Lothar leads you to the counter in front of the tavern keeper."
    "洛萨尔带你走到酒馆老板面前的柜台旁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2ebbdd22:

    # c "Aye-, back from tha- little disk game, eh?"
    c "哟——玩完那个小圆盘游戏回来了，是吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_c3bb79f4:

    # e "Yeah, Ole's taking Seb back home. He's quite drunk."
    e "是啊，奥利正带塞巴斯回家。他醉得不轻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_348142a4:

    # c "Bummer, he could-a stay here for a while. What about ya two? Drank a lot?"
    c "真可惜，他本来还能在这儿待一会儿。你们两个呢？喝了很多吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b8dc9e5c:

    # l "Not as much as that stupid lion did."
    l "没那头蠢狮子那么多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_acbbb770:

    # c "Good. Then, enjoy the rest o- yer night. I gotta run errands for these hungry patrons."
    c "好吧。那就好好享受今晚剩下的时间吧。我得去给这些饿肚子的客人跑跑腿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7976d7a7:

    # "Cane quickly leaves you two alone with a few extra cup of beer."
    "凯恩很快把你们俩单独留下，还多留了几杯啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_259f3a9f:

    # l "Mmmph... What do you think?"
    l "唔……你觉得呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_888eb8a6:

    # e "Oh?"
    e "哦？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3a0107d6:

    # l "Why did you choose to stay here."
    l "你为什么选择留在这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f2409aac:

    # e "I just thought you wanted someone to hang out with."
    e "我只是以为你想找个人陪着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_17475449:

    # l "I have Amble and Jog. They just ditched me today to patrol the farm, as they said."
    l "我还有安布和乔格。他们今天刚把我丢下，说是要去巡逻农场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_410cdcaf:

    # "Lothar takes a gulp of the beer."
    "洛萨尔喝了一大口啤酒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e3255443:

    # l "But fair enough, your hero will accept your reasoning."
    l "不过也算情有可原，你的英雄会接受你的理由。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_621e532c:

    # "The wolf chuckles loudly, is he laughing at his own talk of heroism?"
    "那头狼大声轻笑起来——他是在笑自己那套英雄论吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0ad0c196:

    # "Regardless, Lothar begins to talk with you again, telling you what he had done today or yesterday. It quickly spirals into a constant conversation."
    "不管怎样，洛萨尔又开始和你聊天，告诉你今天或昨天做过的事。话题很快演变成了没完没了的交谈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_acd041da:

    # "Often you two pause for a few seconds before responding to each other. But unlike every other time, Lothar never sounds overly confident, or self-assured."
    "你们俩经常会停上几秒，才回应对方。但和以往不同，洛萨尔始终没有显得过分自信或胸有成竹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_22600c37:

    # "Instead, he's almost too natural, his voice a little deeper than the usual hero and disciple speech."
    "相反，他自然得近乎反常，声音也比平时以英雄和门徒的身份说话时低沉了些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8e0ce29f:

    # "You feel you're no longer intimidated by his aura of dominance, you feel much safer, talking with him inside of this crowded tavern."
    "你感觉自己不再受他那股支配性的气场震慑，在这间拥挤的酒馆里和他聊天时，也安心了许多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0063f949:

    # "Sometimes he laughs with you for all the misfortune you've been through since you wake up in this world."
    "有时，他会和你一起笑，笑你来到这个世界后经历的种种不幸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_067c9e6d:

    # "Sometimes you chuckles at how he and Jog messes with Amble without him ever noticing."
    "有时，你也会因为他和乔格捉弄安布、而安布始终毫无察觉而发笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0f4a76f9:

    # "And it was... magical how that feels to have your mentor drinking beer alongside you, peaceful all around."
    "让你的导师陪在身边喝着啤酒，四周一片宁静……这种感觉实在太奇妙了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_05fb091f:

    # "Most importantly, you get to know who Lothar is. Despite thousands of exaggerations thrown at your face each sentence, there's some form of truth buried inside."
    "最重要的是，你开始了解真正的洛萨尔。尽管他每句话都要向你抛来成千上万的夸张说辞，其中仍埋藏着某种真相。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_69212834:

    # "You wish to talk with Lothar for the entire night, but at some point, you feel your eyelids droop. You lean on the counter and lie your head on your arms."
    "你希望能和洛萨尔聊上一整晚，但不知不觉间，你感到眼皮越来越沉。你靠在柜台上，把头枕在自己的手臂上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a5d7011c:

    # "You two continue to talk for some time before you completely fall asleep."
    "你们俩又聊了一阵，直到你彻底睡着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4f6c8900:

    # "The next thing you know, it's already morning. You're inside your room, sleeping on your own bed."
    "你醒来时，天已经亮了。你正在自己的房间里，睡在自己的床上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8382d080:

    # "Did he carry you back onto your bed like that time you lost to him...? You're not too certain."
    "他有没有像上次你输给他时那样，把你背回床上……？你也不太确定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_ca02055e:

    # "It doesn't seem like Lothar is anywhere close to you..."
    "洛萨尔似乎并不在你附近……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_25df6518:

    # "You went to bed again for a while before a scream interrupt your sleep."
    "你又睡了一会儿，直到一声尖叫打断了你的睡眠。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_41863b22:

    # e "I should help Ole bring him home. And I'm tired and all."
    e "我该帮奥利把他带回家。而且我也累了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_53c734cf:

    # l "Well then, see you later, disciple."
    l "那就这样，回头见，弟子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_82822a0c:

    # l "..."
    l "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_6c439456:

    # l "I have to say it again, but don't you two wipe that dick off his face."
    l "不过我得再说一次，你们两个可别把他脸上的那根鸡巴擦掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e6cb3461:

    # "You two nods towards Lothar as he leaves for the counter."
    "洛萨尔离开走向柜台时，你们两个朝他点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f459ebf9:

    # e "Mhmm... Ole, how do we carry him?"
    e "嗯……奥利，我们要怎么搬他？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_18df4208:

    # o "Usually I'd have you taking his arms and myself holding his legs. But I've prepared a cart just to carry him home."
    o "通常会让你抬他的胳膊，我来托住他的腿。不过我已经准备了辆车，专门把他运回家。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_37af04bc:

    # e "O-oh, so you didn't need my help?"
    e "哦、哦，所以你不需要我的帮助？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0d894779:

    # o "Well, for the cart to work we first have to put him inside, right? I need you to take his arms."
    o "嗯，得先把他放进车里，车才能派上用场，对吧？我需要你抬住他的胳膊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7115ea73:

    # e "A-alright."
    e "好、好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_34e165df:

    # "Your arms wrap around Sebas from behind under his armpits, you can sense the scent of beer, and faint musk coming from there."
    "你的双臂从背后环住塞巴斯的腋下，你能闻到那里传来的啤酒味和淡淡的麝香味。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_45d367e8:

    # "Ole puts his legs first inside the cart, before you lower him inside of it."
    "奥利先把他的双腿放进车里，然后你再把他放进去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_db8dc3f0:

    # s "Mmmmph..."
    s "唔嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a96bd4f6:

    # "You can still see the drawn cock on his mouth, clearly. And Sebas is drooling all over it as well."
    "你仍能清楚看到他嘴上画着的那根鸡巴，塞巴斯的口水也流得满是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e5f37208:

    # "Ole begins pushing the cart with Sebas inside, gesturing you to follow him."
    "奥利开始推着载有塞巴斯的车，并示意你跟上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2f3e3f28:

    # o "[e], was tonight good?"
    o "[e]，今晚过得开心吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_25f8e876:

    # e "I enjoy spending time with you two, and Lothar."
    e "我喜欢和你们两个，还有洛萨尔一起度过时光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_12b903b4:

    # o "Yeah, more so if Lothar and Seb don't argue all the time. But, it was a lot of fun."
    o "是啊，要是洛萨尔和塞巴斯不是一直吵架，就更好了。不过，真的很开心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_9de8cfee:

    # o "Did you enjoy the food there? I thought the bread was amazing."
    o "你喜欢那里的食物吗？我觉得那里的面包棒极了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e63f0eaa:

    # e "You're right, I really like the rye bread."
    e "你说得对，我很喜欢黑麦面包。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_877a8b90:

    # o "And at least you're not already drunk like Seb is."
    o "至少你还没像塞巴斯那样醉醺醺的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_31353d3a:

    # "After a while, you arrive to the shop."
    "过了一会儿，你们到了店里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b8927e14:

    # o "Hey, [e]. Help me carry this cart upstairs."
    o "嘿，[e]。帮我把这辆车搬上楼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_753b48dd:

    # "You run in front of the cart, lifting it up and begin walking towards Sebas' room."
    "你跑到车前，抬起车子，开始朝塞巴斯的房间走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_6630872e:

    # "Soon, Ole gestures you to put the cart down, just for Ole to bring Seb onto his bed."
    "很快，奥利示意你把车放下，好让他把塞巴斯抱到床上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_aab6f876:

    # o "Finally... another drunk Seb saved."
    o "终于……又救回一个醉醺醺的塞布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4a4354eb:

    # e "That's great. I suppose you'd want to sleep too...?"
    e "太好了。我猜你也想睡觉……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_74811991:

    # o "Well, the problem is..."
    o "问题在于……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_d176bbbe:

    # o "Usually, we share a bed. But I don't want him to vomit all over me while I'm sleeping."
    o "通常我们睡一张床。不过我可不想睡着时被他吐得满身都是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_5541c495:

    # e "Oh, my bed's big enough for you, I think."
    e "哦，我的床应该够你睡，我想。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_83ba6965:

    # o "If you don't mind, kiddo. I'd probably trust you not to throw up than this lion."
    o "你要是不介意的话，小家伙。比起这头狮子，我大概更相信你不会吐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2267c8b2:

    # "You and Ole walks downstairs towards your room."
    "你和奥利下楼，朝着你的房间走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_3ce5c7ca:

    # o "Damn, it's still amazing how this room was full of crates, empty barrels and all."
    o "该死，这个房间以前居然堆满了板条箱、空桶之类的，想想还真令人惊叹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_6cba5f09:

    # e "That was before I arrived here... right?"
    e "那是在我来到这里之前……对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_dc3c9cfd:

    # o "Yeah. That's right. I'd probably prefer you living in here instead, of course."
    o "对，没错。当然，比起那样，我大概还是更希望你住在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_0a1ff1e6:

    # o "It was a nice bedroom."
    o "那是一间不错的卧室。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_aa52f598:

    # "Ole sits on the bed, before fully leaning on your pillow."
    "奥利坐到床上，然后整个身子靠在你的枕头上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_fa60806e:

    # "You lie as near as you can without touching his scaled skin."
    "你尽可能贴近他躺下，却不碰到他覆着鳞片的皮肤。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_bd58f46c:

    # "But it was his skin that touches you first, and his arm wraps around your shoulder."
    "但先碰到你的，是他的皮肤；他的手臂也环住了你的肩膀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_7e582dde:

    # o "I lied about the bed, by the way. I just wanted to take a look at your room."
    o "顺便说一句，关于那张床我撒了谎。我只是想来看看你的房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_07abc845:

    # o "..."
    o "..."

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_05a7a9cb:

    # o "I also lied about that."
    o "关于那件事我也撒了谎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_807057dc:

    # "You suddenly blush intensely, you can feel the lizard's hot breaths enveloping your face."
    "你突然满脸通红，能感觉到蜥蜴灼热的呼吸扑在你脸上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e88fc406:

    # "Is he right on top of you? The room is too dark to know exactly what happened."
    "他正压在你身上吗？房间太暗了，根本看不清究竟发生了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_c372fb80:

    # e "Ole?"
    e "奥利？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_697620cf:

    # o "S-sorry, I was just taking a good look at you."
    o "抱、抱歉，我只是仔细看了看你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_2b768e87:

    # e "What are you doing...?"
    e "你在做什么……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_354761a9:

    # "You feel something soft taps your lips, it was Ole's finger, probably signaling you to be silent..."
    "你感觉有什么柔软的东西轻轻碰了碰你的嘴唇——那是奥利的手指，大概是在示意你保持安静……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_48adfef9:

    # "The lizard let out a huge yawn as he returns to his position."
    "蜥蜴打了个大大的哈欠，同时回到自己的位置。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_f984d269:

    # o "Well, I'm exhausted."
    o "嗯，我累坏了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_9e280f00:

    # e "Me too."
    e "我也是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a231d08a:

    # o "Good Night, roommate."
    o "晚安，室友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_facb0650:

    # "You head slowly leans into Ole's, as you soon drift into slumber."
    "你的脑袋慢慢靠向奥利，不久便沉沉睡去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4f7418cd:

    # "The next thing you know, a glimmer of sunlight flickers on your eyes. It's already morning."
    "下一刻，一缕阳光映入眼帘。天已经亮了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_788153f6:

    # "Ole is gone, he probably woke up before you did."
    "奥利不见了，他大概在你醒来之前就起床了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_b5785a75:

    # "You try to close your eyes again to get some more sleep, before a scream interrupts your sleep."
    "你试着再次闭上眼睛，想再睡一会儿，却被一声尖叫打断了睡意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_6197e943:

    # s3 "WHAT IS THAT THING ON MY FACE!!"
    s3 "我脸上那是什么东西！！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_4bec5703:

    # s2 "OOOOOOO-OOOOO!!"
    s2 "啊啊啊——啊啊啊！！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_07b376e3:

    # "A calm and collected voice follows."
    "随后传来一个冷静而镇定的声音。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_e14f5879:

    # s "YOU LET HIM DO WHAT?"
    s "你让他做了什么？！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_8f5378fb:

    # "You hear a hysterical scream, followed with a long shout between the two shopkeepers."
    "你听到一声歇斯底里的尖叫，随后两名店主之间爆发了长时间的喊叫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Night_Out_975cb6cc:

    # "Annoyed, you cover your ears with the pillow, and you snooze for at least a few hours."
    "你有些恼火，便用枕头捂住耳朵，至少又睡了几个小时。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_7801eb24:

    # e "I learned from Lothar, like- a lot."
    e "我从洛萨尔那里学了很多——真的很多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_52b3be0f:

    # s "Yeah, I still don't get why Ole here recommended you to learn from him. It's not like he's the only one that knows how to fight."
    s "是啊，我还是不明白奥利为什么推荐你向他学习。又不是只有他一个人会打架。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_64206344:

    # o "Well, he definitely should be the best at it, regardless."
    o "不过不管怎样，他肯定应该是这方面最强的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_d58b9794:

    # s "You don't think I can beat him? I can literally kick him in the nuts, hard."
    s "你觉得我打不过他？我真能狠狠踢他的蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_53abd1cc:

    # s "I literally did, and he had to stay home for a whole day."
    s "我确实踢过，而且他不得不在家待了一整天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_b5455bdc:

    # s "My [e] here knows he's a fucking ass hat."
    s "我身边的[e]知道，他就是个他妈的蠢货。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_ee6f5945:

    # o "Yeah I still don't get why you two are so obsessed with your nuts. It can cause some serious problems if you two are... regularly doing it."
    o "是啊，我还是搞不懂你们两个为什么这么迷恋踢蛋蛋。你们要是……经常这么干，可是会惹出严重问题的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_23723993:

    # s "I can assure you after that kick he never appears in my shop, ever again, it was quite effective in that sense."
    s "我可以保证，自那一脚之后，他再也没来过我的店——一次都没有。从这点来说，效果相当不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_f89c48c0:

    # s "Well, [e] stopped me. But I guess someone should be an actually responsible adult and stop the nuts kicking."
    s "嗯，[e]阻止了我。不过我想，总得有个真正负责任的成年人来制止你们踢蛋蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_1f6112a5:

    # o "I agree with [e], you two are just fighting constantly all the time for no reason at all."
    o "我同意[e]的说法，你们两个总是在毫无理由地不停打架。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_df58aa7f:

    # s "It's still better than you defending him for some reason."
    s "这总比你莫名其妙地替他辩护要好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_6010a1fe:

    # s "Whatever, I don't care about him. At least he's not coming into our shop now."
    s "随便吧，我才不在乎他。至少他现在不会再来我们店里了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_c792a3ea:

    # s "For a hero like he claims to be, he's quite an example of what you shouldn't be, [e]."
    s "他自称是英雄，可他简直成了你不该成为的那种人的典型，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_92145868:

    # e "I thought his lessons were quite nice, to be fair. He was a decent mentor."
    e "说实话，我觉得他的教导挺不错的。他是个称职的导师。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_584030bd:

    # s "Is that so?"
    s "是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_d55a6a46:

    # "Sebas takes a sip of his beer, while Ole looks around."
    "塞巴斯抿了口啤酒，奥利则环顾四周。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_fa558e93:

    # e "I attended battle training from Jog and Amble... it was quite good."
    e "我参加过乔格和安布的战斗训练……挺不错的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_b9c887e4:

    # "Sebas' eyes immediately squint upon hearing about Jog."
    "听到乔格的名字，塞巴斯的双眼立刻眯了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_324d3488:

    # s "Those two again, huh, found any gold missing in your pocket afterwards?"
    s "又是那两个家伙，嗯？后来你口袋里的金币有没有少？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_b5add4e5:

    # e "Uh... no? Probably?"
    e "呃……没有吧？大概？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_63825ef4:

    # s "Probably."
    s "大概吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_87ea5194:

    # "You can hear the change in Seb's tone when you mention them, you still are not sure what happened between them. But at this point, you don't even want to find out."
    "提到他们时，你能听出塞巴斯语气的变化；你依然不清楚他们之间发生过什么。不过事到如今，你甚至不想弄清楚了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_a6c9959d:

    # o "Apart from certain personality and habits, I trust they possess some skills that can be useful for [e]."
    o "除了某些性格和习惯之外，我相信他们还掌握着一些能帮到[e]的技能。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_0452abff:

    # s "And maybe the problem is you trust too much, Ole."
    s "也许问题就在于你太容易相信别人了，奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_0743270a:

    # "Ole remains silent, he doesn't seem too startled by Sebas' response."
    "奥利保持沉默，塞巴斯的回应似乎并没有让他太过惊讶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_f2631c9f:

    # e "So... why are you against them, Seb?"
    e "那么……塞巴斯，你为什么对他们有成见？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_0264130c:

    # s "Amble's an honest guy, not like I've lived with him before. But the hyena is not someone you should hang out with."
    s "安布是个诚实的家伙——当然，我以前也没和他一起住过。但那只鬣狗不是适合你来往的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_cad7fb06:

    # s "If you do, watch out for the backstabs."
    s "如果你真要跟他来往，小心他背后捅刀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_4a2164df:

    # e "I don't think Jog is the person you think he is, Seb."
    e "我觉得乔格不是你以为的那种人，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_a00f8e5e:

    # s "I've known that thief for a decade. I know all his tricks, his jokes, everything about him."
    s "我认识那个小偷十年了。他那些把戏、笑话，以及他的一切，我全都知道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_aa5c2694:

    # s "You've only met him for how long? [sebguessingmonth] months at most."
    s "你才认识他多久？最多也就[sebguessingmonth]个月。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_6d1cef10:

    # e "B-but still, he doesn't strike me as someone who would... backstab."
    e "可、可是，他给我的感觉不像是会……背后捅刀的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_d6ea92e2:

    # o "[e] is still new around here, just change the topic."
    o "[e]在这附近还不熟，换个话题吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_22c61a31:

    # "The lion pouts, he just guzzles down a whole cup of beer."
    "那头狮子撅起嘴，只顾着把整杯啤酒一口灌下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_0844a559:

    # "You shudder for a second as Sebas slams the cup hard on the table, without saying a single word."
    "塞巴斯一言不发地把杯子狠狠砸在桌上，你不由得哆嗦了一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_54668e7d:

    # "Your table remains silent for a short while."
    "你们这桌沉默了片刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_e521d2c1:

    # "You remain silent while the two shopkeepers talk among themselves."
    "你保持沉默，两个店主则自顾自地交谈着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_f1abfa1d:

    # o "Seb, honestly we shouldn't bring that up ever again. You're never going to get over it."
    o "塞巴斯，老实说，我们以后再也别提那件事了。你永远都过不去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_5922aadb:

    # s "Get over what, that we kicked him out of our shop?"
    s "过不去什么？我们把他赶出店里这件事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_f2ab1e8f:

    # o "You're like this everytime someone mentions him."
    o "每次有人提到他，你都这样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_026a2ca6:

    # s "What's the fucking problem, O. That we live in this shithole of a village and we have to see his face every single fucking day?"
    s "到底有什么他妈的问题，奥利？不就是我们住在这个狗屁村子里，每天还他妈得见到他的脸吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_2fd2e7c7:

    # "The lion gulps down another whole cup of beer, before catching you staring at him in the eyes."
    "那头狮子又一口气喝下整杯啤酒，随后发现你正直勾勾地盯着他的眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_e1554201:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_dbaea1da:

    # "He calms down a bit, looking down at the cup."
    "他低头看着杯子，情绪稍微平复了些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_f362bd92:

    # s "Uhm... sorry roomie. It's not your fault."
    s "呃……抱歉啊，室友。这不是你的错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_6c279348:

    # "Ole moves his arm over the lion's shoulder, and pats on the back of his head lightly."
    "奥利伸手搭住狮子的肩膀，轻轻拍了拍他的后脑勺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_aee86f3f:

    # e "I-it's okay, Seb."
    e "没、没事，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_cdb5c912:

    # o "Anyway, we should talk about something else."
    o "总之，我们还是聊点别的吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_f3041ca8:

    # e "I started to sew up some clothes for Rahim."
    e "我开始给雷希姆缝一些衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_699027b5:

    # s "Oh? Rahim let you take care of his clients' orders? He didn't even let me touch his stuff."
    s "哦？雷希姆让你处理他客户的订单？他连碰都不让我碰他的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_2e07906c:

    # o "He did at one point, before you ruined the stitches of that whole tunic."
    o "他之前确实让你碰过一次，后来你把那整件长袍的针脚都弄坏了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_5ea21f5d:

    # "Sebas scoffs."
    "塞巴斯嗤之以鼻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_76d50a5d:

    # e "Did Rahim know Seb did this?"
    e "雷希姆知道这是塞巴斯干的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_1243c960:

    # s "No... that wasn't my fault, alright- I didn't even know how to stitch at that time."
    s "不……那不是我的错，行了吧——我那时候甚至都不会缝针。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_b8e43b25:

    # o "You also borrowed his sewing scissors to cut the paper in our shop."
    o "你还借了他的裁缝剪刀，在咱们店里剪纸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_db14366c:

    # s "Stop, how am I supposed to know his scissors aren't for cutting stuff."
    s "行了，我怎么会知道他的剪刀不是用来剪东西的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_567ceafd:

    # s "And I gifted him another pair I got from the town, alright. It's not that big of a deal. I promise."
    s "而且我还送了他另一把，是我从镇上买的，行了吧。这又不是什么大事。我保证。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_57f879b3:

    # "Sebas laughs awkwardly, while Ole squints his eyes towards him."
    "塞巴斯尴尬地笑着，奥利则眯眼瞪着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_7e07b567:

    # s "Well, anyway, [e]'s got in touch with Rahim a lot too. Anything you learned from the grumpy old bull?"
    s "嗯，不过话说回来，[e]也经常和雷希姆联系。你从那头脾气暴躁的老公牛那儿学到什么了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_6368ac9a:

    # o "I trust he must have done a better job than you."
    o "我敢说，他肯定比你做得好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_a50f7a9c:

    # s "Stop embarrassing me in front of [e], O-..."
    s "别在[e]面前让我难堪，奥——……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_32d71e63:

    # e "Uhm... I think I did somewhat of a good job?"
    e "呃……我觉得我应该也做得还不错？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_a458edaf:

    # e "Sometimes I stayed listening to him, just random stories. It was pretty nice talking to Rahim."
    e "有时我会留下来听他讲些随口编的故事。和雷希姆聊天挺不错的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_ac708b8f:

    # o "Aw... It's such a rare occasion to hear him open up. You must be quite a special protégé."
    o "哎……能听他敞开心扉可真难得。你一定是个相当特别的门徒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_b6182e0e:

    # s "Oh yeah, Rahim's not the type to talk while working."
    s "哦，对，雷希姆不是那种工作时会聊天的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_4765445e:

    # e "I don't know, our conversation's been short. I just worked for him for some money."
    e "我也不知道，我们聊得不多。我只是为了赚点钱替他干活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_6888622b:

    # s "Ah, well most of us do too. He's not the type to talk that much."
    s "啊，我们大多数人也一样。他不是个多话的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_ff82b56b:

    # o "How's he with Cane anyway, I didn't catch them speaking to each other..."
    o "他和凯恩相处得怎么样？我都没见他们互相说过话……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_286621e5:

    # e "I'm not sure, Cane was apologetic, but Rahim doesn't seem to respond well."
    e "我不太确定，凯恩当时很是歉疚，但雷希姆似乎不太买账。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_3295847d:

    # s "Bummer. They were quite friendly before the whole goat thing started."
    s "真遗憾。在那件山羊的事开始之前，他们关系还挺好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_828ebaa0:

    # s "A-and I assure you he's really trying to become quite a better bat. You should definitely see the improvement."
    s "我、我保证，他真的在努力成为一只更好的蝙蝠。你肯定能看出他的进步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_64eafa22:

    # "You suddenly remember how he acted when he was with Cane in bed."
    "你突然想起了他和凯恩在床上时的表现。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_cfdafb8a:

    # "It was quite weird for Sebas to talk about Cane like that, perhaps they've been in touch a lot?"
    "塞巴斯那样谈论凯恩，真是有点奇怪；也许他们联系得很频繁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_2a2c1acf:

    # o "Well if you both say so."
    o "好吧，既然你们俩都这么说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_3b0b3148:

    # "Ole takes a bite off from his rye bread, he seems surprised at first, before chomping down the whole bread in his mouth."
    "奥利从他的黑麦面包上咬下一口，起初似乎有些惊讶，随后把整块面包都塞进嘴里大嚼起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_6aea4bec:

    # o "Now I see what you mean Seb, it's really an improvement."
    o "现在我明白你的意思了，塞巴斯，确实有进步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_f93e6326:

    # "Sebas and you chuckle at Ole's comment, it's quite rare for him to enjoy something other than cleaning, and much rarer for something made by Cane."
    "塞巴斯和你因奥利的话轻笑起来；他很少会享受清洁以外的事情，更少会喜欢凯恩做的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_1f4099c2:

    # o "I'll have to see for my eyes... regardless."
    o "不管怎样，我得亲眼看看……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_7397b3fe:

    # e "Well... Did I ever tell you about.... What happened in the Goat Tribe?"
    e "嗯……我有没有跟你们说过……山羊部落发生的事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_78a329b8:

    # s "Not that I've heard a lot from them, any juicy news we ought to hear?"
    s "我没怎么听说他们的事，有什么值得我们听听的劲爆消息吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_29feb3b3:

    # "Ole raises his brows, both of them are looking at you, patiently waiting for you to speak."
    "奥利扬起眉毛，两人都看着你，耐心等你开口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_96acaba7:

    # e "Just a lot of stuff happened, their general, Kari, told me that their leader was stuck somewhere in a cave, so I was kind of thrusted into their situation."
    e "事情挺多的，他们的将军卡里告诉我，他们的首领被困在某处洞穴里，所以我算是被卷进了他们的处境。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_f543b8ae:

    # e "And I just went to the damp cave to get him out. And another guardian attacked me."
    e "然后我就去了那座潮湿的洞穴，把他救出来。另一个守护者还袭击了我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_b6ebbe1a:

    # e "We saved their leader, Furkan, back in the cave."
    e "我们在洞穴里救出了他们的首领弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_decac57e:

    # s "Wait, how was Furk inside a random cave?"
    s "等等，弗坎怎么会在一座随便的洞穴里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_c91a48c4:

    # e "I didn't understand as much, just that, they needed to look for their guardian there, and something attacked him, stealing the basin that Furkan had."
    e "我也没弄明白太多，只知道他们需要在那里寻找他们的守护者，还有什么东西袭击了他，抢走了弗坎手里的盆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_af18d600:

    # o "For a goat leader, Furkan wasn't the most careful type. I appreciate his courage though."
    o "作为山羊部落的首领，弗坎可算不上谨慎。不过，我很佩服他的勇气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_dc3375fc:

    # s "And where is it now?"
    s "那它现在在哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_9561621e:

    # e "I don't know. The thef is still out there, we didn't even know why the two guardians went rogue in the first place."
    e "我不知道。小偷还在外面，我们甚至都不知道那两个守护者当初为什么会失控。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_bfbe8c07:

    # o "Perhaps someone out there was trying to fetch a good price with the basin."
    o "也许外面有人想拿那只盆卖个好价钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_72425165:

    # s "Or, they wanted to make more guardians, for themselves."
    s "又或者，他们只是想为自己制造更多守护者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_54a2445f:

    # e "I just got there myself. They keep asking me about their leader, and Kari kind of threatened to hold me down..."
    e "我也是刚到那里。他们一直问我他们的首领在哪儿，卡里还像是威胁要把我按住……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_e7b9a3df:

    # e "Lothar told me to pretend to pass out, but I had to fight back before they capture me."
    e "洛萨尔让我装晕，可在他们抓住我之前，我不得不还手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_d4dba864:

    # o "Lothar?"
    o "洛萨尔？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_64eeacbb:

    # "Right upon hearing Ole's inquiry, you realize you had lied to Ole about the whole plan of infiltration before."
    "一听到奥利这么问，你立刻意识到，自己之前一直在向奥利撒谎，隐瞒着整个潜入计划。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_8d8b3aec:

    # "You hold your breath, waiting for Ole's response, but he doesn't say anything."
    "你屏住呼吸，等待奥利的回应，可他什么也没说。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_54c949e4:

    # s "Something wrong?"
    s "怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_5c09ce2b:

    # "Sebas notices the awkward stare between you and Ole as he breaks out of contemplation."
    "塞巴斯从沉思中回过神来，注意到你和奥利之间尴尬的对视。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_2ca967a9:

    # o "What?"
    o "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_65d12ab9:

    # s "S-sooo... what happened between you two?"
    s "那、那个……你们两个之间发生了什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_cb23ec1e:

    # e "I'm just sorry I didn't tell Ole the truth about Lothar's plan."
    e "我只是很抱歉，没把洛萨尔的计划真相告诉奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_a7485c07:

    # o "Honestly, I-I... don't want to blame you, [e]. In fact, I'm just glad you turned out safe."
    o "说实话，我、我……不想责怪你，[e]。其实，只要你平安无事，我就已经很高兴了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_d784f10a:

    # e "Ole..."
    e "奥利……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_0695c18e:

    # o "[e], I'm already over it. We should really move on before Seb gets bored to death."
    o "[e]，我已经不在意了。在塞巴斯无聊死之前，我们还是赶紧继续赶路吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_b8602f24:

    # "Ole gives you a faint smile."
    "奥利对你淡淡一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_be5a4843:

    # e "I met the general in the forest, he was looking for Furkan."
    e "我在森林里遇到了那位将军，他当时正在找弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_059296d0:

    # o "Oh? He doesn't seem like the type to wander in the forest alone."
    o "哦？他看起来不像是会独自在森林里游荡的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_06ec6b79:

    # e "It was almost night. He found out about the guardian that Seb and I met back in the river. So he asked me to see if Furkan was there."
    e "当时天快黑了。他得知塞巴斯和我之前在河边遇到的那个守护者后，就让我去看看弗坎是不是在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_9b16b686:

    # s "That golem? Well, we had a hunch it was from the goats. I thought these huge fellas should have been protecting their runes, or whatever the runes were in."
    s "那只魔像？嗯，我们猜它应该来自山羊族。我本以为这些大块头应该是在保护它们的符文，或者说保护符文所在的什么东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_e9e10270:

    # s "Did Furkan tell you what happened?"
    s "弗坎告诉你发生了什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_fb2bc21f:

    # e "No, I don't really know what happened, even after helping him I'm not sure if they'd share all of their secrets to me."
    e "没有，我其实不太清楚发生了什么。即使帮过他，我也不确定他们会不会把所有秘密都告诉我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_22607b19:

    # o "It was already a miracle Furkan trusted a stranger, not mentioning that you're living in Lusterfield."
    o "弗坎愿意相信一个陌生人，本身就已经是个奇迹了，更别说你还住在卢斯特菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_ea519abc:

    # o "Well, Lothar did tell you to sneak into the tribe, if I remembered correctly."
    o "好吧，如果我没记错，洛萨尔确实叫你偷偷潜入部落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_014817f4:

    # o "He's really stupid when it comes to asking someone to help him."
    o "他找人帮忙时真的蠢得要命。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_5489b31b:

    # s "Ha- you're giving him too much credit, O. I'd say he's just stupid."
    s "哈——奥利，你也太高看他了吧。我看他就是蠢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_03ee0af5:

    # o "In any case, I've talked to him about you already, he won't be putting you in any dangerous situation again."
    o "不管怎么说，我已经跟他谈过你的事了，他不会再让你陷入危险境地。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_448d5bf0:

    # e "Really? I didn't hear him talk about you that much."
    e "真的吗？我没怎么听他提起过你啊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_6c1086fa:

    # o "You're going to worry if he talks about me, ha. He's given me enough troubles already in the past."
    o "他要是提起我，你可就要担心了，哈。他过去已经给我添够多麻烦了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_6128cea1:

    # s "He's still a dumb wolf, I don't get why so many folks here still praise him like he's some kind of hero."
    s "他还是那头蠢狼，我真不明白这里这么多人为什么还把他当什么英雄似的夸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_6479f1ee:

    # s "Not mentioning that he's cooking up frictions with the goats, does he want another war or something?"
    s "更别提他还在和山羊们制造摩擦了，他是想再打一场仗还是怎么的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_5641ec6c:

    # e "I'm sure Lothar just sees them as being dangerous, he will come to his senses when he knows more."
    e "我敢肯定，洛萨尔只是觉得他们很危险；等他了解得更多，就会恢复理智了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Night_Out_Chat_83a20941:

    # s "Ha, sure."
    s "哈，当然。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Rejoining_Night_Out_4a9b1b97:

    # e "Hey, Seb. Do you think we can hang out today?"
    e "嘿，塞巴斯。你觉得我们今天能一起出去玩吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Rejoining_Night_Out_7135ed34:

    # "Seb bounces up, he's suddenly more energetic than ever."
    "塞巴斯一下子蹦了起来，突然比以往任何时候都更有精神。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Rejoining_Night_Out_6aeb8fc6:

    # s "Oh! You mean, like... hang out at night?"
    s "哦！你的意思是……晚上一起玩吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Rejoining_Night_Out_4b312d7a:

    # e "Yes, just like what I promised you last time we talked?"
    e "对，就像我上次和你聊天时答应你的那样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Rejoining_Night_Out_122d9c48:

    # s "H-ha! Well, yes. I'll have to tell Ole we close the shop earlier, but..."
    s "呃、呃！嗯，是的。我得告诉奥利我们要早点关店，不过……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Rejoining_Night_Out_d571c310:

    # s "I'll see you in the tavern tonight! Don't be late!"
    s "今晚酒馆见！别迟到！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_06225383:

    # "As you return to the shop, you notices the lion at the counter is watching you, he waves and walks towards your direction."
    "你回到店里时，注意到柜台旁的狮子正看着你。他朝你挥了挥手，向你走来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_e182a5cd:

    # s "Hey, roomie."
    s "嘿，室友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_434ba701:

    # e "Hello, Seb."
    e "你好，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_e0e0a032:

    # "You didn't go to the Tavern with Seb, yesterday. That must be why Sebas looks this... grumpy."
    "你昨天没和塞巴斯一起去酒馆。难怪塞巴斯看起来这么……恼火。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_26368a6e:

    # "Ole minds his own business, he either didn't notice you returning, or he didn't want to talk to you... Both are possible."
    "奥利一向不爱管闲事，要么没注意到你回来，要么就是不想和你说话……两种可能都有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_0623fb46:

    # s "You must be pretty busy last night... Yes?"
    s "你昨晚一定挺忙的……对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_65cde3b1:

    # e "Mhmm... yes. I'm sorry about ditching you, and Ole."
    e "嗯……是的。很抱歉放了你和奥利的鸽子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_26881068:

    # s "Hey, don't be sorry. Of course you being there makes it more fun, but Ole and I could just be hanging out like normal."
    s "嘿，别道歉了。你在场当然会更有意思，不过我和奥利也可以像平常一样一起消磨时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_49ee66ed:

    # s "OOOOOO! [e] is here!"
    s "喔喔喔喔喔喔！[e]在这儿！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_0e5a4c75:

    # "The lizard reluctuantly turns to you, before putting on a slight grin."
    "那只蜥蜴不情不愿地转过身来，脸上随即浮现出一丝淡淡的笑意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_be311aa3:

    # o "Good to see you alive, [e]."
    o "能看到你还活着，真是太好了，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_bf9c4a91:

    # e "I'm so sorry to you both, you two must be waiting for so long..."
    e "真对不起，让你们俩等了这么久……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_fe8840f5:

    # o "Seb didn't wait for long before he finished up all the food and beer. I'll say you missed out on a lot of the food, though."
    o "塞巴斯没等多久，就把所有食物和啤酒都吃喝光了。不过得说，你可是错过了不少好吃的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_9405e98c:

    # e "Yeah, I probably did."
    e "是啊，我大概确实错过了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_ced38aeb:

    # o "Anyway, we are not jerking you or anything, but it was pretty fun last night, and I wished you were there, kiddo."
    o "总之，我们可不是在逗你什么的，但昨晚真的挺开心。我还希望你当时也在呢，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_d4cc816c:

    # s "I agree. but it was what it was, I hope you enjoy whatever you did last night though!"
    s "我同意。不过事情既然已经这样了，希望你昨晚做的事也能让你开心！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_b5159dfb:

    # "Sebas pets your head for a few times, before returning to his counter."
    "塞巴斯轻轻摸了几下你的头，随后回到了柜台。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_3d6d3bcd:

    # "You already feel quite bad for abandoning them, making them wait for you for the whole night."
    "你已经因为丢下他们，让他们等了你整整一晚而感到相当难受。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_12b9e057:

    # "And you feel even more guilty that they're not even blaming you..."
    "更让你内疚的是，他们甚至都没有责怪你……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_bb103e9f:

    # "Regardless, you look at the shopkeepers keeping the pawn running. You hope someday you can show the worth of their kindness towards you."
    "不管怎样，你望向那些让当铺继续运转的店主们。你希望有一天，自己能让他们看到他们对你的善意是值得的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Not_Going_Night_Out_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_After_Sick_Quest_e5e62d66:

    # s "Ole gave us quite a scare, didn't he?"
    s "奥利这一病可把我们吓得不轻，嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_After_Sick_Quest_500ef886:

    # "Seb looks over at Ole who is cleaning."
    "塞巴斯望向正在打扫的奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_After_Sick_Quest_1868b2ca:

    # s "But he's alright now."
    s "不过好在他现在没事了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_After_Sick_Quest_7aec7fe2:

    # s "Glad to see that."
    s "看到这样真是太好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_After_Sick_Quest_a263c369:

    # s "Roomie, you've pulled through too. I'm not sure I would have stayed as calm without you."
    s "室友，你也挺过来了。要不是有你，我真不知道自己还能不能保持冷静。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_After_Sick_Quest_6e9186a9:

    # e "I'm sure you'll be fine without me, Seb."
    e "我相信没有我你也会没事的，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_After_Sick_Quest_c410a248:

    # s "Not true, Roomie! It's nice to have someone with a clear mind around."
    s "才不是呢，室友！身边有个头脑清醒的人总归是件好事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_After_Sick_Quest_c69ffb48:

    # s "Normally that person would be Ole but it's nice to know that we now have you too."
    s "通常那个人会是奥利，不过现在身边又多了你，感觉真不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Goat_Tribe_c95a4a5a:

    # e "Seb! What do you think... about the goat tribe?"
    e "塞巴斯！你觉得……山羊部落怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Goat_Tribe_1801f85c:

    # s "Oh yeah, I've heard about that letter, I think Rahim came and asked us afterward."
    s "噢，对了，我听说过那封信。我想雷希姆后来还来问过我们这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Goat_Tribe_7e9688db:

    # e "Hmmph... Well. Which side are you leaning?"
    e "唔……那你会站哪一边？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Goat_Tribe_fb728923:

    # s "Look, [e]. I have no side. The only side is my side, which is pretty fucking huge."
    s "听着，[e]，我哪边都不站。我只站我自己这边，而我这边可他妈大了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Goat_Tribe_315ccb76:

    # s "But I have to say, we lost a lot of business opportunity since we lost contact. It would be pretty great if we can... you know. Get them back."
    s "不过得说，自从我们失去联系后，少了很多做生意的机会。要是我们能……你懂的，把他们拉回来，那可就太好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Goat_Tribe_3388a208:

    # e "Oh..."
    e "噢……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Goat_Tribe_e6ab4b66:

    # s "I'll choose whatever you choose, buddy. Don't worry about me."
    s "你选什么，我就选什么，老铁。别顾虑我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Goat_Tribe_12e36cbd:

    # e "Seb, why are you... so nice to me."
    e "塞巴斯，你为什么……对我这么好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Goat_Tribe_6a29984d:

    # s "I like seeing you smile, you're a good roommate."
    s "我喜欢看你笑，你是个很好的室友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Goat_Tribe_3978c518:

    # e "What about Ole?"
    e "那奥利呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Goat_Tribe_6205e6cb:

    # s "He's fine. I'm just happy you're here."
    s "他没事。我只是很高兴你在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Goat_Tribe_34f02d8a:

    # e "Me too... Seb."
    e "我也是……塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_11cc785e:

    # e "...Seb? Are you free... to hang out?"
    e "……塞巴斯？你有空……一起出去玩吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_27ad4092:

    # s "Hmm...? I'm working right now. Like, right now."
    s "嗯……？我现在正在工作。就是现在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_7370f611:

    # e "But there's no one here."
    e "可是这里一个人都没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_ba026f8e:

    # s "Ole is here. I can't sneak away to get some fuck with you."
    s "奥利还在这儿。我没法偷偷溜出去和你做爱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_e4bef205:

    # e "S-Seb! I think that wasn't what I meant."
    e "塞、塞巴斯！我觉得我刚才不是那个意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_edc572a7:

    # "Your face turns instantly red from Sebas' charming smile."
    "塞巴斯迷人的笑容让你的脸瞬间红了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_f43cc1cc:

    # s "Yeah, I know what you are thinking, this fluffy lion is so fucking handsome, aren't I?"
    s "对，我知道你在想什么——这头毛茸茸的狮子他妈的帅，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_d6fcdd3f:

    # s "Look, how about this buddy. Just sneak under the counter. And... do whatever you like."
    s "这样吧，老铁。你偷偷躲到柜台底下……想对我做什么都行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_3f2c5d33:

    # e "Ok. But Seb, are you sure...? I don't know if your customers are going to visit at any time."
    e "好吧。但塞巴斯，你确定吗……？我不知道你的顾客会不会随时来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_e4a5a882:

    # s "[e], it's my shop! I can do whatever I want! Plus, I'm super discreet about stuff like this."
    s "[e]，这是我的店！我想做什么就做什么！而且这种事我一向非常谨慎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_79ca83d6:

    # e "A-and... Ole?"
    e "那、那奥利呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_ccedf24f:

    # s "Don't worry. He's not gonna spank you or something if he finds out. He won't get angry because of this." nointeract
    s "别担心。就算他发现了，也不会打你屁股之类的。他不会因为这点事生气。" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_7b26d37a:

    # "You glance at Ole... who seems to be minding his own business, but you can feel that he knows what you two have been talking about..."
    "你瞥了奥利一眼……他似乎在忙自己的事，但你能感觉到，他知道你们刚才在聊什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_7e106e87:

    # e "Alright, how... do I-"
    e "好吧，那……我该怎么——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_e59f6cbc:

    # s "Come on, and do whatever you want to this lion."
    s "来吧，想对这头狮子做什么都行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_4eebfe2f:

    # "Sebas points at himself, putting up a huge grin on his face, his warm smile is warming your heart. You cannot believe it is happening, now."
    "塞巴斯指了指自己，脸上露出灿烂的笑容。他温暖的笑意令你的心也暖了起来。你简直不敢相信这一切现在真的发生了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_a4cfd78f:

    # "Not just in a private setting, but somewhat out in the open. Like telling the whole world you are about to have fun with Sebas."
    "不只是在私密场合，而是在某种半公开的地方。就像是在告诉全世界，你马上就要和塞巴斯寻欢作乐了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_e2842517:

    # "But it doesn't stop you, it makes you more excited instead. You climb under the counter as Sebas moves to adjust to his new leg space."
    "但这非但没有让你停下，反而让你更加兴奋。塞巴斯挪动身体，为双腿腾出新的空间时，你爬到了柜台底下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_8d68e49b:

    # e "Ouch..."
    e "哎哟……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_36530e6c:

    # "You head seems to hit something hard, but you quickly explore the area, and sit inside this tight dark space. The only thing is Sebas' fluffy but muscular legs."
    "你的头似乎撞到了什么硬东西，但你很快探索了一番，坐进这个狭窄黑暗的空间里。里面唯一能看到的，是塞巴斯毛茸茸却肌肉发达的双腿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_3a1dbabb:

    # s3 "You like it there, buddy?"
    s3 "你喜欢待在那里吗，老铁？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_602f2907:

    # e "It's alright."
    e "没事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_a8e4a769:

    # "You hear a few footsteps towards the table, but it stops there."
    "你听见几下朝桌边走来的脚步声，但脚步声在那里停了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_d3f2b703:

    # s "Ole?"
    s "奥利？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_e7a83287:

    # o "Uhh... Look, I didn't see anything. I'll just check the goods upstairs."
    o "呃……听着，我什么都没看见。我就上楼去清点货物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_d79080e0:

    # o "Enjoy yourselv-... I mean take care of the shop, Seb."
    o "玩得开心——……我是说，照看好店，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_8f1b58c9:

    # s "O-ok... We'll be done soon..."
    s "没、没事……我们很快就结束……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_4e46aa48:

    # "You can feel Ole going upstairs, he probably already knows about you two..."
    "你能感觉到奥利上楼去了，他大概已经知道你们两个的事了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_13031903:

    # s "Look it'll be very quick. There's no one h-"
    s "听着，很快就好。现在没人在——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_e1e6e2aa:

    # "As soon as Sebas starts to speak, the shop door creaks and a customer walks in."
    "塞巴斯刚开口，店门便吱呀作响，一位顾客走了进来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_ba34a018:

    # s "Fuck..."
    s "操……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_ab3382bc:

    # "Sebas tries to act as normal as possible while you begin exploring his lower body."
    "塞巴斯努力装出若无其事的样子，而你开始探索他的下身。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_7943c46e:

    # "You wish to sleep right now, but Sebas has already pulled you up."
    "你现在真想睡觉，但塞巴斯已经把你拉了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_afb4e601:

    # "He tucks you to your bed and leaves you there."
    "他把你安顿在床上，就把你留在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_889ff4f5:

    # e "Good luck with your work, Seb."
    e "祝你工作顺利，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_f395e613:

    # "Sebas nods at you, then goes back to pick up his discarded kilt."
    "塞巴斯朝你点点头，然后回去捡起他丢在一旁的短裙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_84e037b3:

    # "You lie on the bed. Quickly you drift to sleep."
    "你躺在床上，很快便睡着了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_4a04161d:

    # "You wake up slowly. Remnant of cum still remains on your face and fur."
    "你缓缓醒来，脸上和毛发上仍残留着精液。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_f734e221:

    # e "Uhh... m-maybe next time?"
    e "呃……也许下、下次吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Under_Counter_0630e288:

    # s "Aww... maybe. I'll be here if you need anything, like, anything."
    s "嗷……也许吧。我会待在这里，你需要什么都可以找我，什么都行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_759b7889:

    # e "Hey! Seb. I'm back from the green forest."
    e "嘿！塞巴斯，我从绿林回来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_b4aeef8c:

    # s "Good to see you! Buddy! I was worried you're getting in trouble from the slime."
    s "见到你真好！老铁！我还担心你会被史莱姆缠上，惹出麻烦呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_53490944:

    # e "I thought we were going to... train together?"
    e "我还以为我们要……一起训练？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_ccd4957f:

    # s "Don't blame me on this alright, it was Ole's idea. He told me you have to get some experience in the wild."
    s "别怪我啊，这可是奥利的主意。他说你得在野外积累些经验。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_8f32017f:

    # e "Yes, but... ok."
    e "是啊，可是……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_4e14a7d3:

    # s "Haha, don't be sad. Come on, let's take a look at what you got! You remember the 3 stones right?"
    s "哈哈，别难过。来，让我看看你带回了什么！你还记得那3块石头吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_bca520b2:

    # s "Hey, here it is, the three stones, you're really good at adventuring aren't you?"
    s "嘿，在这儿，三块石头，看来你真的很擅长冒险，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_ce27381e:

    # s "Hey, you got even more stones in your bag here, we should let you bring us all the materials in the shop, shouldn't we?"
    s "嘿，你包里还有更多石头呢。我们以后干脆让你把店里的所有材料都带回来，怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_b7ed3837:

    # e "Well at least I brought you the stones you asked."
    e "至少你要的石头我带来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_95115851:

    # s "Yeah, yeah. Not like I'm gonna sell them anyways. It just feels pretty good asking you to bring me some useless stones."
    s "好了好了。反正我也没打算拿去卖。让你带些没用的石头回来，感觉还真不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_3729b96c:

    # e "Hmmph..."
    e "唔……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_e7ecd185:

    # e "So... Seb. Is my training finished?"
    e "那么……阿塞，我的训练结束了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_0450594e:

    # s "Yes! Of course! I'm gonna keep the stones here, to commemorate this special occasion."
    s "当然！当然结束了！我要把这些石头留在这里，纪念这个特别的时刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_9622e0b7:

    # e "Thanks, Seb."
    e "谢谢你，阿塞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_316a7cee:

    # s "You're welcome! And now I have to let Ole know about these stones, so pretty."
    s "不客气！现在我得让奥利知道这些石头的事，它们真漂亮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_5a9e5564:

    # s "[e]... I see... only [item_number] stones here. Are you sure there's enough?"
    s "[e]……我看看……这里只有[item_number]块石头。你确定够了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_746de2bc:

    # e "Wait... really. I thought I had enough stones for you."
    e "等等……真的？我还以为给你的石头已经够了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_6add1741:

    # s "Hey. No worries, you must have picked them up and lost some of them on your way here. Just go back and pick it up and it's gonna be fine."
    s "嘿，别担心。你肯定是捡到后，在来这儿的路上弄丢了一些。回去再捡一块，就没问题了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_26753166:

    # e "Of course! I'll report you back when I've got enough stones for you."
    e "当然！等我给你捡够石头就回来告诉你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_8317109c:

    # s "Haha. You gotta stay safe on your way back there!"
    s "哈哈，回去的时候可要注意安全！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_0955da63:

    # s "Wait... You don't seem to have any stones here... [e]?"
    s "等等……你这儿好像一块石头都没有……[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_48a82537:

    # s "Buddy?"
    s "伙计？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_51691840:

    # e "I forgot..."
    e "我忘了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_98c4659a:

    # s "Awww... It's okay. Really. Just go back and bring me 3 stones, alright? You can track it on your journal if you really forgot."
    s "啊……没关系，真的。你只要回去给我带3块石头回来，好吗？要是真忘了，可以在日志里查看任务进度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_65d68988:

    # e "I'm sorry, Seb. I'll bring you those 3 stones."
    e "对不起，阿塞。我会把那3块石头带回来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_9f3c5ab2:

    # s "Good! Don't be sad alright. Everybody makes mistake here. Come here, let me give you a hug."
    s "好！别难过，好吗？谁都会犯错的。来，让我抱抱你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_8ac0d443:

    # "Sebas walks around the counter and step towards you. He opens his fluffy arm and put them around your back, he hugs you tightly, bumping his head into you."
    "塞巴斯绕过柜台朝你走来，张开毛茸茸的手臂环住你的背，紧紧抱住你，脑袋还撞了你一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_7e0feccb:

    # s "Good roomie."
    s "我的好室友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_785aea29:

    # "You can almost feel his hot breath on your face as he whispers to you, you want to bury your face into his soft manes, but he suddenly releases his grip on your back."
    "他贴着你的脸低声耳语，你几乎能感受到他灼热的呼吸，忍不住想把脸埋进他柔软的鬃毛里，可他突然松开了环在你背上的手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_fe44d19b:

    # s "Alright. See you later with the stones, buddy."
    s "好啦。待会儿带着石头回来见，老铁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Report_805a490a:

    # e "...Yes, Seb."
    e "……好，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_451986d7:

    # e "Hello, Sebas. Can I get a training from you."
    e "你好，塞巴斯。你能教我训练吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_f23a367c:

    # s "Of course you can, any time buddy! I have been waiting for you when Ol told me about the postal thing."
    s "当然可以，随时都行，老铁！奥利告诉我邮差那件事后，我就一直等着你呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_43bb46a9:

    # e "Thanks, Seb. I really appreciate you spending time with me."
    e "谢谢你，塞巴斯。你愿意抽时间陪我，我真的很感激。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_a75d477d:

    # s "Like I said, any time with my little buddy."
    s "就像我说的，陪我的小老弟，随时都有空。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_213c17c3:

    # s "So Ole asked me to teach you expedition right, I'll keep it very short."
    s "所以奥利是让我教你探险，对吧？我就长话短说了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_ff381eab:

    # s "You'll see you have three things I gave you yesterday, Journal, Inventory and Map."
    s "你会看到，我昨天给了你三样东西：日志、物品栏和地图。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_0d510780:

    # "You look at Sebas from his own counter, pointing his fuzzy paws onto the your bag."
    "你望向柜台后的塞巴斯，只见他伸出毛茸茸的爪子，指向你的包。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_8d2925f0:

    # s "Look at the map in your bag, just imagine it is something you can click in the bottom right corner."
    s "看看包里的地图，想象一下它是可以点击右下角某个位置的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_5883009f:

    # s "What am I saying. Click? What a dumb comparison, haha. Just open your map, alright."
    s "我在说什么呢。点击？真是个蠢透了的比喻，哈哈。直接打开你的地图就好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_5fd10514:

    # e "Ok..."
    e "好……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_82f041a2:

    # s "Aha, you are really smart! Ok, ok. You see the shapes right, it's a magical map, one I bought from an auction in the town."
    s "啊哈，你可真聪明！好啦好啦。你看到那些图案了吧？那是一张魔法地图，我从镇上的拍卖会上买来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_581d6ffb:

    # s "It will show locations you have explored for now, if you have not sneaked away from the village, right now it will only show Lusterfield and the green forest."
    s "它现在只会显示你探索过的地点；如果你之前没有偷偷溜出村子，那目前上面应该只有卢斯特菲尔德和叠翠森林。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_fe80cd9f:

    # e "I see the green forest in the south. Is that correct?"
    e "我看到叠翠森林在南边。对吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_1bc30bc3:

    # s "Yes, Ok. There's not a lot to teach if we're not there. Let's go there, us two."
    s "对，好啦。要是不去那里，我也没什么好教你的。我们俩一起去吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_bbcacbff:

    # e "Really, now?"
    e "真的？现在就去？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_b4dd2172:

    # s "Yesss, come on. You and me. Mister [e] and Sebas."
    s "好耶，快来。你和我，[e]先生和塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_d2c10949:

    # e "O-ok!"
    e "噢、好！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Postal_Training_e5ad05cd:

    # "Sebas grabs your hand tightly, and jogs right from the cashier towards the door, tugging you behind him. You can barely follow him with the speed he is going."
    "塞巴斯紧紧抓住你的手，从柜台边小跑着直奔门口，把你拽在身后。以他的速度赶路，你几乎都跟不上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_1db330e7:

    # "After a few minutes, you and Sebas has arrived to the green forest, he soon releases his grip on you, but you can still somehow feel the warmth from his fluffy paws."
    "几分钟后，你和塞巴斯抵达了叠翠森林。他很快松开了手，但你不知怎么的，仍能感受到他毛茸茸的爪子上残留的温度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_07aa488a:

    # s "Here we are. Oh... I'm your teacher now, so exciting!"
    s "我们到了。哦……我现在是你的老师啦，好激动！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_4bebfcd2:

    # s "Haha, Ok. Ok. [e]. The thing here is different than our village area. You'll see that you can explore the area."
    s "哈哈，好，好。[e]。这里和我们村子那一带不一样。你会发现，这片区域是可以探索的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_7f26a7b6:

    # e "Sebas, you seem really excited being here."
    e "塞巴斯，你看起来真的很兴奋能来这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_46b0350f:

    # s "Aren't you? We first met here, on the grass bed. And the forest too! It's so green here."
    s "你不也是吗？我们第一次见面就是在这里，在这片草地上。还有那片森林！这里真是一片葱郁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_8be3324c:

    # s "Anyways, I can't stay here long enough for us to really take in the nature-y nature here. Holy hell, [e], look at this."
    s "不管了，我没法在这里待太久，好好感受这里浓郁的自然气息。天哪，[e]，快看这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_22c17628:

    # s "It's tulip on a tree! I've never seen a flower growing out of there, not mentioning it's a fucking tree! Woah!"
    s "树上竟然长着郁金香！我从没见过花从那种地方长出来，更别提这他妈还是棵树！哇！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_c7a2ecdd:

    # e "Seb-"
    e "塞——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_5dcc2751:

    # s "Ahhh- There it is, my favourite rock. It's mineral actually. Look at its shiny surface. I want to keep it for my pawn shop. That can surely fetch a good price."
    s "啊——在那儿！我最喜欢的石头。其实是矿石。看看它闪亮的表面。我想把它留给我的当铺。肯定能卖个好价钱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_bfd74b9f:

    # e "S-"
    e "塞——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_cb46fc35:

    # s "Wait- Is that a colony for ants? I can see the holes and those little guy running around like it can't see. What a silly creature."
    s "等等——那是蚂蚁的巢穴吗？我能看到那些洞，还有小家伙们像瞎了似的到处乱跑。真是可笑的小生物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_472ce726:

    # e "Seb!"
    e "塞巴斯！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_623ac400:

    # "The lion's joyful adventure in the green forest was brought to a halt, he freezes for a second before turning back to you."
    "那头狮子在绿意盎然的森林中的欢乐探险被迫中止，他僵住片刻，随后转身面向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_cac0f1e7:

    # s "Heyy! [e]! I almost forgot about you. The most beautiful product of nature. Let's see. What was I talking about."
    s "嘿！[e]！我差点把你忘了。大自然最美丽的造物。让我想想，我刚才说到哪儿了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_a34188ba:

    # e "Did you just forget we're in a middle of some sort of training?"
    e "你刚才是不是忘了我们正在进行某种训练？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_a6ff2a40:

    # s "Sorry buddy, I had a train of some crazy thoughts going on right now. Ok. A- sorry I was just really excited!"
    s "抱歉，老兄，我刚才脑子里正接连冒出一串疯狂的想法。好吧。呃——抱歉，我只是太兴奋了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_7fda2f6b:

    # s "It's super easy, alright. You can explore the surroundings. Sometimes there will be scary enemies to attack you, or cool things you can marvel at."
    s "这很简单，好吗？你可以探索周围的环境。有时会有可怕的敌人来攻击你，也会遇到让你惊叹的有趣东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_e1c15a68:

    # s "Look, there's a stone right there, if you explore enough. Surely you can collect some rocks, minerals, stones all sort of things."
    s "看，如果你探索得够多，那边就有一块石头。你肯定能收集到各种岩石、矿物、石头之类的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_da8eb826:

    # s "So that's it, that's the training."
    s "就是这样，这就是训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_3176989f:

    # e "That's it? Seb, we've just been here for 3 minutes."
    e "就这样？塞巴斯，我们才在这里待了三分钟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_8035989f:

    # s "Alright what do you want, some real expedition in action? I'm still running a business in Lusterfield, I have to get back before Ole gets angry at me."
    s "好吧，你是想来一次真正的探险吗？我还得在卢斯特菲尔德经营着生意，得在奥利对我发火之前赶回去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_4d568f64:

    # e "Ok... I thought we're gonna-"
    e "好吧……我还以为我们要——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_2bec8dba:

    # s "You know what you can do? You can collect some stones, and then report back to me. Is that a training you can get behind with?"
    s "你知道你能做什么吗？你可以收集一些石头，然后回来向我报告。这样的训练你能接受吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_f904611f:

    # e "You're not coming along?"
    e "你不跟我一起吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_d3e8b771:

    # s "I gotta get back! Plus, you can learn to read maps, and arrows for directions."
    s "我得回去了！而且，你也可以学着看地图，还有用箭头辨认方向。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_6fab5502:

    # e "Alright Seb. You are really gonna leave me here."
    e "好吧，塞巴斯。你真的要把我一个人留在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_49416a65:

    # s "Don't worry it's a part of the fun. I promise the next time we go out like this, we're gonna do something entirely different."
    s "别担心，这也是乐趣的一部分。我保证，下次我们像这样出来时，一定会做些完全不同的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_e8941347:

    # e "Oh...? Wha-"
    e "哦……？什——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_6b76ed7c:

    # s "You and me."
    s "你和我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_972a5561:

    # "Sebas looks deeply into your eyes, he winks at you and put both his hands into your palm."
    "塞巴斯深深凝视着你的双眼，朝你眨了眨眼，将双手放进你的掌心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_ba6a1755:

    # s "Something you're going to like, ok?"
    s "有件你会喜欢的事，好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_fdac3ef9:

    # e "O-ok."
    e "好、好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_dbd16924:

    # "As soon as he releases his hand, he begins to walk back towards the village, leaving you alone here in the green forest."
    "一松开你的手，他便开始朝村子走回去，把你独自留在这片绿意盎然的森林里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_a37b5e49:

    # e "ok..."
    e "好……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_1a28b338:

    # "You nudges your palms for a bit, seeing a few strips of orange fur are left on your hand, it makes you feel strangely tickled."
    "你轻轻搓了搓手掌，发现手上沾着几缕橙色毛发，弄得你感觉一阵怪痒。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Expedition_e69bb7e0:

    # "You quickly snap back to reality, what a strange conversation he left behind. You still need to bring 3 stones to him."
    "你很快回过神来。这段他留下的对话真奇怪。你还得给他带去3块石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_54885e9f:

    # e "So... Can you tell me more about Lusterfield?"
    e "那么……你能多告诉我一些关于卢斯特菲尔德的事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_43680178:

    # s "Look, [e]. I'm not an expert on the village history, but I can assure you that this is just your good old tutorial spawn."
    s "听着，[e]。我不是村庄历史方面的专家，但我可以向你保证，这不过是你熟悉的老教程出生点罢了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_a878cebf:

    # e "...what?"
    e "……什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_c0220710:

    # s "...You're supposed to laugh at the clever fourth wall breaking joke. [e]."
    s "……[e]，你本该为这个巧妙的打破第四面墙的笑话笑出来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_6276e539:

    # s "Anyways, you are safe here. No one would bother coming here and steal your wallet or something."
    s "总之，你在这里很安全。没人会特意跑来偷你的钱包之类的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_041012bd:

    # e "But what about the village...? Or do you know any people that I can talk to?"
    e "可村子呢……？或者，你知道有什么人我可以聊聊吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_92a4cff3:

    # s "Well obviously me and Ole."
    s "那当然是我和奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_e9650e99:

    # s "You can visit Rahim's shop if you insist, I'm pretty sure he will be glad to talk to you, as long as you don't break any of his rules."
    s "你要是坚持，可以去雷希姆的店里找他。我敢肯定，只要你不违反他的任何规矩，他会很乐意和你聊聊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_6055333d:

    # s "Ahh... also Lothar's just wandering outside our shop on daytime. You should get along with that motherfucker and get him out of there."
    s "啊……还有，洛萨尔白天会在我们店外瞎转。你该跟那个狗娘养的搞好关系，把他弄走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_880e4b01:

    # e "Who is he...? Did something happen between you two?"
    e "他是谁……？你们俩之间发生过什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_3fc1e931:

    # s "Nothing, He just kicked me somewhere down there last week."
    s "没什么，他只是上周踢了我下边一脚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_281d0cbe:

    # "Sebas points at his crotch in annoyance. You can clearly feel he is not happy about it."
    "塞巴斯恼火地指了指自己的胯下。显然，他对此很不爽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_ce8f67bd:

    # s "My nuts hurt like hell. Why would he do that. Why did he think he can do that just because I accidentally took away his arrows. That guy is fucking insane I tell you."
    s "我的蛋蛋疼得要命。他干吗要那样做？就因为我不小心拿走了他的箭，他凭什么觉得自己能这么干？那家伙简直他妈疯了，我告诉你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_5b03cff7:

    # e "Alright... that's cool-"
    e "好吧……那挺好的——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_2073e362:

    # s "If you see him later, tell him Sebas' got the hardest fist in the whole Lusterfield and he should watch out for his own nuts."
    s "要是你之后见到他，就告诉他，整个卢斯特菲尔德就数塞巴斯的拳头最硬，让他看好自己的蛋蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_85e86bb4:

    # s "...Also You can visit the Nocturnal Trunk, uhhh... the inn around Rahim's place. You can take some jobs from Cane..."
    s "……你还可以去夜夜椿酒馆，呃……就是雷希姆那附近的旅馆。你可以从凯恩那里接些活……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_81551c7a:

    # e "What kind of job does he offer?"
    e "他提供什么工作？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_9b03d21a:

    # s "Nothing special to be honest, fetching him some materials would be enough for a few golds."
    s "说实话没什么特别的，帮他取些材料就能赚几枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_374a5206:

    # s "He seems kinda shady but I think you two will get along pretty nicely!"
    s "他看起来有点可疑，不过我觉得你们俩应该会相处得挺不错！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_94bf68d3:

    # s "That sounds wrong... but you know what I mean."
    s "听起来好像不太对……不过你懂我意思。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_b8857089:

    # e "Oh... I'll keep that in mind. Thanks Sebas."
    e "噢……我记住了。谢谢你，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_People_62030927:

    # s "No problem, my [e]."
    s "不客气，我的[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_d6a6b535:

    # e "Sebas, are we going to the river today?"
    e "塞巴斯，我们今天要去河边吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_2ffcb859:

    # s "Well it all depends on you buddy, are you ready?" nointeract
    s "那得看你了，伙计，准备好了吗？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_6a1fc445:

    # e "Yeah! I'm ready!"
    e "对！我准备好了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_45c15df6:

    # s "Sure... Then, Let's go."
    s "好……那我们走吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_4324853b:

    # e "No... I think I forgot about something else..."
    e "不……我好像忘了件别的事……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_47f5f487:

    # s "Take your precious time, mister [e]."
    s "您慢慢来，[e]先生。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_4d050774:

    # e "Oh.. Seb, where's Ole."
    e "噢……塞巴斯，奥利呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_4ed2b650:

    # s "I told him to take care of the shop. You know, I'm not going to let customers leave the shop disappointed."
    s "我让他帮忙照看店铺。你知道的，我可不会让顾客失望而离开店里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_aec509d8:

    # o "Or so you've heard. Kiddo, take care of Seb right here okay. I don't want him to lose an eyeball out there in the forest."
    o "至少你是这么听说的。小家伙，照看好塞巴斯，行吗？我可不想让他在森林里丢掉一只眼睛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_342e15d0:

    # o "And Seb, I packed you some lunch, right in your bag over there. Don't leave it too cold though."
    o "还有，塞巴斯，我给你装了些午餐，就在那边你包里。可别让它凉得太透了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_d2057b12:

    # s "Can we not talk about this in front of [e]."
    s "能不能别当着[e]的面说这个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_665c727e:

    # e "Hey, Ole. I was asking if you'd come as well."
    e "嘿，奥利，我是想问你要不要也一起去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_e2a30109:

    # o "I trust you have more than enough abilities to protect this little fuzzy lion. You three will be fine."
    o "我相信你们肯定有足够的本事保护好这只毛茸茸的小狮子。你们三个去没问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_40910768:

    # s "Haha I'm oweing good old Ole a huge favour. So, here I am. Going out with my favourite roommate."
    s "哈哈，我可是欠老奥利一个大人情。所以我这不是来了嘛，和我最喜欢的室友一起出门。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_ed8ed017:

    # o "Well, stay safe out there. And Seb, don't forget to get me the herbs."
    o "嗯，路上小心。还有，塞巴斯，别忘了帮我把草药带回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_698ca104:

    # s "It's time to go, take care of the shop for me alright!"
    s "该走了，帮我照看好店，行吗！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_9c2694db:

    # e "Goodbye, Ole!"
    e "再见，奥利！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_fa3626e6:

    # s "I think Lothar is- Yeah, he's right there."
    s "我觉得洛萨尔他——对，他就在那儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_a0d76f46:

    # l "...Lion you moron. The lizard prescribed me with the ointment down there and it still hurts like hell to just walk."
    l "……狮子，你这个白痴。那只蜥蜴给我开了治疗下面的药膏，可现在光是走路都疼得要命。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_c281f71b:

    # l "Not to mention you kicked me in the dick, not balls."
    l "更别提你踢的是我的鸡巴，不是卵蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_7c53f79d:

    # e "Lothar, are you feeling alright?"
    e "洛萨尔，你感觉还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_2143477d:

    # s "He's good, I might as well give him another kick to revert the damage."
    s "他好着呢，那我不妨再踢他一脚，以毒攻毒把伤治好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_9b27900c:

    # l "...Disciple, don't think I'll forget about what you did yesterday."
    l "……徒弟，别以为我会忘记你昨天干的好事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_4331981b:

    # e "...Ok."
    e "……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_acb95ff4:

    # s "Just a taste of his own medicine. Plus, I didn't think he'll come with us today."
    s "自作自受罢了。而且我没想到他今天还会跟我们一起走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_ae659de6:

    # l "I have to lead you to where I found the stone, don't I? You two will just get lost and die without the hero's interference."
    l "我得带你们去我发现那块石头的地方，不是吗？没有这位英雄插手，你们两个只会迷路，然后死在路上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_d64ded9d:

    # e "Hey... Stop arguing you two, let's just go there and find out what's wrong with the rock."
    e "嘿……你们两个别吵了，我们直接过去看看那块石头到底出了什么问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_fa3626e6_1:

    # s "I think Lothar is- Yeah, he's right there."
    s "我正想说洛萨尔——嗯，他就在那儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_4cfbfdfa:

    # l "Here I am, the hero of Lusterfield. The Myth, The Lege-"
    l "我来了，卢斯特菲尔德的英雄。神话、传说——"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_7fdbb1b2:

    # s "Yeah, it's him, we should get going now."
    s "没错，就是他。我们现在该出发了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_f34f5654:

    # e "Uhh- how are you doing Lothar?"
    e "呃——洛萨尔，你感觉怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_732d2508:

    # l "Disciple, I suppose you remember what happened yesterday with the lion."
    l "徒弟，我想你还记得昨天那头狮子的事吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_86ca7079:

    # l "I came in there with a transaction opportunity, and he threatened me with a, kick in the nuts."
    l "我本来是带着一桩交易上门的，结果他却威胁要踢我的卵蛋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_bc738f13:

    # s "Uh Huh. Tread carefully, Lothar. You won't know when the payback will come, maybe not yesterday, but most certainly today if you keep talking."
    s "嗯哼。说话小心点，洛萨尔。你可不知道报应什么时候会来。昨天也许没来，但你要是继续唠叨，今天肯定会来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_d64ded9d_1:

    # e "Hey... Stop arguing you two, let's just go there and find out what's wrong with the rock."
    e "嘿……你们两个别吵了，我们直接过去看看那块石头到底出了什么问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_cf261612:

    # "The three of you continue on the adventure. Sebas and Lothar don't seem to get along too well, only occassionally asking about your experience in the village."
    "你们三人继续踏上冒险之旅。塞巴斯和洛萨尔似乎不太合得来，只是偶尔问起你在村子里的经历。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_ee40bd66:

    # "You feel a little awkward walking between the two dudes, their arguing slowly turns into quietness."
    "夹在这两个家伙中间走路，让你觉得有些尴尬。他们的争吵渐渐变成了沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_6bfa80dd:

    # "But after a few minutes of silence, you decide to break the stalemate..."
    "但沉默了几分钟后，你决定打破僵局……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_687a2434:

    # e "Hey, Lothar. Where exactly did you find the stone?"
    e "嘿，洛萨尔。你到底是在什么地方发现那块石头的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_f07dfb58:

    # l "Hmm, on the riverside, usually there are spears around there, I just walked past it."
    l "嗯，在河边。那附近通常会有长矛，我只是从旁边走了过去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_1c8909c9:

    # e "Did you see any other people around there?"
    e "你在那附近还看到其他人吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_22f1245b:

    # l "Of course no. I was just strolling around, slaying slimes and bunch of stuff."
    l "当然没有。我只是在附近闲逛，杀杀史莱姆之类的，顺便解决了一堆杂七杂八的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_da834acc:

    # l "But now that you said it, after you arrived, there has been so much more sighting of buggbears."
    l "不过既然你提到了这件事，自从你来了之后，熊地精的踪迹确实多了不少。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_d808cf9f:

    # e "Buggbears?"
    e "熊地精？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_ccff677a:

    # s "Oh yeah, those big ones that took over the goat's outpost a while ago."
    s "没错，就是前阵子占领了山羊前哨站的那些大块头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_de073bb4:

    # l "They're extremely vicious when they go about their business. I'd suggest you not to approach them without me nearby."
    l "它们办事时凶残得很。没有我在你身边，你最好别靠近它们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_ba0230e5:

    # e "Hmm, I'll be sure to take a look around more, with you."
    e "嗯，有你陪着，我一定会多留意周围。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_be1b1da8:

    # s "Buddy, did you just forget I'm still by your side?"
    s "老兄，你是不是忘了我还在你身边？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_039a4f7a:

    # e "Hey, Seb. What's with your fascination of stones?"
    e "嘿，塞巴斯。你怎么会对石头这么着迷？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_fd1c938b:

    # s "My stones? No, they just sells good prices to the merchants around the continents. I'm just making sure I do my part in the classification."
    s "我的石头？不，它们只是能以好价钱卖给各地商人。我只是想尽自己的一份力，把它们分类清楚。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_15224dd2:

    # s "And possibly earn some good money from those stones. Some of them got me over a thousand gold, that's insane."
    s "而且还能靠这些石头赚上一大笔。有些石头能卖到一千多枚金币，简直不可思议。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_3a8c19d0:

    # l "Yeah, I thought mine looks pretty much like your expensive ones."
    l "嗯，我觉得我的这块看起来和你那些昂贵的石头差不多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_4321f573:

    # s "It certainly does, but they're made of the same material, this one, its stripes are glowing all the time."
    s "确实很像，但它们材质相同；只是这块的条纹一直在发光。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_0c570764:

    # e "Doesn't it looks like, the pattern from the members of goat tribe?"
    e "这看起来不像山羊部落成员身上的图案吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_24e49831:

    # s "We need much more information than that to confirm if it's from them."
    s "光凭这个还远远不够，我们需要更多信息才能确认它是否来自山羊部族。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_69a04679:

    # e "Seb, you seem... weirdly serious when you get into making out this weird stone."
    e "塞巴斯，你研究这块怪石头时，似乎……认真得有点不寻常。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_533871c2:

    # s "Do I?"
    s "是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_f3a2c66f:

    # s "Well, I can get into making out with you instead."
    s "那我也可以改成和你亲热啊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_ca49f6c2:

    # l "Lion, stop flirting with my disciple, you buffoon."
    l "狮子，别跟我的徒弟调情，你这个蠢货。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_c9891949:

    # "Sebas and Lothar continues arguing for a while."
    "塞巴斯和洛萨尔又争论了一阵。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_04c95e82:

    # e "Ahhhh- I think we're getting close to the river."
    e "啊——我觉得我们快到河边了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_fa1173b2:

    # "You three arrive very quickly. There's a lot of small cavern around the hills nearby."
    "你们三个很快就到了。附近的山丘间有许多小洞穴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_7ddafa91:

    # s "How about splitting right here? I'll collect the water sample and Lothar you should find if there's any other similar rocks."
    s "不如就在这里分头行动？我来采集水样，洛萨尔，你去找找看还有没有其他类似的石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_ee6de3bd:

    # l "I accept your arrangement, lion."
    l "我接受你的安排，狮子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_ff398f5a:

    # s "Then [e], how about you guarding for us and make sure no dangerous animal comes by?"
    s "那么，[e]，你来替我们放哨，确保没有危险的野兽靠近，好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_d8f5bbfa:

    # e "Yes, boss."
    e "遵命，老大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_ac222919:

    # s "Haha, do I look like a boss to you now all of a sudden. Now get going, we'll be back soon."
    s "哈哈，我怎么突然就成你老大了？好了，出发吧，我们很快就回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_4c43ac1b:

    # "The three of you split in the mossy river. You stay in place and look around the scenery, everything is covered in green. The air is surprisingly fresh."
    "你们三人在长满苔藓的河边分开。你留在原地，环顾四周的景色，入目尽是一片绿色。空气出奇地清新。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_b35ddf5a:

    # "Sebas and Lothar walks in opposite direction, you glance at their back before they disappear from your field of vision."
    "塞巴斯和洛萨尔朝相反的方向走去。你望着他们的背影，直到他们消失在视野中。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_72cd4c94:

    # "You sit there, wait for Sebas and Lothar to return."
    "你坐在那里，等着塞巴斯和洛萨尔回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_26c05388:

    # "To pass the time, you begin to daydream about being in the room with Sebas, or Lothar."
    "为了消磨时间，你开始幻想着和塞巴斯或洛萨尔共处一室。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_aa67a1da:

    # "They seem to have an unexplainable interest in you, somehow. Maybe you're just reading too much into it."
    "不知怎么的，他们似乎对你有着难以解释的兴趣。也许只是你想多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_a20cefa7:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_506d9f1d:

    # "Suddenly, you see a shadow in the reflection of the freshwater. You turn around, but there's nothing at all."
    "忽然，你在清澈河水的倒影中看到一个阴影。你转过身，却什么也没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_5696f3ed:

    # "You are afraid it's something dangerous, but it would be risky if you don't chase and find out what's happening."
    "你担心那是什么危险的东西，但如果不追上去查清楚发生了什么，同样会很冒险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_2e70013c:

    # e "Should I... investigate further, or stay until Sebas and Lothar are back?" nointeract
    e "我是该……继续调查，还是留下来等塞巴斯和洛萨尔回来？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_a99a1ed7:

    # "You climb up the hill and try to locate the shadow that you spotted."
    "你爬上山丘，试图找到刚才看到的那个阴影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_d2494669:

    # "But as soon as you get up, the shadow is already gone, leaving only a few footprints that leads to the somewhere else."
    "但你刚爬上去，阴影就已经消失了，只留下几个通往别处的脚印。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_2aa0f4a2:

    # e "Should I... follow the footprint?" nointeract
    e "我该……跟着这个脚印走吗？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_5b56cae2:

    # "You decide to follow it, you examine the trail carefully and walk along the hills."
    "你决定跟上去，仔细查看足迹，沿着山丘一路走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_404c6ccb:

    # "After some time, you have already reached the end of the trail, but there's no one to be seen."
    "过了一段时间，你已经走到了足迹的尽头，却看不到任何人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_6401572a:

    # "You scratch your head, dissappointed to have wasted your time tracking some weird footstep."
    "你挠了挠头，为了追踪那串古怪的脚印浪费时间而感到失望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_c66fb423:

    # e "I should really go back... Sebas and Lothar might have already come back."
    e "我还是赶快回去吧……塞巴斯和洛萨尔可能已经回来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_1691befa:

    # "As you turn back, you see the same shadow looming over you."
    "你转过身，便看见同一个阴影笼罩在你头顶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_6a38af3b:

    # "The figure is mostly green, its moss tries to wrap around you but you escape in time."
    "那个身影大部分呈绿色，身上的苔藓试图缠住你，但你及时逃脱了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_6b932964:

    # "There is no point following something that has already left the river. You climb back down the hill and wait for Sebas and Lothar to come back."
    "追踪一个已经离开河边的东西没有意义。你爬下山丘，等着塞巴斯和洛萨尔回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_2bb27b5f:

    # "You convince yourself that it must just be the wind, so you wait for Sebas and Lothar to come back."
    "你说服自己那一定只是风，于是等待着塞巴斯和洛萨尔回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_a20cefa7_1:

    # "..."
    "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_dca07d20:

    # "You relax yourself at the riverside, but another shadow emerges in the water again."
    "你在河边放松下来，可水中又浮现出另一个阴影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_9cdf1661:

    # "You immediately look back, but it's already too late. A huge green monster punches you in the head."
    "你立刻回头，可惜已经太迟了。一只巨大的绿色怪物一拳打中了你的脑袋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_874d50d9:

    # "SMACK!!"
    "砰！！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_2689c632:

    # "Your HP drops by 20."
    "你的生命值下降了20点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_8285af27:

    # e "Thanks for the help, Lothar. But I think I can handle myself."
    e "谢谢你的帮助，洛萨尔。不过我想我自己应付得来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_bf3d80d2:

    # l "You think? Well, think again. If not for me you'd be beaten to a pulp in a few seconds."
    l "你觉得？那就再想想。要不是我，你几秒钟内就会被打成肉酱。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_03691e81:

    # e "Alright. You're right, Lothar. Thank you for saving my life."
    e "好吧。你说得对，洛萨尔。谢谢你救了我一命。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_8db3fb9f:

    # l "Good Disciple."
    l "好徒弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_e2efe2c8:

    # e "So... what's the creature?"
    e "那么……这是什么生物？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_735a3e09:

    # e "Oh... my... What was this creature...?"
    e "天啊……这……究竟是什么生物……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_576265f8:

    # l "What happened."
    l "怎么回事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_bb959436:

    # e "Holy- You scared me Lothar."
    e "我靠——洛萨尔，你吓死我了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_7ed598ae:

    # "Lothar appears behind where the golem stands, looking at the fallen golem."
    "洛萨尔出现在石魔像原本站立处的后方，望着倒下的石魔像。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_3a0ca304:

    # l "Seems like I was too late to the party."
    l "看来我来得太晚了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_93ac05f1:

    # e "The Golem, it attacked me. What's this creature?"
    e "石魔像袭击了我。这是什么生物？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_df8a72bb:

    # l "I don't know... I haven't seen a golem before. Especially this one with moss on it."
    l "我不知道……我以前从没见过石魔像，尤其是这种身上长满苔藓的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_523b7c75:

    # l "Now that I think of it... the stone I found. It might have been his hand."
    l "现在想来……我找到的那块石头，可能就是他的手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_667c90ed:

    # e "What? Why did you take his hand?"
    e "什么？你为什么拿走了他的手？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_8ecdfc69:

    # l "It was glowing in the dark. I just picked it up near the river. Something might have been going on without our knowledge."
    l "它在黑暗中发着光。我只是在河边把它捡了起来。我们不知道的时候，可能发生过什么事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_d5e7b16d:

    # l "We best wait for the lion to come back, he must be watching the grass grow or something."
    l "最好还是等那头狮子回来，他肯定又在看草长什么的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_4546f89d:

    # "You and Lothar wait for a few minutes before Sebas comes back."
    "你和洛萨尔等了几分钟，塞巴斯才回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_4b0c7302:

    # s "What the fuck is going on!"
    s "他妈的，到底怎么回事！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_362f8a21:

    # l "It's a Golem, calm your ass down, lion."
    l "只是个石魔像，狮子，冷静点。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_0c8c311f:

    # s "I was collecting samples out there for just a few minutes and now you're telling me [e] killed a golem?"
    s "我才出去采集了几分钟样本，现在你就告诉我[e]杀了一尊石魔像？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_7d8d5ca6:

    # e "Hey, Lothar helped as well."
    e "嘿，洛萨尔也帮忙了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_b51d8e01:

    # e "Hey, I didn't know there're monsters here."
    e "嘿，我不知道这里还有怪物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_43d72598:

    # s "I'm sorry, buddy. I shouldn't have left you alone here."
    s "抱歉，伙计。我不该把你一个人留在这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_99f888f5:

    # l "My disciple can take care of himself. After all, he learnt all his fighting tricks from me."
    l "我的徒弟能照顾好自己。毕竟，他那些战斗技巧可都是跟我学的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_e7b3ef51:

    # s "Hey, look. Your stone is his left hand."
    s "嘿，你看。你的石头就是他的左手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_348bb016:

    # l "Yeah we discovered this like ten minutes ago."
    l "对啊，我们大概十分钟前就发现了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_51c5edec:

    # e "So, what's wrong with the golem?"
    e "那么，这个石魔像到底怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_d96dc918:

    # s "It is conjured by someone, very intelligent I suppose. But why the mossy stone?"
    s "这应该是某人召唤出来的，我想那人一定非常聪明。但为什么偏偏是长满苔藓的石头？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_32d5d209:

    # l "A rolling stone gathers no moss."
    l "滚石不生苔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_592268fe:

    # s "Ok, you are being too obvious with this line. Holy Fuck."
    s "好吧，你这句话也太明显了。妈的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_8be7194f:

    # e "Hmm... so what's your findings?"
    e "呃……那你有什么发现？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_972be202:

    # s "Let me get the rock sample..."
    s "让我取些岩石样本……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_dcb41728:

    # "As Sebas touches the golem, it immediately crumbles into dust and particles, even the moss is gone now..."
    "塞巴斯一碰到石魔像，它立刻崩解成尘土和碎屑，连苔藓也消失了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_010dee8f:

    # l "Good job, lion."
    l "干得漂亮，狮子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_e1554201:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_5abc6d37:

    # s "I can gather some more details by myself later here. But we should go back now, we don't know if there's any other golems here."
    s "我之后可以自己再来这里收集更多细节。但我们现在该回去了，谁也不知道这里还有没有其他石魔像。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_9f876c20:

    # l "Look, I will protect you two."
    l "听着，我会保护你们两个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_b8a57d04:

    # s "Uhh- no thanks. Let's go buddy."
    s "呃——不用了，谢谢。我们走吧，伙计。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_3ea0d516:

    # "The three of you travel back to Lusterfield. Sebas and Lothar are arguing, as usual."
    "你们三人回到了卢斯特菲尔德。塞巴斯和洛萨尔像往常一样争论不休。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_532527bf:

    # "You are walking in between them, occasionally getting bumped by one of them's beefy shoulder."
    "你走在两人中间，时不时被其中一人粗壮的肩膀撞到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_edac0ace:

    # "Glancing at both of them, they seem to be oddly enjoying each other's company, despite all the taunting and dickering."
    "你瞥了两人一眼，尽管他们一路互相嘲弄、拌嘴，看起来却诡异地享受着彼此的陪伴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_49095450:

    # "Soon, you three are back to the shop."
    "很快，你们三人回到了店里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_a462b1fa:

    # l "Lion, what do I get from the stone?"
    l "狮子，这块石头你出多少钱？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_cd5e1f04:

    # s "How about 800 gold. I'm already being too generous with the pricing."
    s "八百金币怎么样？我这个报价已经够慷慨了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_b12dfa22:

    # l "...900."
    l "……九百。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_f49cfa97:

    # s "850."
    s "八百五。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_42567b5c:

    # l "You're pushing it lion."
    l "你这就太过分了，狮子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_e1554201_1:

    # s "..."
    s "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_d3f09a02:

    # s "700."
    s "七百。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_a0a9af2e:

    # l "Ok. Ok. 850 gold."
    l "好，好，八百五十枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_c804e434:

    # "Sebas hands Lothar the gold while he takes the stone away, putting it in a precious box."
    "塞巴斯把金币递给洛萨尔，洛萨尔则拿走石头，将它放进一个贵重的盒子里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_23a2ad3b:

    # e "Wait... this rock is worth 850 gold?"
    e "等等……这块石头值八百五十枚金币？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_ccb68d62:

    # s "Yeah, buddy. It's no ordinary glowing stone. It contains a fragment of the golem's soul."
    s "没错，老铁。这可不是普通的发光石头，里面蕴含着石魔像的一块灵魂碎片。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_8721fd8e:

    # s "I can fetch a great price selling it to those merchants, at least 1200 gold."
    s "把它卖给那些行商，至少能卖到1200枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_98afcb57:

    # e "Oh... that sounds really good. Can I buy it?"
    e "哦……听起来真不错。我能买下它吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_02ba1cc7:

    # s "Yeah. Sure you can, but no discount this time."
    s "可以，当然可以，不过这次可没有折扣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_58e8097e:

    # e "Hmm... I'll think about it."
    e "嗯……让我想想吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_d7ad2fbf:

    # l "So, lion. We're done here?"
    l "那么，狮子，咱们完事了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_a5beefa5:

    # s "Yeah, I will have to see you later. Lothar."
    s "嗯，回头还得再见了，洛萨尔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_dd9aa13f:

    # l "Alright. Guess I should pick up another stone next time."
    l "好吧。看来下次我该再捡一块石头了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_39385698:

    # "Lothar nods to you two and leaves the shop."
    "洛萨尔朝你们两人点了点头，离开了当铺。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_5e133033:

    # s "Hey, buddy. I'm gonna polish my rock here. You're free to go now."
    s "嘿，老铁。我打算就在这儿把石头打磨一下。你现在可以走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_65b11dcd:

    # e "Ummm... can I ask a question, Seb?"
    e "唔……我能问你个问题吗，阿塞？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_60314747:

    # s "What's up, [e]."
    s "怎么了，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_788836b5:

    # e "Can we hang out sometimes later, like this, I really enjoyed the time we had."
    e "以后我们还能像今天这样，偶尔一起出去玩吗？和你们一起的这段时间，我真的很开心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_cd5e4e16:

    # e "Minus the arguing with Lothar part of course."
    e "当然，除了和洛萨尔争吵的那部分。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_b3b9c0e8:

    # s "Hmm..."
    s "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_03bdd77b:

    # s "Maybe if you found another interesting place to go."
    s "也许吧，前提是你能找到另一个有趣的去处。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_96e6bfdd:

    # e "R-really?"
    e "真、真的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_f66377fb:

    # s "I mean. I'm really busy for most of the day. And I have already used my only day-off of the year to go out with you and Lothar."
    s "我是说，我一天大部分时间都很忙。而且我今年唯一的一天休假，已经用来和你还有洛萨尔一起出门了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_d80b560d:

    # s "We can fool around. I had a great idea about what we're gonna do though."
    s "我们可以一起玩玩。不过，我倒是想到了一个关于我们要做什么的好主意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_2c20eff0:

    # s "We'll talk later, alright? Stay safe, buddy. And don't get hit by another rock."
    s "我们之后再聊，好吗？注意安全，老铁。还有，别再被别的石头砸到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_34609ea0:

    # e "Oh. O-ok, see you then, Seb."
    e "哦，好、好的。那回头见，阿塞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_77059830:

    # s "Hmm... Sorry buddy. I'm just too busy in the shop. And I used my only day-off of the year to go out with you and Lothar."
    s "嗯……抱歉，老铁。我在当铺实在太忙了，而且我今年唯一的一天休假已经用来和你还有洛萨尔一起出门了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_2805b6d9:

    # e "O-oh... Ok."
    e "哦、哦……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_7b9a2aa2:

    # s "I really don't have much spare time, I guess."
    s "我想我平时确实没多少空闲时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_abd13d79:

    # e "It's alright, Seb."
    e "没关系，阿塞。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_7e1c4b82:

    # s "Yeah? Promise me you won't get angry because of me?"
    s "真的吗？你保证不会因为我生气吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_77b7b9ad:

    # e "Yes... I don't mind."
    e "嗯……我不介意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_ef5e8879:

    # s "Haha then we'll talk later, alright? Stay safe, buddy. Don't get hit by another rock."
    s "哈哈，那我们之后再聊，好吗？注意安全，伙计。别再被石头砸到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_dd403f9f:

    # e "O-ok, see you then, Seb."
    e "好、好的。那待会儿见，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_8c6daad4:

    # "Sebas gives you a nod while continue looking at his newly-acquired rock."
    "塞巴斯点点头，继续打量他新得到的石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_caba8e48:

    # "He doesn't seem to concerned of you... compared to your first meeting. You feel a little uneasy, as if you did something wrong."
    "和你们第一次见面相比……他似乎没那么在乎你了。你感到有些不安，仿佛自己做错了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Lothar_Adventure_End_e62911c6:

    # "But at the end, you decide it's better for you to continue with your adventure."
    "但最后，你还是决定继续自己的冒险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_11916a45:

    # e "Hey, I saw you were here when Lothar and I were... uhh.. talking outside."
    e "嘿，我看到我和洛萨尔在外面……呃……聊天时，你就在那儿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_6a8feff3:

    # s "Oh... Haha. You two were having some kind of heated fighter moments didn't you."
    s "哦……哈哈。你们俩当时是在进行某种激烈的战士较量吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_7e5be565:

    # e "What?"
    e "什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_0eecf8dd:

    # s "Yeah. Alright. I was there. Lothar is a weird dude, don't get me wrong, he is just not right in the head."
    s "对，没错。我当时就在那儿。别误会，洛萨尔是个怪人，他就是脑子不太正常。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_aedfda95:

    # e "Is he always like this?"
    e "他一直都这样吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_1681d463:

    # s "I don't know, I didn't talk to him before he become some sort of hero of the village. People were grateful for his act. But he always takes it too far."
    s "我不知道，在他成为村里的某种英雄之前，我没跟他聊过。大家都很感激他的所作所为，但他总是做得太过火。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_4524c4c6:

    # s "Since then he became more and more arrogant. I should've warned you more about him, [e]... and my balls... they're still sore from his fucking high kick."
    s "从那以后，他变得越来越傲慢。我本该多提醒你一些关于他的事，[e]……还有我的蛋蛋……被他那该死的高踢腿踢过后，到现在还在酸痛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_97e035d9:

    # s "Needless to say, that guy has a really flexible legs."
    s "不用说，那家伙的腿可真够灵活的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_08a07fa9:

    # e "You ok there...?"
    e "你那儿还好吗……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_f84eaf16:

    # s "I might need a reliev... I- uh... nevermind. haha- what? Yes, they are still functional."
    s "我可能需要点缓解……我——呃……算了。哈哈——你说什么？对，它们还能正常工作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_9251c495:

    # e "Seb, what the hell are you talking about."
    e "塞巴斯，你到底在说什么鬼话？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_ee9bf62a:

    # s "Look, I'm just telling you, that Lothar guy is a huge bully. I just don't want him to give you any troubles."
    s "听着，我只是想告诉你，洛萨尔那家伙就是个大恶霸。我只是不想让他给你找麻烦。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Lusterfield_Lothar_35005525:

    # e "Ok... thanks, Sebas."
    e "好吧……谢谢你，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Himself_58e0c1b1:

    # e "Soo... what about you?"
    e "所以……你呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Himself_b41e0382:

    # s "What about me?"
    s "我呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Himself_fe52139a:

    # e "Yeah, what are you up to?"
    e "对啊，你在忙什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Himself_56ec969e:

    # s "Me? I don't know, just bored from all the cashier stuff."
    s "我？我也不知道，就是被那些收银的活儿弄得无聊透顶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Himself_24f1ed08:

    # s "Ole is cleaning the shelves like usual, nothing is happening right now."
    s "奥利像往常一样在清理货架，现在没发生什么事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Himself_44fb5f5e:

    # s "I'd say it's a normal day for a normal lion like me."
    s "我会说，对我这样普通的狮子来说，这就是普通的一天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Himself_28aef9ad:

    # e "That sounds cozy."
    e "听起来挺惬意的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Kingspawn_62644bd3:

    # e "Hey Seb, how's it in the shop?"
    e "嘿，塞巴斯，店里怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Kingspawn_6cae6188:

    # s "Ha. You're a curious dragon, aren't you."
    s "哈，你可真是条好奇的龙，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Kingspawn_caa13b9e:

    # s "Well I manage the shop from 7am to 11pm every day. With the help of Ole, of course. He helps me restock most of the products here, every Monday and Thursday."
    s "嗯，我每天早上七点到晚上十一点管理这家店。当然了，也有奥利帮忙。他每周一和周四都会帮我补充这里的大部分货物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Kingspawn_e41f6ecd:

    # s "People pawns expensive stuff in this house. I had some clients that gave me like a thousand gold worth of pledges."
    s "人们会把贵重物品拿到这家店典当。我有些客人拿来的当物，价值大概有一千枚金币。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Kingspawn_539b2455:

    # e "But how do pawn shops work?"
    e "不过，当铺到底是怎么运作的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Kingspawn_5e9eab5a:

    # s "I offer loans based on the value of their collaterals, the item I mean. And they can redeem it back sometimes later for the value of the loan plus a percentage of interest."
    s "我会根据他们抵押物的价值，也就是当物的价值，提供贷款。他们有时可以过一阵子再来赎回当物，支付贷款金额再加上一部分利息就行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Kingspawn_97fd1d0c:

    # s "But after a certain period of time if they don't come back with the money, I'll just put it on the display and sell their collaterals."
    s "不过，过了一段时间，如果他们没带钱回来，我就会把当物摆出来，卖掉它们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Kingspawn_6ab80891:

    # s "That's where the word \"shop\" comes, we also do normal shop thing. People can buy and sell whatever they want."
    s "“当铺”这个词就是这么来的，我们也做普通商店的生意。大家想买什么、卖什么都可以。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Kingspawn_53a641c1:

    # e "Oh... So if I sell you a necklace that worth 100 gold. I have to buy it back later for something like 105 gold?"
    e "哦……所以，如果我把一条价值100枚金币的项链卖给你，之后就得花105枚金币左右再买回来？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Kingspawn_d8e7794e:

    # s "Technically, it starts from 140 gold. But I always give my roomies a huge discount. So don't worry about it, hehe."
    s "严格来说，起价是140枚金币。不过我总会给室友们大幅优惠。所以不用担心，嘿嘿。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Kingspawn_22dfefd3:

    # e "Wait really? Thanks Seb. What's the discount?"
    e "等等，真的吗？谢谢你，塞巴斯。能打几折？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Kingspawn_9e671f88:

    # s "The interest is 50 percent off for you! That's almost half. And don't worry, I won't sell your important items."
    s "你的利息可以打五折！这几乎相当于减半了。而且别担心，我不会卖掉你的重要物品。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Kingspawn_29068210:

    # e "Awww... Sweet!"
    e "呜呜……真贴心！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Kingspawn_6cce255c:

    # s "No problem, [e]. It's nice seeing my buddy smile."
    s "没事，[e]。看到我的朋友露出笑容，我也很开心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_90950d51:

    # e "Hey, Seb. You seem to need some help...?"
    e "嘿，塞巴斯。你好像需要帮忙……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_be6f711a:

    # "You see Sebas glances at his rocks, and then glances back at you."
    "你看到塞巴斯瞥了眼他的石头，又回头看向你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_c17965eb:

    # s "Hah, roomie."
    s "哈，室友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_7e902763:

    # e "Seb...?"
    e "塞巴斯……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_d2c9a774:

    # s "You can help with the crates. If you so wish."
    s "你可以帮忙搬箱子，如果你愿意的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_6c3f32a2:

    # e "Uhmm... How can I help again...?"
    e "呃……我又能帮什么忙来着……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_c1f48888:

    # s "You know, we used to trade with the goats, a lot."
    s "你知道的，我们以前经常和那些山羊做交易。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_444c8d65:

    # s "Hasn't been the case for a long time, heh..."
    s "这种情况已经很久没有了，嘿嘿……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_ef545050:

    # s "Anyways, usually Big Ol' Ole here should deal with inventory..."
    s "总之，平时应该由这里的大个子奥利负责库存……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_a53156e2:

    # s "I uh... [e]?"
    s "我呃……[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_4a173f68:

    # e "Seb... What's wrong with you?"
    e "塞……你怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_dfa81b29:

    # s "N-nothing out of the ordinary! I'm serious."
    s "没、没什么异常！我是认真的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_102c60a7:

    # s "Wanna help a lion out?"
    s "想帮帮一头狮子吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_79d025fa:

    # "Sebas scratches the back of his head. Needless to say, you are surprised at his attitude, he seems... a little more fidgety and nervous."
    "塞巴斯挠了挠后脑勺。不用说，你被他的态度惊到了——他似乎……比平时更加坐立不安，也更加紧张。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_8fc16e06:

    # e "S-sure."
    e "好、好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_94acff4a:

    # s "Well what did I say, who needs a wagon when your pocket's got more space than the wagon itself."
    s "我怎么说来着？既然你的口袋比马车本身还能装，谁还需要马车啊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_c73d7c9d:

    # s "So, take my crates, give them to Furkan."
    s "所以，拿上我的木箱，把它们交给弗坎。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_a8bcbaf5:

    # s "It's sealed magically by magic."
    s "这是用魔法封住的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_fba0ac48:

    # e "W-wait, you are resuming your trade route with the goats?"
    e "等、等等，你要恢复和那些山羊的商路了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_b0a7646d:

    # s "It's about time I get my hand back on those little minerals and fur."
    s "我总算能重新拿到那些小矿石和毛皮了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_aab6b701:

    # e "What about Rahim, he doesn't seem welcoming to the goats...?"
    e "那雷希姆呢？他看起来不太欢迎那些山羊……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_1fcfa1ff:

    # s "Don't worry roomie, I can convince him pretty easily with my illustrious charm."
    s "别担心，室友。我靠自己非凡的魅力，很容易就能说服他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_75894e31:

    # e "...Is he that easily charmed."
    e "……他这么容易就会被迷住吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_6423db19:

    # s "Yes of course, last time he gave me a 50 percent off offer, just after 2 hours of seeing my huge charm."
    s "当然了。上次他见识了我两个小时的巨大魅力后，就给了我五折优惠。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_2a474349:

    # e "2 hours!?"
    e "两个小时！？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_aaa2c48c:

    # s "Yep... He's pretty charmed. Even though he kind of wanted me gone after the trade. I suppose it wore off."
    s "没错……他确实挺迷我的。虽然交易结束后，他似乎又有点想让我赶紧走。我想，那魅力已经消退了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_1db78d3b:

    # "You stare at the lion, and he's just laughing on his own, somehow reverting back to the old Seb you know."
    "你注视着那头狮子，只见他自顾自地笑着，仿佛又变回了你熟悉的那个塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_73713eda:

    # "Seeing the smile plastered on his cheeks, you sigh a breath of relief."
    "看到他脸上挂满笑容，你如释重负地叹了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_7115ea73:

    # e "A-alright."
    e "好、好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_8c2697f2:

    # s "Anyway, crates! Furkan has a deal with us, so...."
    s "总之，木箱！弗坎和我们有约定，所以……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_83461b27:

    # s "Take the crates to... his general? And they'll give you another crate to carry back to us."
    s "把木箱送到……他的将军那里？然后他们会再给你一个木箱，让你带回来交给我们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_73bf2586:

    # s "Just telling you, that general really doesn't like jokes."
    s "先告诉你一声，那位将军真的不喜欢开玩笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_b767d2ed:

    # s "Like Rahim, but boring."
    s "就像雷希姆一样，只不过无聊多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_e955bf51:

    # e "Mhm..."
    e "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_3d8fe4b2:

    # s "So... take the job? I'll give you a special stone... in return." nointeract
    s "所以……你接下这活儿？我会给你一块特别的石头……作为交换。" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_852f9998:

    # e "A-alright, give me the crates."
    e "好、好吧，把木箱给我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_500761b2:

    # s "Sure thing, here."
    s "当然，给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_ae463931:

    # "Sebas points at the wooden crates, he picks it up and casually drops it on your arms."
    "塞巴斯指了指木箱，拿起箱子，随手放到你臂弯里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_501a2faf:

    # s "Don't lose them! It's worth mor-... uh... worth less than you... but still. Be careful."
    s "别弄丢了！它们可比你值钱……呃……没你值钱……不过还是要小心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_1acb87f8:

    # e "I will!"
    e "我会的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_9186b924:

    # e "M-maybe later?"
    e "或、或许晚点？"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Ask_Transport_Task_171d3f78:

    # s "Heh, sure thing."
    s "嘿，行啊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Dialogue_End_c11c2b4e:

    # e "That's all for now, Seb."
    e "我暂时就先到这儿了，塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Sebas_Dialogue_End_83578b3f:

    # s "Hehe, take care buddy."
    s "嘿嘿，保重啊，伙计。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_e0dbc7b6:

    # o "Hey, [e]. Finally got to see you in the tavern."
    o "嘿，[e]。总算在酒馆见到你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_71de36ec:

    # e "Oh, Ole! I didn't really expect you to hang out here."
    e "哦，奥利！真没想到你会在这儿待着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_188d1815:

    # o "Well... Seb asked me so much time to come with him... I have got to take care of this dumb lion."
    o "嗯……塞巴斯一直叫我跟他一起来……我只好照看这头蠢狮子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_eb1f2d15:

    # o "And he's not even conscious now... I would have to drag him back to the shop..."
    o "而且他现在连意识都没有……我还得把他拖回店里……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_1fd3cab6:

    # e "You- feeling okay with Cane?"
    e "你——你和凯恩相处得还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_03dc518a:

    # o "I'll have to see for my eyes, but if you vouched for him, he wouldn't be that bad, I presume."
    o "我得亲眼看看，不过既然你替他担保，我想他应该没那么糟吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_59f084c6:

    # o "I didn't really know why I... disliked him, but Rahim really hated him for a while."
    o "我其实也不知道自己为什么……会讨厌他，不过雷希姆曾经也很恨他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_a2389219:

    # e "You should do what you want to do... Ole."
    e "你想怎么做就怎么做吧……奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_6c17abdb:

    # o "Sure, Sure. If Rahim changed now... Maybe I should too."
    o "好，好。如果雷希姆现在都改变了……或许我也该改变。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_21a2846f:

    # e "Alright, it's good to see you here."
    e "好吧，见到你在这儿真不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_883eda9c:

    # o "Same goes for me."
    o "我也是。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_b3a51e9e:

    # o "Hmm... I'm just avoiding him for now."
    o "嗯……我现在只是暂时躲着他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_3388a208:

    # e "Oh..."
    e "哦……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_de6d4da4:

    # o "I will always side with Rahim on this matter. I trust his judgement."
    o "这件事上，我永远都会站在雷希姆那边。我相信他的判断。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_dbc31872:

    # o "But it's still better to see for my eyes."
    o "不过，还是亲眼看看比较好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_2e4695c3:

    # e "Ole, you seem to rely on Rahim a lot."
    e "奥利，你似乎很依赖雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_bf0026fd:

    # o "A little, he knows a lot more stuff than I do, and he saved my life when I was still young."
    o "有一点吧，他比我懂得多得多，而且我还年轻的时候，他救过我的命。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_837dcc8c:

    # e "Aren't you... relatively young?"
    e "你……年纪不是也挺轻的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_7eb75f11:

    # o "Ahem, the older the wiser you are."
    o "咳，年纪越大，经验越丰富嘛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_0f792672:

    # o "Anyways, I've heard about you in the tavern, haha."
    o "不过话说回来，我在酒馆里听说过你，哈哈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_d7dcb9b5:

    # o "You sound like a real server now don't you, kiddo."
    o "你现在听起来还真像个老练的服务生，不是吗，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_0dbcc69a:

    # e "I-uh... do I sound really bad...?"
    e "我、呃……我听起来真的很糟吗……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_d18f171f:

    # o "Heh... I like you this way."
    o "呵……我喜欢你现在这个样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_77d70a21:

    # o "Hey, kiddo. Care to join for a quick while?"
    o "喂，小家伙。要不要过来陪我坐一会儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_6013b960:

    # e "Oh Ole! Nice to see you here in the tavern."
    e "哦，奥利！真高兴在酒馆见到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_9cb4ead1:

    # o "Hey kiddo."
    o "嗨，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_0842c711:

    # e "Ole, are you having enough bread here in the tavern?"
    e "奥利，你在这酒馆里有足够的面包吃吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_82c29b38:

    # o "Just enough for me to fill my belly. Cane should really consider opening a bakery as a side business."
    o "够填饱肚子的就行。凯恩真该考虑把开面包店当成副业。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_750bd25d:

    # o "Kiddo. Good to see you here."
    o "小家伙。很高兴在这儿见到你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_0bfcf9a5:

    # e "Ole! Is Seb still drunk?"
    e "奥利！塞巴斯还醉着吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_5cbfc025:

    # o "He's always been drunk the second he gets into Cane's place. You'll get used to his gibberish."
    o "他一进凯恩的店就一直是醉醺醺的。你慢慢就会习惯他的胡言乱语。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_92ed5e9b:

    # s "Eh- Ol-ol-ole who are you t-shtalking to..."
    s "呃——奥、奥、奥利，你在跟谁、谁说话……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_0401bcf7:

    # "You hear a loud burp between you and the lizard."
    "你听见你和那只蜥蜴之间传来一声响亮的嗝。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_b93ddb0b:

    # o "Hey, kiddo... Did you forget to put on your clothes."
    o "喂，小家伙……你是不是忘了穿衣服。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_74db1a7f:

    # e "Yes..."
    e "是的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_845cd927:

    # o "You can put them on anytime... now, I mean anytime..."
    o "你随时都可以穿上……现在，我是说，随时都可以……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_a1083ba8:

    # o "Hey kiddo, Seb's gone to drink again."
    o "喂，小家伙，塞巴斯又去喝酒了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_e3bf08b8:

    # e "Ah! He's at the nocturnal trunk?"
    e "啊！他在夜夜椿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_10a7b5b4:

    # o "Yeah, in case you're looking for him."
    o "对，如果你是来找他的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_aa762fa1:

    # o "Kiddo, what are you doing here?"
    o "小家伙，你在这里做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_f7676141:

    # e "Just snooping around, I suppose you don't mind my company?"
    e "我就是随便转转，应该不介意我陪着你吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_5952254c:

    # o "Heh, watch out your back then, I'm still dusting the shop here."
    o "嘿，那你可得留神身后，我还在这儿打扫店里呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_e4038ae9:

    # o "Hey, kiddo."
    o "嗨，小兄弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_be74efb6:

    # e "Hello, Ole. Feeling great lately?"
    e "你好，奥利。最近感觉还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_24a527e7:

    # o "Good, at least I won't be sick for the forseeable future."
    o "挺好的，至少接下来一段时间不用担心生病了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_36dcd6ce:

    # o "Hey kiddo. Having fun out there?"
    o "嘿，小兄弟。在外面玩得开心吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_8014606a:

    # e "Yes, but never fun without having you, and Seb."
    e "是啊，但没有你和塞巴斯在身边，总归没那么好玩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_4ef97c11:

    # o "Wanna go for a round two of that night we had in the tavern? I did hone my throwing skill there ever since."
    o "想不想把我们那晚在酒馆的乐子再来一遍？从那以后我的投掷技巧可是精进了不少。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_e206f31b:

    # e "Of course!"
    e "当然！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_64c2c56a:

    # o "Hey kid, how's your head doing?"
    o "嘿，小子，你的头还好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_620e4fc1:

    # e "It's healing really quick, Ole. Thanks to you and Sebas."
    e "恢复得很快，奥利。多亏了你和塞巴斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_ddbec255:

    # o "Good. Do you like the bed? We got the whole bed from a customer long ago, a bad investment at the time, but I'm glad it came in handy for you."
    o "好。床睡得还舒服吗？这整张床是很久以前从一位顾客那里买来的，当时算是笔糟糕的投资，不过现在能派上用场照顾你，我很庆幸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_421f54d3:

    # e "I slept pretty well yesterday. It's definitely something I haven't slept on before."
    e "我昨天睡得挺好。这确实是我以前从没睡过的床。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_bced9a10:

    # o "Heh, good to know."
    o "嘿，知道这点就好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_e4038ae9_1:

    # o "Hey, kiddo."
    o "嘿，小兄弟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_dialogue_794f2559:

    # e "Hello, Ole!"
    e "你好，奥利！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Normal_Talk_fe5fcc14:

    # o "You doing well today, kid?" nointeract
    o "今天过得还好吗，小兄弟？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Lusterfield_d9433aa5:

    # o "What do you want to learn about the village?" nointeract
    o "你想了解村子里的什么？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Potion_Task_Start_86d35d30:

    # o "Alright [e] ,I've got another Courier job for you."
    o "好吧，[e]，我这儿又有一份跑腿活儿要你去办。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Potion_Task_Start_4a31109a:

    # e "What is it this time, Ole?"
    e "这次是什么事，奥利？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Potion_Task_Start_88a9b8cf:

    # o "I need you to go get 5 strength potions from Haskell."
    o "我需要你去找哈斯克尔拿5瓶力量药水。"

