translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_8cf10d8c:

    # e "Ole, it has been quite some time since my first courier mission. Do you have a new mission?"
    e "奥利，距离我第一次接快递任务已经过去很久了。你有新的任务吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_849d0904:

    # o "Speaking of, you've been a great help with Haskell and the potions."
    o "说起来，你帮哈斯克尔处理药剂，真是帮了大忙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_c8287b97:

    # o "Glad to see that you're in such a spirit too."
    o "很高兴看到你也这么有干劲。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_88f314f9:

    # o "But there aren't any new courier jobs for the taking at the moment."
    o "不过目前没有新的快递任务可接。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_13a9df3b:

    # o "With the goat tribe and the roads still filled with danger, there hasn't been much need for courier work."
    o "山羊部落那边和道路上依旧充满危险，所以目前没什么快递工作需求。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_b727b592:

    # o "We wouldn't want you to repeat the last courier's fate."
    o "我们可不想让你重蹈上一位快递员的覆辙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_d6c36688:

    # "Ole's face dims."
    "奥利的脸色沉了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_195fb3b8:

    # e "It's fine then. I was just asking. I can wait."
    e "那就算了。我只是问问。我可以等。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_891842ed:

    # e "I'm sure there are other odd jobs I can do in the meantime."
    e "我相信这段时间里还有别的零工可做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_1009f460:

    # "As you turn to leave, Ole stops you."
    "你正要转身离开，奥利叫住了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_673b6317:

    # o "Actually, wait. Eventually, you'll have to venture far away from Lusterfield to complete your courier job."
    o "等等，先别走。以后你得离开卢斯特菲尔德很远，才能完成你的送货工作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_6b69c486:

    # o "The world at large is not exactly safe."
    o "外面的世界可不怎么安全。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_6d2d6adb:

    # e "Don't worry, Ole. I can take care of myself."
    e "别担心，奥利。我能照顾好自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_e96856bf:

    # o "That's good to know. But it's better to be safe than sorry."
    o "那就好。不过还是小心为上，免得后悔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_701bc39c:

    # e "What do you mean, Ole?"
    e "你这话是什么意思，奥利？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_a609a4e3:

    # o "You know that Jog and Amble are just like you too, right? Or at least, they patrol the roads to keep it safe for couriers like you."
    o "你知道乔格和安布也和你一样，对吧？至少，他们会巡查道路，让像你这样的信使安全通行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_f8cbaddc:

    # o "While we wait for more courier jobs to open up, why don't you get them to teach you some new skills?"
    o "在有新的送货工作之前，不如让他们教你一些新技能？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_991359e0:

    # o "As your seniors, I'm sure they have much knowledge to impart."
    o "他们是你的前辈，肯定有很多知识可以传授给你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_489710b8:

    # o "At least, I'm sure Amble will be able to help. Jog..."
    o "至少我相信安布能帮上忙。乔格嘛……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_747e8663:

    # "Ole frowns at the name."
    "奥利听到这个名字时皱了皱眉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_52ec5b08:

    # o "Why don't you ask Amble first?"
    o "要不你先去问问安布？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Courier_Quest_e889f33c:

    # e "Hmm... alright."
    e "唔……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_5aa3fb82:

    # "As you walk out of your room, you can hear Seb and Ole whispering at the corner of the shop."
    "你走出房间时，听见塞巴斯和奥利在店铺角落说着悄悄话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_0af482b4:

    # o "That'll be fun..."
    o "那一定很有趣……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_7df85d20:

    # s "He's going to be so shocked..."
    s "他肯定会大吃一惊……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_9283830b:

    # "You walk over to them."
    "你朝他们走去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_586ff9a7:

    # e "What are you guys talking about?"
    e "你们在聊什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_ceee7808:

    # "Seb jumps as he whips around to look at you. Ole is much more collected."
    "塞巴斯猛地转身看向你，吓得跳了起来。奥利则镇定得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_85c26e1d:

    # s "I-it's nothing!"
    s "没、没什么！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_987e3d37:

    # e "Really?"
    e "真的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_1b6e8a3d:

    # o "Yes. We're just talking about the shop's business."
    o "是的，我们只是在谈店里的生意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_4cf9fe72:

    # s "Yes, yes!"
    s "对，对！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_5e4e5ad3:

    # "Seb nods vehemently."
    "塞巴斯使劲点着头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_590e0258:

    # "You still find this suspicious."
    "你还是觉得这事很可疑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_dfcde6db:

    # s "Anyway, Roomie, good fucking morning!"
    s "总之，室友，早他妈的安！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_28bc6f02:

    # e "Good morning to you too."
    e "你也早上好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_25579a4b:

    # "Then, this is this awkward silence."
    "接着便是一阵尴尬的沉默。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_ce652538:

    # "You have a feeling these two are hiding something but you don't know what."
    "你感觉这两个人在隐瞒什么，却不知道究竟是什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_e4d641b4:

    # "Seb fidgets and eventually cracks."
    "塞巴斯坐立不安，最终还是撑不住了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_86cb9fc7:

    # s "Alright, fine. We're talking about your..."
    s "好吧，行吧。我们在说你的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_9d7cceae:

    # o "Training!"
    o "训练！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_072d8434:

    # s "Yes, training!"
    s "对，训练！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_ebaa2af8:

    # e "Training? What kind of training?"
    e "训练？什么训练？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_993c18b7:

    # "Seb turns to Ole with pleading in his eyes."
    "塞巴斯转向奥利，眼中满是恳求。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_54be7d07:

    # o "Your courier training."
    o "你的信使训练。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_1884c6e3:

    # s "Yes, yes."
    s "对，对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_a00f5e7d:

    # e "I thought I've finished my courier training."
    e "我以为我已经完成信使训练了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_5165afc8:

    # s "The training is never done. So, we need you to... erm..."
    s "训练永远没有结束。所以，我们需要你……呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_4f3a45f1:

    # "Seb ponders as a crease appears between his brows."
    "塞巴斯陷入沉思，眉间渐渐现出一道皱纹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_816e20d1:

    # o "Forage some stones from the woods."
    o "去树林里找些石头回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_d207e06f:

    # s "Yes!"
    s "对！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_62752422:

    # e "But haven't I already done that?"
    e "可我不是已经做过了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_e1fb5104:

    # s "Yes, but this time, you'll have to find four stones!"
    s "对，不过这次你得找四块石头！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_2b40a022:

    # e "Huh?"
    e "哈？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_6b79ca40:

    # s "Yes, yes. It's good for your courier training. Now off you go."
    s "对，对。这对你的信使训练有好处。现在，快去吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Begin_a79a1dff:

    # "Still confused, you are pushed out of the shop."
    "你仍是一头雾水，却被推出了店外。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_bb8f066a:

    # e "Hello? Seb? Ole?"
    e "有人吗？塞巴斯？奥利？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_6255458a:

    # s "H-hey! M-My Best Roomie! Didn't I tell you to get the stones?"
    s "嘿、嘿！我、我最好的室友！我不是让你去找石头吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_e031ae85:

    # e "Hmm... I've got enough stones... or rocks."
    e "嗯……我已经有足够多的石头了……或者说岩石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_eb619674:

    # s "Uh..."
    s "呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_f5b7ab01:

    # s "Then uhmm!!! Get more of them!"
    s "那就呃！！！再去找些石头来！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_c18eb48e:

    # e "W-what?"
    e "什、什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_d0dea1df:

    # e "How many should I get?"
    e "我到底要找多少？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_a4dd4b09:

    # s "Uhh... it's gonna take some time. Just. Get Them As much as you can!"
    s "呃……这得花点时间。总之，能找多少就找多少！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_82b9449e:

    # e "Hmmm... ok. But where is Ole?"
    e "嗯……好吧。但奥利在哪儿？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_fd408bf7:

    # s "No..."
    s "不……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_0b45ae74:

    # e "No?"
    e "不在？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_428246ed:

    # s "He's busy with... uh... stuff. Now go and get those rocks!"
    s "他正忙着……呃……忙他的事。现在去把那些石头找来！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_7fb2f5cf:

    # e "Fine, I will find out what you two are planning."
    e "好吧，我会查清楚你们俩到底在谋划什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_7046102d:

    # s "Hmm! Good Luck!!"
    s "嗯！祝你好运！！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_843d8969:

    # "You look around and the shop is empty."
    "你环顾四周，发现店里空无一人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_92902dcb:

    # "No one responds to your call either."
    "也没人回应你的呼喊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_7d280dfc:

    # "You look around and notice a note on the counter."
    "你环顾四周，注意到柜台上有张便签。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_15986046:

    # "It is written in Seb's quirky handwriting."
    "那上面是塞巴斯古怪的笔迹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_793d2a58:

    # s "Roomie! Come meet us at Cane's tavern! We'll meet you there for ----"
    s "室友！来凯恩的酒馆找我们！我们会在那里等你，参加——"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_77071a39:

    # "Something was crossed out and Ole's flourishing handwriting corrected it to 'your training'."
    "有人把后面的内容划掉了，奥利用潇洒的笔迹将其改成了“你的训练”。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_907198ab:

    # "This is befuddling. Honestly, you are intrigued too."
    "真让人摸不着头脑。不过，说实话，你也很感兴趣。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_365159e6:

    # e "...Hmmm what are they planning..."
    e "……嗯，他们到底在谋划什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Party_Quest_0730bb61:

    # "You decide to leave the shop, and head to the tavern..."
    "你决定离开店铺，前往酒馆……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Ointment_Quest_f47af4b4:

    # e "Hey! Ole. I'm ready for the first... courier job!"
    e "嘿！奥利。我准备好接第一份……跑腿工作了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Ointment_Quest_10988a0d:

    # o "Alright kiddo. Looking good with your badge here."
    o "好啦，小家伙。戴上这枚徽章，看起来很不错嘛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Ointment_Quest_340f6913:

    # e "Oh yeah! It looks really good! I certainly love the shape I have here."
    e "对啊！看起来真不错！我确实很喜欢我这个徽章的形状。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Ointment_Quest_22a27393:

    # o "Sure, I designed the badge with Rahim's advice. He's certainly a great mentor."
    o "没错，这是我听取雷希姆的建议设计的徽章。他确实是位很棒的导师。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Ointment_Quest_51760586:

    # o "But back to the job, I remembered you asked about the ointment... that I gave you when we met."
    o "不过说回正事，我想起来你问过我那份药膏……就是我们见面时给你的那份。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Ointment_Quest_68df99ac:

    # e "Oh, yes. I was a little curious how you made it."
    e "噢，对了。我只是有点好奇你是怎么做出来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Ointment_Quest_573a9302:

    # o "Well, let's not get ahead of ourselves here, [e]. I'll teach you how to make it after your job."
    o "嗯，先别急，[e]。等你完成任务后，我就教你怎么做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Ointment_Quest_178288b9:

    # o "I need you to visit... a-a potion maker, if you will."
    o "我需要你去拜访一位……药、药剂师，如果你愿意的话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Ointment_Quest_91890a33:

    # e "Should I take... a memo?"
    e "我需要记下来……吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Ointment_Quest_80d5c3d7:

    # o "I'll mark it... on your map. You pass the river after the giant tree, and then reach the outpost and you'll see a cabin."
    o "我会把位置标在……你的地图上。过了那棵大树后的河，再到前哨站，你就能看到一间小屋。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Ointment_Quest_a518c665:

    # e "Uh... Ok. What's the job about?"
    e "呃……好。那这份工作是做什么的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Ointment_Quest_bc467a46:

    # o "Just ask him for 30 strength potions. He'll know what you're talking about."
    o "只要向他索要30瓶力量药水就行。他会明白你在说什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Ointment_Quest_bcc97e0d:

    # e "O-hh... But does the potion maker know me, if I went there?"
    e "噢……不过，如果我去了，那个药剂师认识我吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Ointment_Quest_9bdc524c:

    # o "Yeah, Sebas told him about your badge last time he went there."
    o "嗯，塞巴斯上次去那儿时，已经跟他说过你的徽章了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Ointment_Quest_6b43982e:

    # o "Alright, courier, don't disappoint me with your first job."
    o "好，信使，别在你的第一份工作上让我失望。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Ointment_Quest_1e01be55:

    # e "O-ok. Yes, chief."
    e "好、好的。是，首领。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Ointment_Quest_a36325ea:

    # "Ole chuckles at your gesture. He soon turns back to the cabinet and resume cleaning."
    "奥利对你的举动轻笑一声。很快，他又转身回到柜子前，继续清理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_acacbf7e:

    # e "Ole, I really haven't gotten to know what do you do specifically at the shop."
    e "奥利，我还真不清楚你具体在店里做些什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_13edcf9e:

    # o "I help Seb with the logistics side of things."
    o "我帮塞巴斯处理后勤方面的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_9f2e108d:

    # o "Arranging new couriers, doing inventory, tallying up the accounts and so on."
    o "安排新的信使、盘点库存、核对账目之类的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_9330d358:

    # e "That is amazing."
    e "真厉害。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_776ef18e:

    # o "It is more like a necessity."
    o "更像是不得不做罢了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_cccb8730:

    # o "If you leave those things to Seb, this shop would have gone under a long time ago."
    o "要是把这些事交给塞巴斯，这家店早就倒闭了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_853ba6df:

    # s "Hey, I heard that!"
    s "嘿，我听见了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_922ce317:

    # s "Just verifying that O is telling the truth!"
    s "我只是确认一下奥利说的是不是真的！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_d31a9d20:

    # o "See."
    o "你看。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_147337b7:

    # "Ole shakes his head helplessly."
    "奥利无奈地摇了摇头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_1e2f1329:

    # o "Other than that I also help make some simple potions for the store to sell and clean up around here."
    o "除此之外，我还会帮忙制作一些简单的药剂供店里出售，也会打扫这里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_64c354d1:

    # e "Why don't you ask Seb to help you clean?"
    e "你为什么不叫阿塞帮你打扫？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_af0a14ec:

    # s "Roomie, you're making it sound like I don't pull my weight around here!"
    s "室友，你说得好像我在这里什么都不干、只吃白饭一样！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_6908e972:

    # s "That's not true! Right, O?"
    s "才不是那回事！对吧，奥利？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_ce8f75f3:

    # "Ole smiles indulgently."
    "奥利纵容地笑了笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_491fef5e:

    # o "Yes. Seb does his part and I do mine."
    o "没错。阿塞有他要做的事，我也有我的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_609c70de:

    # o "But let's just say cleaning is not his calling."
    o "不过，咱们就这么说吧：打扫可不是他的强项。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_8eede033:

    # s "Hey, I clean too.... That one time."
    s "喂，我也打扫过啊……就那一次。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_797865e8:

    # o "What a catastrophe that was."
    o "那次可真是一场灾难。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_9e168798:

    # e "What happened?"
    e "怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_9f3be4f6:

    # o "I'll just say that I ended up doing more cleaning than I should've if I didn't ask for Seb's help."
    o "我只能说，要不是叫阿塞来帮忙，我最后就得打扫比该打扫的多得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_a67b2433:

    # s "Hey! That wasn't my fault."
    s "喂！那又不是我的错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_87e02399:

    # s "Am I supposed to know that glassware are so fragile?"
    s "我哪知道那些玻璃器皿这么脆弱？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_8651e32a:

    # e "Isn't that common knowledge?"
    e "玻璃易碎难道不是常识吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_a0fd3bcc:

    # s "Roomy, whose side are you on? The glass or mine?"
    s "室友，你到底站谁那边？玻璃，还是我？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_38b16088:

    # o "Alright. Stop pestering our friend."
    o "好了，别再烦我们的朋友了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_00b78639:

    # "Ole shoos Seb back to work before turning back to you."
    "奥利把阿塞赶回去继续工作，然后转过身来面对你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_ffdadf92:

    # o "Now you understand why I don't ask him for help when it comes to cleaning."
    o "现在你明白我为什么不找他帮忙打扫了吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_9f53eed8:

    # o "It's something I picked up when I was an apprentice working for Haskell."
    o "这是我在哈斯克尔手下当学徒时养成的习惯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_3f19a81f:

    # o "You wouldn't know it but cleanliness plays a huge-role in potion making."
    o "你可能想不到，洁净在药剂制作中起着极其重要的作用。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_0e0139e0:

    # o "If an ingredient is contaminated, the final product's effect might be affected."
    o "要是某种材料受到污染，成品的效果可能也会受到影响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_666874f9:

    # o "I've spent quite a long time cleaning vials and bottles before Haskell would allow me to brew my first potion."
    o "在哈斯克尔允许我调制第一剂药水之前，我花了很长时间清洗药瓶和瓶子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_8a831a72:

    # o "I've kept that habit every since."
    o "从那以后，我一直保持着这个习惯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_b41abd79:

    # "You glance at the glass vials and bottles on the table and shelves. They are all sparkling clean."
    "你扫了一眼桌上和架子上的玻璃小瓶与瓶子。它们全都干净得闪闪发亮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_008c6b8d:

    # e "But, Haskell doesn't seem like someone who would mind cleanliness that much."
    e "不过，哈斯克尔看起来不像是会这么在意洁净的人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_964222b3:

    # e "Speaking of, I don't think I've seen him clean the big mug he often drinks out of...."
    e "说起来，我好像从没见他洗过那个他经常用来喝东西的大杯子……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_b7aba819:

    # "Ole chuckles warmly."
    "奥利温和地笑了起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_4b6b1c5c:

    # o "Sharp observation there."
    o "观察得真仔细。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_87117a86:

    # o "Haskell is already a master when I studied under him."
    o "我拜哈斯克尔为师时，他就已经是一位大师了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_296f2cbf:

    # o "His mastery of alchemy easily overrides the negative influence any grim or dirt can bring."
    o "他高超的炼金术造诣，轻易就能抵消任何污垢或脏污带来的负面影响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_b3caa43a:

    # o "Can't say Haskell's one to take his own advice. He just can't kick that slothful habit."
    o "不能说哈斯克尔是个听得进自己劝的人。他就是改不掉那懒散的习惯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_fea00386:

    # o "So occasionally I'd go back to his hut to help with the clean up."
    o "所以我偶尔会回他的棚屋，帮他收拾打扫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_eda85b29:

    # e "That's very kind of you, Ole."
    e "你人真好，奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_82f47773:

    # "Ole accepts the compliment."
    "奥利欣然接受了你的夸奖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_9a1a8521:

    # o "He has taught me everything I know about alchemy. Some cleaning is nothing."
    o "他教会了我关于炼金术的一切。帮他打扫一下根本不算什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_79d62148:

    # o "Plus, I like to clean. A clean mind is a healthy mind."
    o "而且我本来就喜欢打扫。心灵洁净，心智才会健康。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_10d94b0f:

    # o "That's why you'll normally see me cleaning up around here."
    o "所以你平时总能看到我在这附近打扫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_cb9fd50c:

    # e "Thanks for the chat, Ole. I feel like I know you better now."
    e "谢谢你陪我聊天，奥利。我感觉自己现在更了解你了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_bc52a60f:

    # o "It was fun talking to you."
    o "和你聊天很开心。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Cleaning_17bd1023:

    # s "Hey. Don't forget me!"
    s "嘿，别忘了我！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_c372fb80:

    # e "Ole?"
    e "奥利？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_ca730175:

    # o "Hmm?"
    o "嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_24a72e17:

    # e "Did you happen to see-"
    e "你有没有看见——"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_354cf749:

    # o "You and Seb?"
    o "你和阿塞？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_a2ea77ab:

    # o "Yeah. It's fine. It was too awkward for me once I realised you're not fixing the counter or something."
    o "嗯，没事。后来我发现你并不是在修柜台之类的，场面就让我觉得太尴尬了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_ad7e7276:

    # e "I'm sorry, Ole."
    e "对不起，奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_fef687ad:

    # o "I know you young boys have some weird impulses, but I thought you knew better than this..."
    o "我知道你们这些年轻小伙子会有些奇怪的冲动，但我以为你们应该懂事些，不至于做出这种事……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_72a33094:

    # e "..."
    e "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_829b5223:

    # o "Seb shouldn't be putting the shop under the risk of bad reputation. That's reserved for the nocturnal trunk."
    o "阿塞不该让店里承担名声受损的风险。那可是夜夜椿才该有的名声。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_9f02d661:

    # e "I think we won't do it again..."
    e "我想我们不会再这么做了……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_84a436e0:

    # o "Ha. I must look like a boring elderly who denies you instant gratification in your eyes, am I not?"
    o "哈，在你眼里，我一定像个无趣的老头，总是拒绝让你立刻满足，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_a845e617:

    # e "Of course no. You're always right, Ole. I'm glad you're by my side."
    e "当然不是。奥利，你总是对的。我很高兴有你陪在我身边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_7f51c35c:

    # o "Yeah. Stay with Seb more, I think he likes your company."
    o "嗯，多陪陪阿塞吧，我觉得他喜欢有你陪着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_80c64ffb:

    # e "Do... you like my company as well."
    e "那……你也喜欢有我陪着吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_29d900d7:

    # o "I do, not as much in an essence of Seb's though."
    o "我喜欢，不过不像阿塞那样喜欢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_6cf2b443:

    # o "Now, let me continue with my work. I'll see you later."
    o "那现在，让我继续工作吧。回头见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Under_Counter_d35aaf4c:

    # e "Ok."
    e "好的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Goat_Tribe_a58e4d30:

    # e "Hey, Ole. What's your opinion... on the Goat Tribe?"
    e "嗨，奥利。你对山羊部落……有什么看法？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Goat_Tribe_628e0372:

    # o "Rahim told me about your letter from Furkan. He's not very happy with it."
    o "雷希姆告诉我弗坎给你的那封信了。他对此不太高兴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Goat_Tribe_f82bd775:

    # e "So... what do you think?"
    e "那……你怎么看？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Goat_Tribe_cc5836ed:

    # o "Me? I liked Furkan, but I don't think we should change what has been working out for us."
    o "我？我挺喜欢弗坎的，但我不认为我们应该改变目前对我们来说一直行得通的做法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Goat_Tribe_526eaa49:

    # o "I think Furkan's hiding something, they wouldn't make peace with us just to... make peace."
    o "我觉得弗坎在隐瞒什么。他们不会只是为了……议和而议和。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Goat_Tribe_c78821a5:

    # e "Oh, you think they have another motive?"
    e "你觉得他们还有别的动机？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Goat_Tribe_557e88d0:

    # o "Yeah, all those unusual things, with outsiders getting teleported from nowhere."
    o "是啊，发生了那么多不寻常的事，还有外来者不知从何处被传送过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Goat_Tribe_5bff7366:

    # o "And so much more monsters we see in the forest. I would assume it's from the goats."
    o "而且我们在森林里看到的怪物也多了这么多。我猜这和山羊部落有关。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Goat_Tribe_f79f35f2:

    # o "After all... they're famous for conjuring monsters."
    o "毕竟……他们可是以召唤怪物闻名的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Goat_Tribe_4d2dbad4:

    # e "You think that they made all the monsters appear?"
    e "你觉得是他们让那些怪物出现的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Goat_Tribe_4ec69cf7:

    # o "I guess, but it's just an assumption. You would be better off asking Furkan yourself."
    o "我猜是吧，但这只是猜测。你还是亲自去问弗坎比较好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Goat_Tribe_85b3f143:

    # e "Alright, thank you so much for talking with me, Ole."
    e "好的，奥利，谢谢你愿意和我聊这么多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Ask_Goat_Tribe_e3b1e728:

    # o "Yeah, anything for my little outsider."
    o "当然，为了我的小外来者，什么都愿意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_a7701920:

    # e "Ole, I need to ask you for a specific ingredients."
    e "奥利，我想问你要一种特定的材料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_1c0bba33:

    # o "Hmm? What do you need?"
    o "嗯？你需要什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_abddad47:

    # e "A Green Dye. For Cane's Apron."
    e "绿色染料。是给凯恩的围裙用的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_d2accc70:

    # o "His apron, did Rahim tell you the recipe?"
    o "他的围裙——雷希姆告诉你配方了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_63d1afe6:

    # e "Yeah, he's helping with fixing the apron, I just need something that matches the colour of the fabric."
    e "对，他会帮忙把围裙修好，我只是需要找颜色和布料相配的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_aaa75e4e:

    # o "That's weird, I didn't recall Rahim ever forgiving the tavern owner..."
    o "真奇怪，我可不记得雷希姆曾原谅过酒馆老板……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_46e8b7c7:

    # o "You know what, I need to ask him about this. [e]. This is a weird occasion for him."
    o "这么说吧，我得去问问他这是怎么回事。[e]这可真不像他的作风。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_b4c9cc11:

    # e "He just told me-"
    e "他刚刚亲口告诉我的——"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_832c0dec:

    # o "Come on, let's go kiddo. Just go for a walk to the shop with me."
    o "来吧，小家伙。陪我走一趟，去店里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_b52c58ff:

    # o "Hey, Rahim. I've got the courier with me."
    o "嗨，雷希姆。我带着这位信使来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_6318dac8:

    # r "Hmm? What's the matter?"
    r "嗯？怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_45228c3c:

    # e "Hi Rahim, I just told Ole about the apron..."
    e "雷希姆，我刚才只是跟奥利说了围裙的事……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_aab08703:

    # o "Yeah. Apron, what happened over there?"
    o "对。围裙，刚才到底怎么回事？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_3f7e6078:

    # r "I gave [e] the recipe. Is there something wrong?"
    r "我把配方给了[e]。有什么不对吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_25b92775:

    # o "No, I was just asking, why are you suddenly helping Cane."
    o "没事，我只是想问问，你怎么突然开始帮凯恩了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_ece37e0f:

    # r "I'm only trying to help [e]. I don't really care about him anymore."
    r "我只是想帮[e]而已。我已经不在乎他了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_ef33d6f8:

    # o "Are you sure?"
    o "你确定吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_bec3b4af:

    # r "Yes."
    r "确定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_54653927:

    # o "Have you two, met yet?"
    o "你们两个见过面了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_4ebbc277:

    # r "No, like I said, I don't care about him. But [e] is a good person."
    r "没有，就像我说的，我不在乎他。但[e]是个好人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_a1ac7451:

    # o "Alright. I understand now. I won't ask too much questions, Rahim, see you later."
    o "好吧，我明白了。我就不多问了。雷希姆，回头见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_739472a3:

    # r "Take care Ole, and you [e]."
    r "保重，奥利，还有你，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_de871dc5:

    # e "Oh... Goodbye, Rahim."
    e "噢……再见，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_fe8b913c:

    # "You and Ole walk back towards the shop, he didn't say a word along the journey, he simply looks forward, almost ignoring your existence."
    "你和奥利走回店里去，一路上他一言不发，只是直视前方，几乎完全无视你的存在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_fea4d0e5:

    # o "Alright, kiddo."
    o "好了，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_c376806c:

    # e "Ole, May I g-get the ingredient... from you?"
    e "奥利，我、我可以从你这里拿到那份材料吗……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_00b73ef3:

    # o "Well I trust Rahim's judgement. You must be the best visitor he has had, at least you actually made him help the bat."
    o "我相信雷希姆的判断。你一定是他遇到过最好的访客，至少你确实让他帮了那只蝙蝠。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_f4817427:

    # e "U-uh... I didn't do anything actually. I was just asking him for help."
    e "呃、呃……其实我什么都没做。我只是向他求助而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_510c0c91:

    # o "You are brave to ask that in the first place. I'd give you that."
    o "一开始你就敢问这个，已经很勇敢了。这点我认可你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_03fdcfcf:

    # o "Anyways, I don't have strong opinion on Cane anyways. Just wanted to be sure of Rahim's decision."
    o "无论如何，我对凯恩没什么强烈看法。只是想确认雷希姆的决定。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_09acb7f9:

    # o "And you wanted some green dyes right? I can make one right here, Seb and me picked the leaves from the town area. We have no use of that anyways."
    o "对了，你想要一些绿色染料，对吧？我可以当场给你做一份。我和阿塞从镇子那边采了些叶子，反正我们也用不上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_23911e3d:

    # e "Thank you so much, Ole. This is really great news."
    e "真是太感谢你了，奥利。这消息真是太好了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_d44bd1b6:

    # o "So... what do you think?"
    o "那么……你觉得呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_1d0e5d7c:

    # e "Hmm...?"
    e "嗯……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_5c962a8a:

    # o "Cane, the Tavern owner."
    o "凯恩，那个酒馆老板。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_ba1c90de:

    # o "Do you think I should trust Cane?"
    o "你觉得我该相信凯恩吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_975eb737:

    # e "Wait... are you asking for my opinion?"
    e "等等……你是在问我的意见？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_07f8aa5a:

    # o "Yes, it's always better to judge from someone who haven't gotten used to the village yet."
    o "对，最好还是听听一个还没习惯这个村子的人怎么判断。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_29253fb1:

    # o "Do you think I should trust Cane? I can't speak for Rahim, obviously, but is he decent enough now?" nointeract
    o "你觉得我该相信凯恩吗？我当然不能代表雷希姆发言，不过，他现在算是个正派人了吗？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_066f0381:

    # e "Of course, Cane is not a bad person I believe."
    e "当然，我相信凯恩不是坏人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_78e45ebf:

    # o "Hmm... really? Seb told me the same, but you know, I don't really interact with the tavern that much."
    o "嗯……真的吗？塞巴斯也这么告诉过我，不过你知道，我和酒馆那边的人来往不多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_6ffcef57:

    # o "But I see, I see. I'll take your advice into my consideration."
    o "不过我明白了，明白了。我会把你的建议纳入考虑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_21446274:

    # e "No... I guess you really shouldn't trust him too easily."
    e "不……我觉得你确实不该太轻易相信他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_d9305c06:

    # o "That was what I was thinking, he must have scammed you so hard you work for him now."
    o "我就这么想来着。他肯定把你骗得很惨，才让你现在替他干活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_35d1f5cd:

    # o "Alright I see, I see. I'll take your advice into my consideration."
    o "好了，我明白了，明白了。我会考虑你的建议。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_c2b7dcd9:

    # e "Well... you should definitely judge him yourself when you meet him."
    e "嗯……等你见到他时，你最好亲自判断一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_1046c1e1:

    # o "I've met him, a lot of times. But since the infiltration, I haven't talked with the bat."
    o "我见过他很多次了。不过自从那次潜入行动之后，我就没再和那只蝙蝠说过话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_4448e1d7:

    # e "People do change, I believe."
    e "我相信，人确实会改变。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_839a80ec:

    # o "It depends, really. Could you really forgive someone entirely just because they're a different person now?"
    o "这得看情况，真的。难道仅仅因为某人现在变成了另一个人，你就能彻底原谅他吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_7b25b8bd:

    # o "I don't know, but I can see how you made Rahim talk now, roommate."
    o "我不知道，不过我现在明白你是怎么让雷希姆开口的了，室友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_00f995b4:

    # e "Look, if you need me, I'll be right around the corner."
    e "听着，如果你需要我，我就在拐角那边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_622571fc:

    # o "Sure thing. Here's the dye you need."
    o "当然。给，这是你要的染料。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_26d5dce1:

    # e "Thanks a lot, Ole."
    e "多谢了，奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Apron_Quest_ba31ebcc:

    # o "See you, kiddo."
    o "回头见，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Sick_Quest_d0874d5f:

    # "As you open the bedroom door, you see Sebas jumping just outside the door."
    "你打开卧室门，就看见塞巴斯正在门外蹦来蹦去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Sick_Quest_a1ffb784:

    # s "Roomie, roomie! You are just in time. Come with me. Something's wrong with O!"
    s "老铁，来得正好！快跟我来。奥利出事了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Sick_Quest_abe654dd:

    # "Before you can get an understanding of what's going on, Seb drags you along."
    "你还没弄清楚发生了什么，就被塞巴斯拖走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Sick_Quest_25da3003:

    # "Both of you enter Ole's room."
    "你们一起走进奥利的房间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Sick_Quest_22b207c8:

