    e "呃，磨？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_0b8f2b53:

    # a "Grinding the limestones into cement! For the stone bridge of course! We're not allowed to make any jokes that's out of the scope of our world anymore."
    a "把石灰岩磨成水泥！当然是为了石桥！我们已经不能再开任何超出这个世界范畴的玩笑了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_54c58974:

    # a "Anyway, I'll prepare some large rocks there myself, how about you bringing me some small rocks?"
    a "总之，我自己去那边准备些大石头，你带些小石头给我，怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_f61830b2:

    # e "I'm definitely more than capable than bringing some small rocks."
    e "我当然完全搬得动那些小石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_59e2b738:

    # a "Hah, well. I don't doubt that! But the large rocks I need is probably bigger than you do, so it's safer for me to carry."
    a "哈，好吧。我不怀疑这一点！不过，我需要的大石头可能比你要搬的那些大得多，所以还是由我来搬更安全。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_7fc77197:

    # a "But, we'll need some more logs. I suppose you know how to cut down the trees, right?"
    a "不过，我们还需要更多木材。我猜你知道怎么砍树，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_fc9b3fc2:

    # e "I do!"
    e "我知道！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_6a0b26fb:

    # a "Good, and then, for the sticky materials, we'll need a bucket of mortar, which is just a mixture of limestone and cemen-."
    a "很好，然后说到那些黏性材料，我们需要一桶砂浆，其实就是石灰岩和水泥的混合物——"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_b305bf51:

    # e "S-semen?"
    e "精、精液？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_840fd9a5:

    # a "I can't ever say that right without remembering what Jog said! Cement. What a silly name, right?"
    a "我每次都没法好好说出这个词，一想起乔格说过的话就会这样！水泥。多可笑的名字，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_00688bc9:

    # a "So, we'll need some irons, some clays, some slate rocks."
    a "所以，我们需要一些铁、一些黏土，还有一些板岩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_843f83fd:

    # a "You know where to find them. There are stone wards at the damp cave, which you may find slate, sometimes."
    a "你知道去哪儿找它们。潮湿的洞窟里有些石头矿脉，偶尔能找到板岩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_96d489e0:

    # "You smile uncomfortably as Amble begins pointing at random directions at where the materials should be."
    "安布开始随意指向那些材料应该所在的方向，你尴尬地笑了笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_ce25548d:

    # "And you're fairly sure that Jog is not one of them."
    "你相当确定乔格不属于其中之一。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_99562d93:

    # a "Clays are right under the river, with a powerful shovel you can easily dig them up."
    a "黏土就在河底下，有把结实的铲子就能轻松挖出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_10299709:

    # a "And the iron, I'm sure the werewolves will gladly lend you some, puny friend."
    a "至于铁，我敢肯定狼人们会很乐意借给你一些，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_6980478e:

    # "He winks at you confidently, you hope he's saying this to praise your battle ability."
    "他自信地朝你眨了眨眼，你希望他这么说是在夸你的战斗能力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_28acb02a:

    # a "Mix them together and you'll get some seme-... cement. And then you'll need to mix them with limestones."
    a "把它们混在一起，就能得到些精、精液……水泥。然后再把它们和石灰岩混合。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_8affa552:

    # "Amble gestures his hand together, stroking the air up and down to mimic the mixing motion."
    "安布把双手合在一起，上下抚弄空气，模仿混合的动作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_3e7f91ca:

    # "You stare in embarrassment, well, it really does look like he's stroking a huge... pillar."
    "你尴尬地盯着他——嗯，看起来他确实像是在抚摸一根巨大的……柱子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_bffaaa0e:

    # a "Limestones are very abundant in a yellowish cave, near the goat tribe. You might need to get someone knowledgeable enough to show you that entrance of the cave. It should be easy to get a pickaxe from Gwyd!"
    a "山羊部落附近的一座黄褐色洞窟里有大量石灰岩。你可能需要找个足够熟悉那里的人带你找到洞窟入口。从格威德那里弄到一把镐应该不难！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_6df1d013:

    # a "But, I've heard there is a minotaur inside the cave. So stay safe there, [e]."
    a "不过，我听说洞里有一只弥诺陶洛斯。所以你在那里小心点，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_19127bd7:

    # a "Anyway, mix them, and then get a bucket for yourself, and tada-! A bucket of mortar is done, perfect for sticking stones together."
    a "总之，把它们混合起来，再给自己弄一桶，锵锵——！一桶砂浆就做好了，正好用来把石头粘在一起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_f880eb90:

    # e "Hmmph... alright."
    e "哼……好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_3a61f3cb:

    # a "Yeah, I think that's really all. We should get going! Time doesn't wait for a collapsed bridge!"
    a "是啊，我想这确实就是全部了。我们该出发了！时间可不会等着一座塌掉的桥！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_8771256f:

    # e "Maybe I'll join you later?"
    e "也许我晚点再来找你？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_54ddafa3:

    # a "I have a hunch we'll learn so much more after rebuilding the bridge."
    a "我有预感，重建桥梁后，我们会了解到更多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Opinion_bae7895f:

    # "Amble raises both his thumbs up, with the same old smile he has."
    "安布竖起双手的大拇指，脸上还是那副一成不变的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_River_Talk_6a784c36:

    # a "It's really hot out here in the forest, puny friend."
    a "森林里真是热得厉害啊，小不点朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_River_Talk_c4844c7a:

    # a "[e]! What's on your mind?" nointeract
    a "[e]！你在想什么？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Cement_81fb734c:

    # e "Hey, Amble. I've gotten us the materials you need. 20 Logs, and 3 buckets of masonry mix."
    e "嘿，安布。我已经弄到了你需要的材料：20根原木和3桶砌筑砂浆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Cement_3409aa92:

    # a "Great! Now we can get started with building it."
    a "太好了！现在可以开始建造了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Cement_b6793244:

    # e "There's one question."
    e "我有一个问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Cement_311dd8ba:

    # a "What's on your mind, puny friend?"
    a "你在想什么，小不点朋友？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Cement_937e89d5:

    # e "Why do you ask me to get so many logs, when you already have some much lying right around here?"
    e "你明明已经有这么多原木堆在这附近了，为什么还要我去弄那么多？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Cement_264224ea:

    # "You point at the massive amount of wood, chopped or unchopped, all placed peacefully behind Amble."
    "你指向安布身后那堆数量庞大的木头，不管砍过还是没砍过，都安安静静地堆在那里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Cement_c92f5297:

    # a "Oh, good question!"
    a "哦，问得好！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Cement_6b88223b:

    # a "A-a-anyway, I think we're ready to get our work done."
    a "总、总之，我觉得我们已经可以开始干活了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Cement_0f114e57:

    # a "I've inspected the bridge, luckily when it was broken, the goats preserved their structural integrity rather well. That'd save us a lot of time and energy."
    a "我检查过这座桥了。幸运的是，桥损坏时，山羊们的结构完整性保存得相当不错。这能为我们省下不少时间和精力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Cement_af5c87a9:

    # a "I've marked down the location of the bridge on your map."
    a "我已经把桥的位置标在你的地图上了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Cement_287ebd17:

    # a "Meet me right there, then we'll start moving the old debris!"
    a "就在那儿和我碰头，然后我们就开始搬走旧的残骸！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Cement_bf6f0d3d:

    # e "A-alright..."
    e "好、好的……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_3573f911:

    # e "Hey! Amble, so, what do I need to do here?"
    e "嘿！安布，那我接下来要在这里做什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_de494aaf:

    # a "Oh! I like your attitude, keep it going for the bridge and we'll be finishing in no time!"
    a "哦！我喜欢你的干劲，保持住这股势头，为了这座桥继续努力，我们很快就能完工了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_732bcd84:

    # e "Ah? We... both, building an entire bridge?"
    e "啊？我、我们……两个人一起把整座桥造出来？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_046272a0:

    # a "Ha, not quite. You see, some huge debris are already stuck down here, so we just need to put them back where they were."
    a "哈，不完全是。你看，有些巨大的残骸已经卡在下面了，我们只要把它们放回原来的位置就行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_52baa3d8:

    # e "It doesn't look like the stones are in perfect condition, though."
    e "不过，这些石头看起来状态并不算完好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_a3947bf8:

    # a "You're right, that's why we need some mortar and rocks, to fill in the small gaps that corroded away during this whole time."
    a "你说得对，所以我们需要一些砂浆和石块，来填补这些年来腐蚀出来的小缝隙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_5854d3eb:

    # e "Damn, Amble. You've really thought about everything."
    e "见鬼，安布。你真是什么都考虑到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_06b5d888:

    # "Amble turns to you, with a slightly raised eyebrows."
    "安布转向你，微微挑起眉毛。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_1659956c:

    # a "Puny friend, are you trying to get something out of me?"
    a "小不点朋友，你是想从我这里套出些什么吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_a4f835be:

    # e "W-what? N-no..."
    e "什、什么？不、不是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_1b11c115:

    # a "Or make my cheeks go red by praising me?"
    a "还是想靠夸我让我脸红？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_cf21093d:

    # "He gets uncomfortably close to you, with one hand essentially wrapped around your shoulder."
    "他靠你靠得令人不适，一只手几乎搂住了你的肩膀。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_25ebe2b8:

    # e "A-amble, how would-"
    e "安、安布，你怎么会——"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_946185fd:

    # "Amble glances at you, his grin widens very quickly as he breaks into a heartful laughter."
    "安布瞥了你一眼，咧嘴一笑，随即开怀大笑起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_be7d46c6:

    # a "I learnt this from Jog, hah. Looks like it did get a reaction out of you."
    a "这是我跟乔格学的，哈哈。看来确实让你有反应了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_c7450403:

    # "You avert your gaze, still haven't recovered from his attempt at teasing you."
    "你移开视线，显然还没从他刚才的调侃中缓过来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_2b40a022:

    # e "Huh?"
    e "嗯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_ddaa22a6:

    # e "Not fair! I didn't expect you to joke around like this, Amble."
    e "不公平！我没想到你会这样逗我，安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_466673c6:

    # a "You're fun, puny friend."
    a "你真有意思，小不点朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_334114bd:

    # "He quickly turns his attention back towards the stones, and stretches his arms extensively."
    "他很快又把注意力转回石头上，大幅伸展着双臂。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_9be46682:

    # a "Let's get everything started, shall we?"
    a "那我们就开始吧，好吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_c08bc9e6:

    # msg "Do you wish to spend 2 hours and some HP to remove the rocks? Higher STR will increase each session's progress and HP cost." nointeract
    msg "你愿意花费2小时和一些HP来清除这些岩石吗？更高的STR会提高每次的进度，也会增加HP消耗。" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_a5de1b70:

    # e "Alright! Let's get into it."
    e "好！那就开始吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_804d05d9:

    # a "You've got the right attitude! Keep it up!"
    a "你的态度很对！继续保持！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_c47d0e63:

    # "You walk down the river and begins to work on the rocks with Amble."
    "你沿着河走去，和安布一起开始清理岩石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_3d6c8b04:

    # "For the next two hours, you dig up the rocks with the shovel Amble has given you, and he carries them on the land, trying to figure out where they come from from the bridge."
    "接下来的两个小时里，你用安布给你的铲子挖出岩石，而他则把岩石搬到岸上，试图弄清它们是从桥上的什么地方来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_4cd9eae6:

    # "Occassionally, he gets into the water as well, helping you remove huge rocks from the side with water."
    "偶尔他也会下水，帮你把河边的大石头搬开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_2292d187:

    # "Somehow, you can feel his jock submerged into the water completely, lightly brushing against your side as he hauls the rock above water."
    "不知怎么的，你能感觉到他的胯部完全浸在水里；他把石头搬出水面时，胯部轻轻擦过了你的身体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_5bf9c2bf:

    # "You moan quite loudly when you realise his slick bulge is pressed against your thigh under the water, and it unceremoniously slides to the side of your leg as he leans forward."
    "当你意识到他湿滑的隆起正隔着水压在你的大腿上，而他前倾时，那东西毫不客气地滑到了你腿侧，你不由得大声呻吟起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_7e589215:

    # a "Hey, something wrong?"
    a "嘿，怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_3b0922eb:

    # e "Uhm... nothing. Keep doing what you were doing."
    e "呃……没什么。继续做你刚才做的事吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_30d3534c:

    # a "You're truly fascinating, [e]."
    a "你真是个迷人的人，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_b261aa43:

    # "Carelessly, he holds onto your arms tightly to pull out the rock, you get to feel his soft bulge scraping, as if he's intentionally teasing with you."
    "他毫不在意地紧紧抓住你的手臂，把石头往外拽；你能感觉到他柔软的隆起在身上蹭过，仿佛他是故意在逗弄你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_87d70db0:

    # "That, that was an experience."
    "这、这真是一次特别的经历。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_ab97175e:

    # "As you've finished your session, you look towards the pile of rocks you've hauled out of the river."
    "你忙完后，望向那堆从河里搬出来的石头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_a18d5757:

    # "It seems most of the rocks are yet to be removed, more works needs to be done before the river is unclogged."
    "看来大部分石头还没搬走，想让河道恢复畅通，还得继续干活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_1fa379c4:

    # "Amble gives you a thumbs up as he shows you all the rocks on the river bank, some river water begins to flow to the other side now."
    "安布朝你竖起大拇指，同时指给你看河岸上的那些石头；现在已经有些河水开始流向另一边了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_3093bce3:

    # "There's still something needed to be done, but at least the river water can now flow to the other side."
    "还有些事情没做完，但至少河水现在能流到另一边了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_661de44e:

    # a "Aha, I think all huge rocks are removed now. Look at that beautiful river, clear as crystal!"
    a "啊哈，我想所有的大石头现在都清理掉了。看看这条漂亮的河，清澈得像水晶一样！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_68644dd0:

    # "He's right, this part of the river is no longer clogged, and the water flows freely to the other end once more."
    "他说得没错，这一段河道已经不再堵塞，河水又一次自由地流向另一头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_ac4a274a:

    # e "That was some hard work."
    e "这活儿可真够辛苦的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_e329df87:

    # a "And it all thanks to you, [e]."
    a "这一切都多亏了你，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_209fcbd6:

    # e "Ha, well most of it was your doing, I was just digging some dirts there, I think you deserve all the credits."
    e "哈哈，不过大部分都是你干的，我只是在那儿挖了些泥土。我觉得所有功劳都该归你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_d4675186:

    # e "Hey! Amble, I'm back."
    e "嘿！安布，我回来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_5c72958f:

    # "Amble sits on the river bank, seemingly pondering something."
    "安布坐在河岸上，似乎正在思考什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_0d6bf512:

    # "You glance over the river, surprisingly, the hauling work seems to be completed, leaving all soaked debris on the shore in front of Amble."
    "你朝河面望去，惊讶地发现搬运工作似乎已经完成了，所有湿透的杂物都堆在安布面前的岸边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_c6dfda2b:

    # a "Oh! Didn't notice you, puny friend. Welcome back!"
    a "哦！没注意到你，小不点朋友。欢迎回来！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_ab0a4b0e:

    # "He turns around, and gives you a friendly wave."
    "他转过身，友好地朝你挥了挥手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_52da51dc:

    # a "Well, please pardon me. I wanted to finish the job with you but, I got way over my head."
    a "嗯，请原谅我。我本想和你一起把活儿干完，可这实在超出了我的能力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_41bcc92c:

    # "Amble scratches the back of his head squirmishly, his cheeks perks up, revealing a wide grin."
    "安布不安地挠着后脑勺，脸颊扬起，露出灿烂的笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_6a098f7f:

    # e "Damn, no worries, Amble."
    e "该死，没事的，安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_1aeb09b9:

    # "You see Amble still hauling the rocks all by himself, his chest is drenched in sweat, glistening under the sunlight."
    "你看见安布还在独自搬运石头，他的胸膛被汗水浸透，在阳光下闪闪发亮。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_ab0a4b0e_1:

    # "He turns around, and gives you a friendly wave."
    "他转过身，友好地朝你挥了挥手。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_3c8bc1ed:

    # a "H-hello, puny friend."
    a "你、你好，小不点朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_a18d5757:

    # "It seems most of the rocks are yet to be removed, more works needs to be done before the river is unclogged."
    "看来大部分石头还没搬走，想让河道恢复畅通，还得继续干活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_1fa379c4:

    # "Amble gives you a thumbs up as he shows you all the rocks on the river bank, some river water begins to flow to the other side now."
    "安布朝你竖起大拇指，同时指给你看河岸上的那些石头；现在已经有些河水开始流向另一边了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_3093bce3:

    # "There's still something needed to be done, but at least the river water can now flow to the other side."
    "还有些事情没做完，但至少河水现在能流到另一边了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_05e48e04:

    # e "Damn, Amble, did you just dig them up and haul them out of the river all by yourself?"
    e "该死，安布，这些石头是你一个人挖出来，再搬出河的吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_ae602647:

    # "You wipe off the sweat from Amble carefully, he leans forwards so you can reach his chest, and closes his eyes for a moment."
    "你小心地擦去安布身上的汗水，他向前倾身，让你能够够到他的胸口，随后闭上眼睛片刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_40b8467a:

    # a "Thanks, puny friend. I feel much cooler now."
    a "谢谢你，小不点朋友。我感觉凉快多了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_5ad5e99b:

    # e "You seem so tired, do you need to take a rest?"
    e "你看起来很累，需要休息一下吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_e08f741e:

    # a "Carrying these rocks surely is an exhausting work, but isn't it so great to take a deep breath right here?"
    a "搬这些石头肯定很累，不过能在这里深深吸一口气，不是很棒吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_ae11f49d:

    # a "I can go on, and on. This is just why I like working in the forest, it makes you feel alive."
    a "我还能一直干下去。这正是我喜欢在森林里干活的原因，它让你感受到生命力。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_fcd74902:

    # "He gives you a bright smile, and you smile back."
    "他朝你灿烂一笑，你也回以微笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Back_787484dc:

    # a "Anyway, [e], do you want to join? It would be much quicker to have another pair of hands digging these heavy rocks up."
    a "不管怎么说，[e]，你想来搭把手吗？再多一双手把这些沉重的石头挖出来，会快得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Continue_b74e6f0c:

    # e "Let's keep going, I believe we can complete it very quick!"
    e "我们继续吧，我相信很快就能完成！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Continue_cf91fe08:

    # a "Ha! That's the spirit, keep that positivity flowing!"
    a "哈！这才对嘛，让这股积极劲儿继续保持下去！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Continue_f4aba4d3:

    # "Your HP is too low to continue work."
    "你的生命值太低，无法继续工作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Leave_da8c8e00:

    # e "Well, actually, I need to go."
    e "呃，其实我得走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Leave_e3acd183:

    # a "Ah, is there something wrong, [e]?"
    a "啊，[e]，出什么事了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Leave_3f0ff192:

    # e "Well, I'm getting really exhausted, so I'll need to take some rest."
    e "嗯，我真的累坏了，得休息一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Leave_9a7c7b3a:

    # e "Nothing really, I just remembered there's something I need to do right now."
    e "没什么，我只是刚想起来现在还有件事要做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Leave_aa36f8d1:

    # e "C-can I come back later?"
    e "我、我之后还能回来吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Leave_c566b005:

    # a "Sure thing, puny friend. I'll get started myself, it's gonna take some time without an extra pair of hands here."
    a "当然可以，小不点朋友。我先自己动手吧，这里少了一双手，得花些时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Leave_fe4f3ecd:

    # a "Sure thing, puny friend. I'll continue with the work, it's gonna take some time without an extra pair of hands here."
    a "当然可以，小不点朋友。我会继续干下去，这里少了一双手，得花些时间。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Leave_26c4e768:

    # a "But leave it to me! You've already gotten me a lot of materials to work with. You've been a great friend, and I'll always have your back!"
    a "但交给我吧！你已经给我弄来了很多可用的材料。你一直是个很棒的朋友，我永远都会支持你！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Leave_c987d30b:

    # e "Thanks, Amble. You're just too wholesome, I'll make sure I'd come back and help you with everything I can do."
    e "谢谢你，安布。你实在太暖了，我一定会回来，尽我所能帮你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Clearing_Work_Leave_189b1a37:

    # "With a friendly wave, you part ways with Amble."
    "你友好地挥手，和安布分道扬镳。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_4cdac722:

    # "Amble gives you a bright smile as he walks along the river."
    "安布沿着河边走去时，朝你灿烂一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_07c3a44d:

    # a "There are still work yet to be done, will you offer me some more assistance?"
    a "还有工作没做完，你愿意再帮我一把吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_0252bad1:

    # a "I can do it all by myself, but, it's great to have someone to work along. Communication is key, isn't that right?"
    a "我自己一个人也能全做完，不过有个人一起干活感觉很好。沟通是关键，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_2db6b889:

    # e "I'll lend you all the help you need, Amble! Plus, your enthusiasm is just too contagious!"
    e "我会尽力帮你，安布！而且你的热情实在太有感染力了！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_864585ba:

    # a "That's the [e] I know!"
    a "这才是我认识的那个[e]！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_66e16358:

    # "He gives your back a quite powerful pat, bashing you forwards for a few steps."
    "他在你背上重重一拍，打得你踉跄着向前冲了几步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_15d2ef8d:

    # a "Oops, sorry puny friend. Forgot you were Jog's size."
    a "哎呀，抱歉，小不点朋友。我忘了你和乔格一样高大。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_6fe5eccc:

    # e "It's fine, I think you broke a few rib bones there."
    e "没事，我想你只是弄断了几根肋骨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_6197fabd:

    # a "Did I?"
    a "我弄断了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_70ea0c05:

    # "You're not sure if he's too dense or cheeky, but he extends his large hand from behind you, in the direction of your chest."
    "你不确定他究竟是迟钝还是故意戏弄你，但他从你身后伸出大手，朝你的胸口探来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_38be27d3:

    # "You nod, and let his hands touch your scruffy fur."
    "你点了点头，任由他的双手触碰你蓬乱的毛发。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_98844947:

    # "His whole arm exploring your front with no resistance from you at all. Much attributed to yourself enjoying his rough paws."
    "他的整条手臂都在你身前摸索，而你完全没有抗拒——这很大程度上是因为你享受他粗糙的爪掌。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_fc36e7bb:

    # "Both of his hands advance on your chest from underneath your arm, searching for your rib bones through all the muscles you have."
    "他的双手从你的手臂下方探向胸口，隔着你浑身的肌肉寻找你的肋骨。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_00057d0c:

    # "He's pressing hard, hands drifting through all the scruffy furs of yours, your hand lightly grabs his to guide him onto your bulging chest."
    "他用力按着，双手在你蓬乱的毛发间游移；你轻轻抓住他的手，引导它移向你隆起的胸口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_4b9a75ae:

    # "Amble doesn't seem surprised, instead he intentionally trails his way onto your sensitive nipples, flicking it with rather ease."
    "安布似乎并不惊讶，反而故意一路摸到你敏感的乳头，轻松地弹弄起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_c636f156:

    # e "Hey! Are you really checking my ribs?"
    e "喂！你真的在检查我的肋骨吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_bf38b64f:

    # a "Sorry, had to check this one as well, we gotta be very thorough, don't we?"
    a "抱歉，这里也得检查一下。我们得彻底一点，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_0937754d:

    # "You can't see him from this angle but you know damn well he's smiling or grinning at you."
    "你从这个角度看不见他，但你清楚得很，他一定正冲着你微笑或咧嘴坏笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_99d0f6b7:

    # "Maybe also because your nipples perk up instantly in response to his touch, his hands are rough, and the texture on his paw pads causes you to shudder constantly."
    "或许也是因为他的触碰让你的乳头立刻挺立起来；他的双手很粗糙，爪垫的触感让你不停战栗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_ea50e341:

    # "His hand continue exploring your chest for a moment, squishing it like a heavy bag of milk."
    "他的手继续在你的胸口摸索了片刻，像挤压一大袋沉甸甸的牛奶那样揉捏着它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_ef75a3e3:

    # "You audibly moan when his bear claws lift up your bare chest for a moment."
    "他的熊爪托起你裸露的胸口片刻时，你不由得发出呻吟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_c3b964d8:

    # a "Did that hurt?"
    a "弄疼了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_1ead17cd:

    # e "N-no... but please continue."
    e "不、不是……但请继续。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_7871d664:

    # "He stretches open his hands, and grasps onto your chest with much force, his huge palm moves around, squeezing your chest in all position or direction."
    "他张开双手，用力抓住你的胸口；他巨大的手掌来回移动，从各个角度和方向揉捏着你的胸部。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_b0ad5490:

    # "Amble continues fondling with you for a moment as you feel all the ecstacy building up, but he suddenly releases, and retreating his hand from your chest."
    "安布继续抚弄了你片刻，你感到兴奋不断积聚，可他突然松手，把手从你的胸口收了回去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_dbd93d87:

    # "You can see the red marks imprinted all over your chest there, in the shape of Amble's large hands."
    "你看见胸口到处都印着红痕，形状正是安布那双大手的轮廓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_7f03049f:

    # a "Well, puny friend, your bones are strong as ever."
    a "嗯，小不点朋友，你的骨头还是一如既往地结实。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_0b5d9c8c:

    # a "Shall we continue?"
    a "我们继续吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_45087d11:

    # "You stare at Amble with a pleading eyes, hoping he'd continue with his act but the bear has already continued his walk, you caress your front for a moment, before tidying yourself and catching up with Amble."
    "你用恳求的眼神凝视着安布，希望他继续刚才的动作，可那头熊已经接着赶路了。你抚摸了一会儿自己的胸口，整理好自己后追上安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_5fcf93c6:

    # e "H-hey, Amble I don't think... Maybe we should keep on going..."
    e "等、等等，安布，我觉得不……也许我们还是继续赶路吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_5a1bb7e5:

    # a "No? How else do I know if you're fine, [e]?"
    a "不然呢？我怎么知道你是不是没事，[e]？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_61e0ed94:

    # e "Well, I was joking. You didn't break anything, {size=25}or at lease I hope...{/size}"
    e "我开玩笑的。你什么都没弄坏，{size=25}至少我是这么希望的……{/size}"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_da65b6a1:

    # a "Haha, you're funny, puny friend. Alright, let us continue then."
    a "哈哈，你真有意思，小弱鸡朋友。好吧，那我们继续吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_6318eb68:

    # "Amble gives you a bright smile, as usual. And continues to walk onto the water."
    "安布像往常一样朝你灿烂一笑，继续踏水而行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_fb46f10e:

    # a "Alright, now if we're building an entirely new bridge, we'll need a cofferdam to build to base of the bridge."
    a "好吧，如果要建一座全新的桥，我们就得先筑一道围堰来建造桥基。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_94a2425f:

    # a "We can enclose and drain the area around the base with some wood, that's going to take a lot of days and nights."
    a "用木头把桥基周围围起来，再把水排干，这得耗上很多个日日夜夜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_93c015f4:

    # e "But we already have the base of the bridge right here, don't we?"
    e "但桥基不就在这里吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_b4566de5:

    # a "You're right! That's why we can take some break."
    a "你说得对！所以我们可以休息一下。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_86c5bec4:

    # a "Now, we'll need the wood you just collected, get as much wooden planks there and connect the two ends together with an arch. That'll fix the shape the bridge, so we know where to insert these rocks later on."
    a "现在需要用你刚收集的木头，尽量多弄些木板来，再用拱形结构连接两端。这样就能固定桥的形状，之后我们就知道该在哪里嵌入这些石头了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_ca2448c3:

    # "He motions with his hand with where the planks should go, either vertically or horizontally, squinting his eyes to imagine their position."
    "他用手比划着木板该放的位置，时而竖放，时而横放，眯起眼睛想象着它们的摆放。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_6489c139:

    # e "Okay, so... how do we start?"
    e "好吧，那我们要怎么开始？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_03c77264:

    # a "We'll measure the distance, make sure they are as concise as possible, and we'll set the wooden planks in place with some ropes."
    a "我们先量好距离，确保木板尽可能贴合，再用绳子把它们固定到位。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_75069b3c:

    # a "That's going to be much quicker than removing all these rocks, but I can't do it by myself, measuring is not my strongest suit."
    a "这比把这些石头全搬走快多了，但我一个人可做不到；测量不是我的强项。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_1617cee2:

    # "Amble takes a sigh."
    "安布叹了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_5f275f2e:

    # a "But, if you need some time to rest, please feel free to do so. It's still going to be exhausting."
    a "不过，如果你需要休息一会儿，尽管去休息吧。这活儿还是会很累。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_56a2dfd7:

    # a "Would you like to lend me a hand, [e]?" nointeract
    a "你愿意搭把手吗，[e]？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_c0ac4448:

    # e "I guess I'll take a little rest for now. I'll be right back."
    e "我想我现在先休息一会儿。马上就回来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Begin_97f67c07:

    # a "Alright, [e]. Find me here when you're ready."
    a "好，[e]。准备好后到这里找我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_fb539142:

    # e "Alright then. Let's go!"
    e "好吧，那我们走！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_ae3118a1:

    # a "Hah, I knew you had it in you, well. Let's get down to the business, then."
    a "哈，我就知道你有这本事。好了，那我们开始干活吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_965ff9b3:

    # "Amble walks towards the river, with the planks as you begin to take measurement of the river with his tools, it's not very wise to work under the current of the river but Amble doesn't seem to mind."
    "安布带着木板走向河边。你开始用他的工具测量河流；在水流下作业可不是什么明智之举，但安布似乎并不在意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_f824e8e5:

    # "You point to where Amble needs to put down the planks, and he does so, with rather ease as the pole digs through the river bed with one plunge."
    "你指向安布需要放下木板的地方，他轻松照做，木桩一插便扎进了河床。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_c2fe8b28:

    # e "Is this stable?"
    e "稳固吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_29daf16c:

    # a "No, this is a bridge."
    a "不，这是一座桥。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_69663b72:

    # "Amble gives you a cheeky grin."
    "安布朝你露出一抹坏笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_58a0a083:

    # a "You can say, these planks are set in stone, I don't think it's going to go anywhere."
    a "你可以说，这些木板算是钉死在这儿了，我看它们哪儿也去不了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_a8021891:

    # "You struggle to hold your own chuckle as Amble smile at his own joke, again. Perhaps you are even entranced, staring at his dumb yet cheer smile dazzles you with undescribable happiness."
    "你强忍着笑意，安布又一次对自己的笑话得意地笑了起来。也许你甚至看得入了迷，他那傻气却灿烂的笑容让你感到难以言喻的幸福。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_4ddc1498:

    # "For the next 4 hours, Amble continues jabbing the planks into the river, and fixing them with the ropes you prepared."
    "接下来的4个小时里，安布继续把木板一根根钉进河里，再用你准备好的绳子将它们固定住。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_c8b6f13a:

    # "You're almost finished with the job, and the river is now filled with planks and an arch over the bridge."
    "活儿快做完了，河里已经插满了木板，桥上也搭起了拱架。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_5b7e65b7:

    # "Staring at the bear's beefy body, it seems he's sweating all over again, his fur is drenched in either river water or his own sweat."
    "盯着熊结实的身躯，看起来他似乎又浑身冒起了汗，皮毛被河水或是他自己的汗水浸得湿透。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_0b1a8b9d:

    # "For a moment, your gaze is fixated on his strong physique, until you are distracted by something green in a distance."
    "你的目光在他强健的身躯上停留了片刻，直到远处的某个绿色东西吸引了你的注意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_8efac1c0:

    # "You point towards the direction, and Amble begins to notice it as well."
    "你指向那个方向，安布也开始注意到它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_068e395d:

    # "It seems to be approaching in your direction, not particularly in a malicious way, but still rather intrusive."
    "它似乎正朝你们这边靠近，并没有明显恶意，却依然显得相当碍事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_3307d8ea:

    # "As it closes in, you realise it's a mossy monster, one that is similar to the golem you encountered while travelling with Sebas and Lothar."
    "随着它逐渐靠近，你意识到那是一个长满苔藓的怪物，和你与塞巴斯、洛萨尔旅行时遇到的魔像很相似。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_3a3f4e88:

    # e "What's that?"
    e "那是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_c2f0aba4:

    # a "I have never seen something like him before, something like this is a work of nature, [e]."
    a "我以前从没见过像他这样的家伙，这种东西简直就是大自然的造物，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_69804368:

    # "The monster is covered in all kinds of greenery, roots, leaves, moss, flowers, fungi. His eyes staring at the bridge blankly."
    "那怪物浑身覆盖着各种各样的绿色植物：根、叶子、苔藓、花朵和真菌。他的双眼茫然地盯着桥。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_a4965ab0:

    # "Amble spends a moment to admire this green construct, before it takes a seat on the construction right in front of you two."
    "安布花了片刻欣赏这个绿色造物，随后它便在你们俩面前的施工处坐了下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_252fe6fa:

    # a "Hey there, mister, we're working on a construction right now."
    a "嘿，那边那位，我们现在正在施工呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_75ec7285:

    # "It doesn't seem to listen to Amble at all, just sitting on one end of the bridge casually."
    "它似乎完全没听见安布的话，只是悠闲地坐在桥的一端。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_647f9923:

    # "He settles into the position rather quickly, and any yanking or pulling effort by you and Amble remains futile."
    "它很快就稳稳坐定了，你和安布怎么拽、怎么拉都无济于事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_4f9c7c7a:

    # a "Mister... this is not for sitting."
    a "先生……这里不是给你坐的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_81d0577d:

    # "Amble is genuinely distressed right now, his brows furrow intensely as he's trying to talk sense into someone who can't understand him."
    "安布此刻是真的焦躁不已，他眉头紧锁，试图对一个听不懂他话的家伙讲道理。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_284018a6:

    # a "Mister?!"
    a "先生？！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_33b62fb3:

    # a "{size=50}MISTER-!!{/size}"
    a "{size=50}先生——！！{/size}"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_f9926e55:

    # "No responses are spared by the mossy monster, leaving the bear all frustrated."
    "苔藓怪物始终没有回应，让这头熊郁闷不已。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_dd1f9f9a:

    # e "We can't work if this... guy keeps sitting on our bridge."
    e "要是这……家伙一直坐在我们的桥上，我们根本没法干活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_d7773678:

    # a "Of course! Well, we need to do something."
    a "当然！总之，我们得做点什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_739080c7:

    # e "Maybe we should fight this guy! I think it'll get out if it knows we're here for business."
    e "要不我们和这家伙打一架！我觉得它要是知道我们是来办正事的，就会离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_fba369e9:

    # a "I- well... We can't kill him. We're here to build something beautiful, not to destroy the nature."
    a "我——呃……我们不能杀了他。我们是来建造美丽之物的，不是来破坏大自然的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_672c682a:

    # "Amble exclaims as he furrows his brows, thumb is rubbing against his palm nervously."
    "安布皱起眉头，拇指紧张地摩挲着掌心，惊呼道。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_b71b0419:

    # e "Hmm... then should we just wait?"
    e "嗯……那我们就等着吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_d25c5a4b:

    # a "Well, yeah! You're right, [e]. But, how long is it going to take?"
    a "好吧，你说得对，[e]。不过，这得等多久啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_72849806:

    # "You shake your head, both of you have no idea when will the monster leave."
    "你摇了摇头，你们俩都不知道那怪物什么时候才会离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_af76e330:

    # a "So... what should we do?" nointeract
    a "那么……我们该怎么办？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_c2fced19:

    # e "We'll just fight it until it gets scared and leave, okay? No killing."
    e "我们就一直和它战斗，直到把它吓跑，好吗？不许杀它。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_88960688:

    # a "Puny friend, do you think that'll work?"
    a "小不点朋友，你觉得这样能行吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_b841d111:

    # e "I think so."
    e "我想应该行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_fc47d298:

    # a "Alright then, let's go."
    a "那好，我们走吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_dcdff00e:

    # e "I think we should just wait."
    e "我觉得我们还是等着比较好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_7a2ece73:

    # a "You're right, puny friend. Killing is not the only option we have here."
    a "你说得对，小不点朋友。杀掉它并不是我们唯一的选择。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_c85bbac3:

    # a "In another word, how magnificent that a creature like this is bestowed upon us by mother nature?"
    a "换句话说，大自然母亲赐予我们这样的生灵，是多么壮丽的一件事啊？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_6ca3fbc7:

    # e "That's really rare I agree."
    e "确实很罕见，我同意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_6086a4a1:

    # a "Alright, if you need some rest, I'll stay and maybe wait until the guy's gone."
    a "好吧，如果你需要休息，我会留下来，或许等那家伙离开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Construction_Work_e1ea108e:

    # e "Thanks, Amble!"
    e "谢谢你，安布！"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Bridgeroot_Break_a12fb776:

    # e "Hey, Amble, is that monster not gone yet?"
    e "嘿，安布，那怪物还没走吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Bridgeroot_Break_b347f3f5:

    # a "Not yet, I'm afraid."
    a "恐怕还没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Bridgeroot_Break_2877e600:

    # "You notice the green shaped monster is still sitting on the edge of the bridge, his thin legs swinging in the air as his head veer around idly."
    "你注意到，那只绿色的怪物仍坐在桥边，细长的双腿在空中晃荡，脑袋漫不经心地转来转去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Bridgeroot_Break_639fe8a8:

    # "Amble sighs as he continues waiting."
    "安布一边继续等待，一边叹了口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Bridgeroot_Finish_88332c62:

    # e "Hey, Amble, where is the monster?"
    e "嘿，安布，那怪物去哪儿了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Bridgeroot_Finish_c561b70d:

    # a "Oh! Puny friend, you're right on time! It just left. I saw him got up and started walking south of the river."
    a "哦！小不点朋友，你来得正是时候！它刚刚离开。我看到它站起来，开始往河的南边走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Bridgeroot_Finish_22992bb1:

    # a "We actually ended up talking to each other for a while. He's a kind friend."
    a "我们最后还真的聊了一会儿。他是个善良的朋友。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Bridgeroot_Finish_8386157a:

    # e "Talking? I didn't know a bundle of moss can talk."
    e "聊天？我可不知道一团苔藓也会说话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Bridgeroot_Finish_209f2bde:

    # a "Nah, it's basically me talking myself and he's listening. Isn't that the same thing?"
    a "哪儿啊，基本上是我在自言自语，他负责听着。这不也算一回事吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Bridgeroot_Finish_5a61160e:

    # e "Well, at least you two got along with each other."
    e "至少你们两个相处得还不错。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Bridgeroot_Finish_a4ed138e:

    # a "Hah, thanks, puny friend. But we have something else ahead of us now - the bridge! We should get back to construction right now."
    a "哈哈，多谢了，弱小的朋友。不过我们现在还有别的事要做——桥！我们该马上回去继续施工了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Bridgeroot_Finish_c93e87ee:

    # e "Alright, let's get on with it."
    e "好了，继续干吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_c94cc214:

    # "For the next few hours, you two begin using the masonry mix to stablize the rocks in between these wooden structure you have created."
    "接下来的几个小时里，你们俩开始用砌筑混合料稳固夹在这些木结构之间的岩石。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_bd9b257c:

    # "Moments after moments, you stare at Amble's sweaty posture, he's always been so eager to work on this project, and you're glad to see him putting all his effort into rebuilding the bridge between Lusterfield and the goat tribe."
    "一阵又一阵地，你注视着安布汗涔涔的身影。他一直都如此热衷于这个工程，你很高兴看到他竭尽全力，重建连接卢斯特菲尔德与山羊部落的桥梁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_2e8883a0:

    # "He's been working so hard, that it almost seems like he has forgotten what happened to the green creature you two had just fought."
    "他干得如此卖力，几乎让人以为他已经忘了你们刚才与那只绿色生物交战的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_e09df8b8:

    # "At least that's what you believed, until he turns around in the middle of moving the stone bricks."
    "至少你当时是这么以为的，直到他在搬运石砖时转过身来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_da131871:

    # a "My father always taught me not to interfere with the nature's balance, it's truly a beautiful habitat here."
    a "我父亲一直教导我不要干涉自然的平衡，这里的栖息地确实美丽。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_a863bc44:

    # e "Are you still thinking about that... monster?"
    e "你还在想着那只……怪物吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_f3ad1090:

    # a "You can't make it a habit to kill wild creatures. We can't. There are consequences, it always comes back to bite us."
    a "你不能养成随意杀死野生生物的习惯。我们不能这么做。那会带来后果，报应总会找上门来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_135e3fbb:

    # a "[e], it's a gift of the old gods, to see such a creature in this land. I am just sad to see it go."
    a "[e]，能在这片土地上见到这样的生物，是古老诸神赐予的恩典。我只是很遗憾看着它离去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_a9e19a80:

    # "The bear ponders for a moment as he looks down into the water."
    "熊俯视着水面，沉思了片刻。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_f5e445e9:

    # a "We are here to build bridges, aren't we?"
    a "我们来这里是为了修桥，不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_0c732173:

    # e "Y-yes, of course, that's why I came here with you."
    e "是、是的，当然，我就是为此和你一起来的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_40e687a1:

    # a "Then let us continue..."
    a "那我们继续吧……"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_7a2f61cd:

    # "Amble turns around once more, and resumes to his work."
    "安布再次转过身，继续工作。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_f57fe4f5:

    # "You thought comes to a halt as he hands you another stone brick to be stacked, you two have been working so hard, but it doesn't even seem like the construction is close to finished."
    "你的思绪戛然而止，因为他递给你又一块要垒起来的石砖。你们俩一直干得很卖力，可工程似乎离完工还远着呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_93de948c:

    # "Almost 5 hours has passed, all the towels Amble has prepared are already drenched in his sweat. You pant heavily, as you see Amble sits on the half-completed bridge."
    "将近5个小时过去了，安布准备的毛巾已经全被他的汗水浸透。你气喘吁吁地看着安布坐在那座尚未完工的桥上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_d8794366:

    # "Suddenly, something pokes its head out of the trees behind you. You come to a jolt before readying your weapon behind Amble."
    "突然，有什么东西从你身后的树林里探出头来。你猛地一惊，随即在安布身后准备好武器。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_488390cf:

    # gt "Uh... what are you guys doing here?"
    gt "呃……你们怎么会在这里？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_bfe21272:

    # "It reveals to be a goat, probably guarding the ancient tree nearby. He's holding his spear cautiously, staring at you two with widened eyes."
    "原来是一只山羊，大概是在守卫附近那棵古树。他小心翼翼地握着长矛，瞪大双眼注视着你们两个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_c5123974:

    # a "We're rebuilding this bridge, my friend. Want to join us?"
    a "我们正在重建这座桥，我的朋友。想加入我们吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_3917005c:

    # gt "B-but it's been abandoned for years, why do you want to build it all of a sudden?"
    gt "可、可是它已经废弃好几年了，你们为什么突然想把它建起来？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_c4278ae8:

    # a "It was a beautiful bridge, don't you agree? It'd be a waste to let it dry out from here."
    a "这曾是一座美丽的桥，你不觉得吗？就这么让它从此干涸下去，实在太可惜了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_4bd1c4ba:

    # "The goat says nothing, his eyes squint together as if he was pondering something. But just as you're about to open your mouth, he vanishes from the trees."
    "山羊一言不发，双眼微微眯起，仿佛在思索什么。可就在你准备开口时，他从树林中消失了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_5a82e97e:

    # e "Where did he go?"
    e "他去哪儿了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_1b624c85:

    # a "Probably just left, well. Let's resume our work then."
    a "好吧，他大概刚走。那我们继续干活吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_b5c31843:

    # "You nod, and begin hauling the next stone brick onto the bridge. Amble does so as he prepares the next rock."
    "你点点头，开始把下一块石砖搬到桥上。安布也一边准备下一块石头，一边照做。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_be2c8b96:

    # "It continues for almost an hour, before you are suddenly greeted by another uninvited visitor."
    "这持续了将近一个小时，直到又一位不请自来的访客突然出现在你们面前。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_dc4cd92d:

    # gt "Hey, that's the lusterfolks building the bridge."
    gt "嘿，那些不就是在修桥的闪光镇人吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_16ac882d:

    # "It seems to be the same goat that talked to you earlier, except that he's bringing a few more of his friends along the way."
    "看起来是之前和你说过话的那只山羊，只是这次还带了几个朋友一起来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_fdc503e3:

    # gt "Do you guys need some help? Maybe we can lend a hand, or something."
    gt "你们需要帮忙吗？也许我们可以搭把手，什么的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_52898954:

    # a "Oh, sure! Of course. Please do, my friend. It's our bridge."
    a "哦，当然！当然可以。请吧，我的朋友。这可是我们的桥。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_cf7aa17c:

    # e "A-amble, are you sure we can... allow that?"
    e "安、安布，你确定我们可以……让他们帮忙吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_40f55458:

    # a "I'm sure, puny friend, they'll save a lot of time and effort for us."
    a "我确定，小不点朋友。他们能替我们省下不少时间和力气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_58f73a65:

    # "He smiles with a lopsided grin, probably the first time since you two had fought the moss monster."
    "他咧嘴一笑，这大概是你们和苔藓怪物交手以来，他第一次露出笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_972342b0:

    # "He grins. It puts a smile on your face to see him genuinely happy."
    "他咧嘴笑了。看到他发自内心地开心，你也不禁露出了笑容。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_dae69d24:

    # "The goats all jumps into the water as they murmur among themselves, Amble leads them to the bridge with ease as he instructs them what to do."
    "山羊们纷纷跳进水里，彼此低声交谈。安布一边指导它们该做什么，一边轻松地把它们带到桥边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_21e6b6ef:

    # "Some of them had started working already, and soon the rest of you join in, on the other side of the bridge. Amble hands them the rock with a relieved face."
    "其中一些已经开始干活了，很快你们其余的人也在桥的另一侧加入进来。安布如释重负地把石头递给它们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_43beec97:

    # "Surprisingly, the goats are eager to help, you'd think they might be opposed to building it, but they seem to be wishful to see the bridge back to its previous glory."
    "令人意外的是，山羊们都很乐意帮忙。你本以为它们会反对修桥，可它们似乎都盼着看到桥恢复往日的样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_0a76447f:

    # "Amble pats your back as he tumbles the rest of the rocks across the river. It could have taken days, if not a week to finish the bridge, but with the goats it seems almost a breeze to blow through."
    "安布拍了拍你的背，把剩下的石头滚过河去。要是没有山羊帮忙，修好这座桥可能得花上好几天，甚至一周；但有了它们，事情似乎轻而易举。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_40f094a7:

    # "For the next few hours, some goats joins and some leaves to return home, but you can see the progress very clearly, as both ends of the bridge slowly reaches to the center."
    "接下来的几个小时里，一些山羊加入进来，另一些则离开回家；不过你能清楚地看到进展——桥的两端正慢慢向中央延伸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_f96a2fbc:

    # "At least the masonry mix you've crafted is sufficient to do its job, filling in the gaps between stone bricks."
    "至少，你调制的砌筑混合料足以派上用场，填补石砖之间的缝隙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_8f9eaca1:

    # "Amble seems pleasantly surprised by how quick the bridge seems to be finishing, with only a few rocks remaining, it's only a matter of time before the bridge can be walked across once again."
    "安布似乎很惊喜，桥这么快就快修好了。只剩下几块石头，再过一会儿就又能走过这座桥了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_d7abbcd3:

    # a "Well, that's the last one."
    a "好了，这就是最后一块了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_c59d7159:

    # "Amble sighs as the rock settles perfectly onto the cracks, the magical material does help quickly sealing the deal with its extra stability and cohesion."
    "安布叹了口气，石头恰好稳稳落在裂缝上；这种魔法材料凭借额外的稳定性和黏合力，确实让修复工作很快收了尾。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_f3ee70a6:

    # "Everyone cheers, including you and the goats, after hours and hours of work, it was quite amazing to see what the two village had before finally reinstated."
    "经过长时间的劳作，所有人都欢呼起来，你和山羊们也不例外。看到两个村庄之间原有的桥终于恢复，真是令人惊叹。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_6d40072f:

    # gt "Haah! Damn, we didn't know it'd be this easy... it had been an honour."
    gt "哈啊！该死，没想到会这么容易……能帮上忙是我们的荣幸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_73fcb30f:

    # gt2 "Well, you've got good hearts in ya. The bridge will help both sides a lot, no matter whatever happens to the votes."
    gt2 "嗯，你们都是好心人。这座桥会给双方带来很大帮助，不管投票结果如何。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_24f0f199:

    # "You nod, receiving a few thumbs up from the goats."
    "你点点头，几只山羊朝你竖起了大拇指。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_0190ee90:

    # "They are laughing amongst themselves as they soon depart."
    "它们彼此说笑着，很快便离开了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_fb3e6815:

    # a "Farewell, my friends."
    a "告别了，我的朋友们。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_61dfcefa:

    # "Amble stands pridefully as he waves goodbye to the goats, as you stand by his side."
    "安布骄傲地站着，向山羊们挥手道别，而你就站在他身旁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_a258e347:

    # a "Well, here's the bridge. Doesn't it look wonderful, puny friend?"
    a "瞧，桥就在这儿。是不是很漂亮，小不点朋友？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_211d43e5:

    # e "It does! It's been a great journey working with you, Amble."
    e "确实如此！和你一起共事的这段旅程真棒，安布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_1c00a361:

    # a "True, and the goats too. I was pleasantly surprised they're such an enthusiastic bunch of fellows. Well, I guess that settles it."
    a "没错，山羊们也是。我很惊讶他们竟然这么热情。好吧，我想这就算定下来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_73701db5:

    # e "Ah, did you decide what you're gonna vote?"
    e "啊，你决定好要投什么了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_194b3b5e:

    # a "Yeah, I'm gonna have to say sorry to Lot a lot after the vote."
    a "是啊，投票后，我可得向洛特道好多次歉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_8607607c:

    # a "Well... I changed my mind. But it's already past the vote day."
    a "嗯……我改变主意了。不过投票日已经过去了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_8ea02189:

    # a "Anyway, don't step on the bridge too soon, the mix's not dried yet."
    a "总之，别太早踏上桥，黏合料还没干呢。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_9ad6db3c:

    # e "Of course, well. It's been an honour for me too."
    e "当然。嗯，对我来说也是一种荣幸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_d57fac30:

    # a "Yes, well. Maybe if we have some fun projects with Jog later on we'll be sure to include you, [e]."
    a "是啊，嗯。以后要是和乔格一起做些有趣的项目，我们一定会把你也算上，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_adb3abec:

    # "You put on a wide grin."
    "你咧嘴一笑。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_70717542:

    # "It seems Amble is putting behind all matter with the bridgeroot. You're sort of glad he did so, at least what happened might not have changed him as much."
    "安布似乎已经把和桥根有关的一切都抛在脑后了。你多少为此感到高兴，至少那件事可能没有那么深地改变他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_02a42d0d:

    # "Though, perhaps it's only because it's something he doesn't like to talk about."
    "不过，也许只是因为那是他不喜欢谈论的事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Amble_Voting_Continue_Last_Stretch_Start_b9724847:

    # "You two part way, as Amble finishes decorating the bridge."
    "你们两人就此分开，安布继续完成桥上的装饰。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_c5610f86:

    # e "Ole, how do you think about the vote that's coming soon?"
    e "奥利，你觉得即将到来的投票怎么样？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_62ebf383:

    # o "The voting day? Well, let's say I didn't expect Rahim to actually hold something like that."
    o "投票日？嗯，这么说吧，我没想到雷希姆真的会举办这种事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_5833a4c7:

    # e "Uh... Why not?"
    e "呃……为什么不会？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_74e94165:

    # o "For starter, he's not fond of goats, that was kind of an obscure fact."
    o "首先，他不喜欢山羊——这算是个不太为人知的事实。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_ef4d2025:

    # "Ole raises his voice, telling you that he's clearly sarcastic."
    "奥利提高了嗓门，显然是在讽刺你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_380e3a76:

    # o "I guess he has had a change of heart, after what transpired when he shouted at Furkan."
    o "我猜，在他冲弗坎大喊之后发生的那些事，让他改变了心意。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_f0c0494d:

    # e "Yeah, did you hear it too?"
    e "是啊，你也听见了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_00ec1f58:

    # o "Who didn't? Rahim has such a rough shouting voice, you'd be surprised if someone in the village didn't hear it."
    o "谁没听见？雷希姆喊叫时的嗓音那么粗哑，要是村里有人没听见，你才会觉得奇怪。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_95698767:

    # o "Anyway, kiddo. What were you about to ask?"
    o "总之，小家伙。你刚才想问什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_030684d6:

    # e "I just wanted to ask, uh... how would you vote?"
    e "我只是想问，呃……你会怎么投票？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_37f5c473:

    # o "I'm rather confused if you're asking for my opinion or an instruction."
    o "我有点弄不清，你是在问我的意见，还是要我下指示。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_314b8e63:

    # o "Let me assume it's opinion. Well, I haven't decided yet, but in most scenarios I can foresee, I would vote no."
    o "那我就当你是在问我的意见吧。嗯，我还没决定，但按我能预见的大多数情况，我会投反对票。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_ca4760a9:

    # o "It's not much of a problem with the goats essentially, but their guards had been giving me a headache I'd rather not ally with them."
    o "说到底，山羊族本身倒不算什么大问题，但他们的守卫一直让我头疼，我可不太想和他们结盟。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_5155defd:

    # e "Hey, but Seb was quite adament about this whole change, right?"
    e "不过，塞布对这次变革可是相当坚决，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_17714d64:

    # o "I know his reasons."
    o "我知道他的理由。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_a0d4a875:

    # o "Seb's going to hate me for that, but it's true. The goats were really nosy about where our goods come from, well before everything took a bad turn."
    o "塞布会因此恨我的，但事实就是如此。早在一切恶化之前，那些山羊族就一直对我们的货物来源刨根问底。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_fc11ff6b:

    # e "But, you trusted me, even at the first day we met."
    e "但你信任我，甚至在我们初次见面的第一天就信任我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_b305fc39:

    # o "Ha, well. You have no ulterior motives. It was just too easy to see what's your heart's made of."
    o "哈，这个嘛。你没有任何不可告人的动机。要看清你是什么样的人，实在太容易了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_73608467:

    # e "Oh... my heart?"
    e "哦……我的内心？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_4023533a:

    # o "Mmm-hmm, that's why we let you stay, it didn't take a lot to see through you, but it's not a bad thing, kiddo."
    o "嗯，所以我们才让你留下来。看透你并不难，不过这也不是什么坏事，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_fee661a0:

    # e "Ole, are you serious."
    e "奥利，你是认真的吗。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_da16e49c:

    # o "Well, that's the fun right. Much like, I already know why you're asking me about the vote."
    o "嗯，这才有意思，对吧。就像这样，我已经知道你为什么要问我投票的事了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_1fb2cbe5:

    # "You notice Ole staring deep into your eyes as he leans closer."
    "你注意到奥利靠得更近了，正深深凝视着你的双眼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_91343075:

    # o "Because, you wanted to see if I have the same opinion as you do! Isn't it?"
    o "因为你想看看我的意见是不是和你一样！不是吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_67700914:

    # e "That's very insightful, but why would you vote otherwise, firstly?"
    e "你洞察得很深，但首先，我为什么要投另一票呢？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_30df0001:

    # o "I said it's about the goats, but it was not all of them, just one."
    o "我说过，问题出在那些山羊族身上，但不是他们全部，只是其中一个。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_0b67b621:

    # o "Their shopkeeper, Gwyddyon, when we first made our trade deals, and I was away, he took advantage of Seb."
    o "他们的店主格威迪恩。我们最初谈成交易时，我当时不在，他就占了塞布的便宜。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_81863cf9:

    # o "Not the other advantage. But by strangling all source materials for all stones and crystals, he backed Seb into a corner-"
    o "不是指另一种占便宜。但他掐断了所有石头和水晶的原材料供应，把塞布逼到了绝境——"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_87874b6d:

    # "Ole shifts his gaze around, weirdly he seems unconfortable with the words he has spoken."
    "奥利四下转移目光；奇怪的是，他似乎对自己说出口的话感到不自在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_90acd677:

    # o "At the end of the day, we got the worst end of the deal. And we ended up working together, but not out of mutual benefits, but obligations."
    o "说到底，我们在那笔交易中吃了最大的亏。后来我们不得不合作，但并不是为了互惠互利，而是出于义务。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_232db0f8:

    # o "We've worked this way for some time, before our contact was severed, naturally. And after all these years, Seb might have forgotten about this, but I didn't."
    o "在我们的联系自然中断之前，我们一直以这种方式合作了一段时间。多年过去，塞布也许已经忘了这件事，但我没有。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_c3859c08:

    # "He turns his attention back to you, with a significantly more confident stare, ones that feels as if he staring into your very being."
    "他重新将注意力转回你身上，目光明显更有自信，仿佛能看穿你的内在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_148202d1:

    # "You naturally squirm, even as a friend who rescued you on your first day in this world, he seems... too ambitious for the Ole you knew."
    "你不由自主地扭动起来。即使他是那个在你来到这个世界的第一天救了你的朋友，他看起来也……比你认识的那个奥利野心大得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_3835c9d3:

    # o "So, if we have to make a better deal, maybe I should know fully what his intention is."
    o "所以，如果我们必须谈成一笔更好的交易，也许我应该彻底弄清他的意图。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_d2ebda68:

    # o "We have already arranged a meeting in Haskell's place beforehand, just three days before the voting begins."
    o "我们已经事先安排好了在哈斯克尔家里见面，就在投票开始前三天。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_04aab8cc:

    # o "I'll be there talking with Gwyd. And Haskell will be... some sort of mediator."
    o "我会在那里和格威德谈。哈斯克尔则会……充当某种调解人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_7ac01ecb:

    # o "But, before that, I need your help to, perhaps make the negotiation smoother."
    o "不过在那之前，我需要你的帮助，好让谈判……或许能顺利些。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_febb18b0:

    # e "Am I the only one who can do it?"
    e "难道只有我能做到吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_aa8b61ed:

    # o "Of course, kiddo. The only question is, are you going to help?" nointeract
    o "当然，小家伙。唯一的问题是，你愿不愿意帮忙？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_3429900b:

    # e "Sure. How do I get started?"
    e "好啊。我要从哪里开始？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_b1b72812:

    # o "Well, that's very easy, unless Gwyd's not being coperative, which I can already envision him so."
    o "嗯，这很简单，除非格威德不肯合作——而我已经能想象到他会是这样了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_7e0ee3bd:

    # "The lizard steps away and cleans his towel, before leading you to your table."
    "蜥蜴人走到一旁，清理好自己的毛巾，然后带你到你的桌边。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_c812a3a2:

    # o "In the old trade route we- {i}agreed{/i} upon, we exports the herbs and harvests and some potions. And them with the assistance of the dark forest, exported building materials, rocks and minerals."
    o "在我们{i}达成一致{/i}的旧贸易路线上——我们出口药草、收成和一些药剂。而在黑暗森林的协助下，我们向他们出口建筑材料、岩石和矿物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_67653c62:

    # o "And it will probably stay the same if we ever cooperate again."
    o "如果我们再次合作，情况大概也会保持不变。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_bdd6fa0b:

    # o "So, there's something I need you to do, which involves something rather dangerous."
    o "所以，有件事我需要你去做，而且相当危险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_f582aa3a:

    # e "Okay then, but you're being pretty suspicious lately, Ole."
    e "好吧，不过你最近实在很可疑，奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_33d95733:

    # o "Maybe, but you didn't know how badly we got out of that deal."
    o "也许吧，但你不知道我们从那桩交易里脱身时有多狼狈。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_c50ce141:

    # o "We were basically working under him, as the majority of our profit are just sent directly to his magic shop."
    o "我们基本上都在替他做事，因为我们大部分的收益都会直接送进他的魔法商店。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_0c65b962:

    # o "And Haskell was rightfully pissed too."
    o "哈斯克尔也理所当然地气坏了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_8b8ac6f4:

    # o "That's not true, even if we're counting Pirkka's prose."
    o "那不对，就算把皮尔卡的文稿也算进去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_7bdf329b:

    # e "Oh we are surely counting that."
    e "哦，那当然得算上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_1159b1cd:

    # o "Well, the truth is, there was something I noticed while engaging with the bandits."
    o "嗯，说真的，我和那些强盗打交道时注意到了一件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_79bc9ac6:

    # e "What's it?"
    e "是什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_a3c3a132:

    # o "I happened to run into the supplier of Gwyd's shop. That was one of the reasons I talked with the bandits after all, to track where his products come from."
    o "我碰巧遇到了给格威德的商店供货的人。这也是我后来和那些强盗交谈的原因之一，毕竟我是想查清他的商品来自哪里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_9d1b5625:

    # o "If we need to end up on the better end of the deal, well, Gwyd has to need us more than we need them."
    o "格威德需要我们的程度，必须超过我们需要他们的程度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_30f11081:

    # o "And that means, that supplier needs to stop, for lack of a better word, supplying Ardent Cauldron."
    o "这也就是说，那个供应商得停止供货——换个不那么直白的说法，就是不再向炽热坩埚供货。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_a581a946:

    # e "Is that necessary? Can we not, talk this over?"
    e "有这个必要吗？我们不能坐下来谈谈吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_0a2d8be1:

    # o "Trusting him like Seb does was a mistake, maybe we need to take a form of revenge to make Gwyd reconsider his position a little better."
    o "像塞布那样信任他是个错误，也许我们得采取某种报复手段，让格威德稍微重新考虑一下自己的立场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_504fd88b:

    # "Ole gives you a cheeky wink, one with a warm intention, but also a tint of craftiness."
    "奥利调皮地朝你眨了眨眼，既带着温暖的善意，也透着一丝狡黠。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_e841e69e:

    # e "So, what should I do?"
    e "那么，我该怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_1aa010cd:

    # o "The supplier will be present in the negotiation. They had heard about what happened in Lusterfield too, so I think they'll be discussing a new contract."
    o "供应商会参加谈判。他们也听说了发生在卢斯特菲尔德的事，所以我想，他们应该会谈一份新合约。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_6c623e46:

    # e "What does that mean, Ole-"
    e "等等，这是什么意思，奥利——"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_8adecfd2:

    # o "Through my own observation, I've got to know some mysterious individual that supplies Gwyd his everyday goods."
    o "据我观察，我认识了一个为格维德供应日常用品的神秘人物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_9d1b5625_1:

    # o "If we need to end up on the better end of the deal, well, Gwyd has to need us more than we need them."
    o "要想让交易对我们更有利，格维德就得比我们更需要我们，而不是我们更需要他。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_30f11081_1:

    # o "And that means, that supplier needs to stop, for lack of a better word, supplying Ardent Cauldron."
    o "也就是说，那个供应商得停止——姑且这么说吧——向炽热坩埚供货。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_a581a946_1:

    # e "Is that necessary? Can we not, talk this over?"
    e "有这个必要吗？我们就不能坐下来谈谈吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_0a2d8be1_1:

    # o "Trusting him like Seb does was a mistake, maybe we need to take a form of revenge to make Gwyd reconsider his position a little better."
    o "像塞布那样信任他是个错误。也许我们得采取某种报复手段，好让格维德重新考虑一下自己的立场。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_504fd88b_1:

    # "Ole gives you a cheeky wink, one with a warm intention, but also a tint of craftiness."
    "奥利朝你俏皮地眨了眨眼，眼神既温和，又透着几分狡黠。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_e841e69e_1:

    # e "So, what should I do?"
    e "那么，我该怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_6b543114:

    # o "Gwyd meets up with his supplier in the morning, they had heard about what happened in Lusterfield too, so I think they'll be discussing a new contract."
    o "格维德明早会和供应商碰面，他们也听说了发生在卢斯特菲尔德的事，所以我想，他们应该会谈一份新合约。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_93b1024d:

    # e "Wait, how did you know so much things?"
    e "等等，你怎么会知道这么多？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_627e244a:

    # o "It's a secret, kiddo."
    o "这是秘密，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_959f4acb:

    # o "So, you'll need to talk to Gwyd about his latest product, try to get some information about it, and then, we'll probably try to one-up him, and make something much more impressive for the supplier."
    o "所以，你得去和格维德谈谈他最近的产品，想办法从中打听出一些信息。然后，我们大概会设法压过他一头，为供应商做出更令人印象深刻的东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_65ba276b:

    # o "The hardest part is to probe some information out of him. From what I've already experienced, you only have one chance before he gets nosy. So don't mess it up."
    o "最难的部分，是从他嘴里套出一些消息。按我之前的经验，在他开始刨根问底之前，你只有一次机会。所以，千万别搞砸。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_50023211:

    # e "Alright, I'll try my best to poke around, for whatever's worth."
    e "好吧，我会尽力打听的，能做到什么程度就做到什么程度。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_d3d52d55:

    # "Ole gives you a smile, before turning back his attention to the dressers."
    "奥利朝你微微一笑，随后又将注意力转回那些柜子上。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_e39187bd:

    # o "I trust you, [e], both for finishing the task, and for indulging with my own affair."
    o "我相信你，[e]，相信你能完成任务，也相信你愿意帮我处理自己的事情。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_37652548:

    # e "You saved my life, right over at the green forest when I was passed out. And I'll forever be indebted."
    e "我昏倒在那片绿森林时，是你救了我的命。我将永远欠你的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_8955f0c4:

    # o "Yeah? Forever?"
    o "是吗？永远？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_3260a0a5:

    # "He leans in, just one inch short of being uncomfortably close. And you look into his eyes, uncertain yet attentive."
    "他向你凑近，近得只差一英寸就会让人感到不适。你望进他的眼睛，既有些不确定，却又专注。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_dc8d509c:

    # o "Don't kid, [e]. You'll need more than forever."
    o "别开玩笑，[e]。你需要的不只是永远。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_7f319d0e:

    # "The whole world seems to have taken a pause at this moment, your hands touch without you both knowing, and it naturally clenches against each other."
    "这一刻，整个世界仿佛都停顿了。你们谁都没有意识到，双手已经碰在了一起，并自然而然地紧紧交握。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_d0d25754:

    # "His mouth hangs agape slightly, and you can feel his breath, directly coming out of his mouth as he gasps in surprise or confusion."
    "他的嘴微微张开，你能感受到他从口中呼出的气息——他似乎因惊讶或困惑而倒吸了一口气。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_27c0fa73:

    # "Something is pulling you into his scaly embrace, you can't tell what it is exactly, but right now everything suddenly goes blurry, except for Ole."
    "某种东西正将你拉入他覆满鳞片的怀抱，你说不清那究竟是什么，但此刻，一切都突然变得模糊，除了奥利。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_69c0771b:

    # "With a quick blink, Ole snaps back into reality, and you feel his scaly hand releases yours, and instead quickly pinches onto your red cheeks."
    "眨了眨眼，奥利猛地回过神来；你感觉到他那只鳞片手松开了你的手，转而飞快地捏住了你发红的脸颊。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_4e69d433:

    # o "Something's on your face."
    o "你脸上有东西。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_63313137:

    # "He lets go of your soft cheeks, nudges his fingers for quite a few times, as you stand still, still processing what had happened."
    "他松开你柔软的脸颊，手指又轻轻动了好几下，而你僵站在原地，仍在消化刚才发生的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_7fa87ded:

    # "Some of Ole's warmth lingers as your palm feels for your cheeks. as if you are still being pinched by his plump claws, and that small action has made your heart racing so fast."
    "当你的手掌摸向脸颊时，奥利的温度仍残留其上，仿佛那双肥厚的爪子还在捏着你，而那小小的举动让你的心跳快得惊人。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_9ba79151:

    # e "Hey, Ole-"
    e "喂，奥利——"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_8866236d:

    # o "Get going now, kiddo."
    o "快走吧，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_319c8a74:

    # "Ole returns his attention to the furniture, scrubbing onto another dark spot so hard that he's scraping off the paint from the dresser."
    "奥利重新把注意力放回家具上，用力擦洗另一处黑斑，竟把柜子上的漆都刮掉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_9deba1a3:

    # e "W-well, maybe later?"
    e "呃——要不晚点？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_04ee4374:

    # o "Alright, then I'll keep on scrubbing on the dresser."
    o "好吧，那我就继续擦这柜子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Opinion_07f4540d:

    # "Ole smiles, before returning his attention to his own towel."
