    # o "That's the Gwyddyon I know. Don't worry, you've tried your best, kiddo."
    o "这才是我认识的格威迪恩。别担心，你已经尽力了，小家伙。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Gwyddyon_256a807f:

    # e "So, what are you gonna do?"
    e "那么，你打算怎么办？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Gwyddyon_dbcf9f90:

    # o "Now's the time I try my best too. I'll go to the meeting with Gwyd. Hopefully what I had already prepared will prove sufficient."
    o "现在也该轮到我尽力了。我会和格威德一起去参加会议。希望我已经准备好的东西足够应付。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_After_Gwyddyon_199b6815:

    # e "I'm sorry I couldn't help more, Ole."
