translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Got_Gwyd_Answer_47b41adc:

    # o "Hmm..."
    o "嗯……"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Got_Gwyd_Answer_3924b411:

    # "Ole ponders for a moment, tapping his finger at the dresser."
    "奥利思索了片刻，用手指轻敲着梳妆台。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Got_Gwyd_Answer_5e1efcd5:

    # o "Perhaps he wanted to test if Gwyd understands his materials. He didn't want him to just put his products on the shelves and then forget about it."
    o "也许他是想测试格威德是否了解自己的材料。他不想让格威德只是把自己的产品摆上货架，然后就把这事忘了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Got_Gwyd_Answer_55d73e77:

    # o "Maybe I'm stretching it, maybe he just wants a harp. In this case, we can make one ourselves, we may have even secured the deal if ours are better than what Gwyd comes up with."
    o "也许是我想多了，也许他只是想要一把竖琴。这样的话，我们可以自己做一把；只要做出来的比格威德做的更好，说不定这笔交易就算谈成了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Got_Gwyd_Answer_791c37a0:

    # e "I guess so. But where can we find a harp...?"
    e "我想是吧。不过，我们上哪儿去找竖琴呢……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Got_Gwyd_Answer_e965aa10:

    # o "Find? No, no. Judging by what you said, we will need to make them from the supplier's materials."
