    s "哎，别把我算进去！我可不想被拖进你们那场持续10小时的“{i}把自己无聊死{/i}”活动里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Finding_Number_64a31503:

    # o "You sure? I've got some book recommendations for new beginners."
    o "你确定？我这儿有些给初学者的书籍推荐。"

translate schinese_rewrite Ole_Voting_Finding_Number_37b9a5b6:

    # s "I'll go play wit-... by myself. Hey, have fun with your books! Don't let me get between you two!"
