translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_ebbf83cd:

    # "Sebas starts sniffing, you're not sure what's going on, to all you know they're just sitting inside the wagon."
    "塞巴斯开始嗅闻起来，你也搞不清发生了什么；在你看来，他们不过是坐在马车里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_e641c140:

    # s "When I first heard Jog's meeting with Ole, I remembered what happened when we kicked him out. You remember the reason."
    s "我第一次听说乔格和奥利见面时，想起了我们把他赶出去时发生的事。你还记得原因吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_db02b588:

    # ct "If my memory serves right, I recalled your fellow scout had it stolen."
    ct "如果我记得没错，你那位侦察同伴的东西被偷了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_b1a920f7:

    # "You hear a loud stomping sound somewhere afar, not a sound from you, but it has certainly caught the attention of the two in the wagon."
    "你听见远处传来一阵响亮的跺地声，并非你发出的动静，但马车里的两人显然都注意到了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_77fd53c2:

    # ct "What's the matter?"
    ct "怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_e587c86b:

    # s "Don't you change the to-"
    s "你别转移话-"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_188c1b30:

    # "Sebas begins, cut off abruptly by another thunderous stomp. The tension between the two lions is momentarily overshadowed by the imminent danger approaching."
    "塞巴斯刚开口，又一声雷鸣般的跺地声骤然打断了他。两头狮子之间的紧张气氛，暂时被逼近的危险盖过。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_87c32625:

    # "You crawl out, squinting at the source, catching the faint outline of a massive creature along the river."
    "你爬了出来，眯眼望向声源，看到河边一个巨大生物的模糊轮廓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_7460760a:

    # "It is heading to the wagon, undoubtedly on the verge of attacking the two lions."
    "它正朝马车而去，显然马上就要攻击那两头狮子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_cfd16ba3:

    # s "Stay here, uncle Castor."
    s "留在这儿，卡斯托尔叔叔。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_4ccb28ff:

    # "Sebas stands and peeks out of the wagon."
    "塞巴斯站起身，探头望出马车。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_a8813c25:

    # "You run head first against the dark figure, leaving the explaining for your future self."
    "你迎头冲向那个黑影，把解释的事留给未来的自己。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_312df99a:

    # "Its form becomes clearer as it closes in, the green moss and leaves covers most of its body."
    "它越靠越近，身形也愈发清晰；绿色的苔藓和叶子覆盖了它大半个身体。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_a8528d2c:

    # "Expectedly, Sebas notices your presence the moment he lifts up the curtain, but he doesn't react."
    "不出所料，塞巴斯掀起帘子的那一刻便注意到了你的存在，却没有反应。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_281e4f65:

    # "The sheer size looms over you, but it doesn't look to be aggressive."
    "它庞大的身形笼罩着你，不过看起来并没有攻击性。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_6fb88db3:

    # kg "My liege, the enemy approaches. We must make haste to return to the palace at once."
    kg "陛下，敌人逼近了。我们必须立即赶回王宫。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_6322b266:

    # "Your heart skips a beat. What have you done..."
    "你的心猛地漏跳一拍。你都做了什么……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_c416325a:

    # "The Guard rushes back towards the wagon, as Sebas walks up to you, silently."
    "卫兵冲回马车，塞巴斯则默默朝你走来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_14989b10:

    # ct "Wait."
    ct "等等。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_a235a04a:

    # ct "Sebas, what is it?"
    ct "塞巴斯，怎么了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_52b17bda:

    # "He stares at the walking moss figure."
    "他凝视着那个行走的苔藓身影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_54e32233:

    # s "No. It's... just moss."
    s "不。那……只是苔藓。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_9389266b:

    # kg "This may be the work of a spy. We can't afford to risk it."
    kg "这可能是间谍的手笔。我们承担不起这个风险。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_d848c448:

    # "The guard pauses abruptly."
    "守卫突然停下脚步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_f0a08a11:

    # ct "Then let us continue another time, Sebas. Stay vigilant."
    ct "那我们改日再继续吧，塞巴斯。保持警惕。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_7ea473f7:

    # "As you and Sebas turn around, the wagon has already set off in the opposite direction."
    "你和塞巴斯转过身时，马车已经朝相反的方向驶去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_a2d2cfa5:

    # "Soon, you two are left alone, the leafy monster walks between the two of you, sluggishly looks ahead."
    "很快，只剩下你们两人，那个满身叶子的怪物走在你们中间，懒洋洋地望着前方。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_0da34c5c:

    # e "Uh. I didn't expect to see you here, Seb."
    e "呃。我没想到会在这里见到你，塞布。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_3ad14518:

    # s "I should be the one saying that."
    s "该说这句话的人应该是我。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_a24b8fad:

    # "You watch as the moss monster wanders off in to the forest, you had thought it was a threat."
    "你看着那只苔藓怪走进森林，渐渐远去；你原以为它是个威胁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_462ef58c:

    # s "You were there, when me and Rahim were talking."
    s "你当时就在场，我和雷希姆说话时你也在。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_7b52d27b:

    # s "Why is this happening so many times? [e]."
    s "这到底为什么一再发生？[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_f1d595d2:

    # e "U-uh..."
    e "呃、呃……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_eba61641:

    # e "I was walking down the forest at night, then I heard a loud noise and came over."
    e "我晚上在森林里走着，后来听到一声巨响，就过来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_08d3b443:

    # s "Did you hear anything?"
    s "你听到什么了吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_786e122f:

    # e "I only hear a little, King of... Likkathia? You shouted that word so loud the whole forest might as well hear that."
    e "我只听到一点点，利卡希亚之王……？你把那个词喊得那么响，整片森林都听得见了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_ef9da69c:

    # "Sebas squints his eyes, staring in both suspicion and uneasiness."
    "塞巴斯眯起眼睛，带着怀疑与不安凝视着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_b7daa2a2:

    # s "Just, a little?"
    s "只是，一点点？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_317710cd:

    # e "Yes, sorry if that was not intended for me to hear."
    e "是的，抱歉，如果那本来不是说给我听的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_e5ee4f10:

    # e "I just arrived here, didn't hear anything except for that loud stomp this guy's been making."
    e "我刚到这里，除了这家伙一路发出的响亮跺脚声，什么也没听见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_3f1221b7:

    # e "I mean, he's really a show stopper, isn't that right?"
    e "我的意思是，他可真是个抢尽风头的家伙，对吧？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_ef9da69c_1:

    # "Sebas squints his eyes, staring in both suspicion and uneasiness."
    "塞巴斯眯起眼睛，带着怀疑与不安凝视着。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_78f3667d:

    # s "Nothing, really?"
    s "真是什么都没有？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_6c5f1c73:

    # e "Not any words I can make out."
    e "没有我能听懂的词。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_263d8f27:

    # s "Whatever, it's not my secret to keep."
    s "随便吧，这不是我该替你保守的秘密。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_3c811b27:

    # s "I can't believe I let him slip away again."
    s "真不敢相信，我又让他溜走了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_f13bcce6:

    # e "Uh, was that... the king of Likkathia?"
    e "呃，刚才那是……利卡希亚之王？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_03039446:

    # s "Capital of Mokken, or whatever you call that part of the land."
    s "莫肯的首都，或者你们怎么称呼那片地方都行。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_ad888cb3:

    # e "I mean, I thought I was here to deal with a monster as well."
    e "我是说，我还以为自己来这儿也是为了对付怪物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_f673c93c:

    # e "And he's just chilling."
    e "可他倒是一副悠哉悠哉的样子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_a8a49402:

    # "You point at the continued stomping of the moss monster, who's wandering aimlessly around the forest."
    "你指着那只在森林里漫无目的游荡、还在不停跺脚的苔藓怪物。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_e85a5d3b:

    # s "I wanna go home, roomie. I'm tired."
    s "我想回家了，室友。我累了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_8653c8f4:

    # e "O-okay."
    e "好、好吧。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_5c2aa8ec:

    # s "A-and... forget what happened here, alright? Including the wagon, everything."
    s "还、还有……把这里发生的事忘了，好吗？包括那辆马车，一切都忘掉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_9b21486b:

    # s "I- is it weird that I don't believe a single word you say, roomie?"
    s "我、我一句都不信你说的话，这很奇怪吗，室友？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_a9d5838b:

    # "Your heart sinks faster than a hurled cannonball, dragging you down."
    "你的心比被掷出的炮弹下沉得还快，拖着你一同坠落。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_7607e0e4:

    # s "It didn't use to be like that, I... I liked you, I still like you now. But..."
    s "以前不是这样的，我……我喜欢过你，我现在依然喜欢你。但是……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_afe73c94:

    # s "I hope this feeling goes away the next time I wake up, [e]."
    s "希望下次醒来时，这种感觉就会消失，[e]。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_037dea58:

    # "You don't even dare to look at Seb anymore, instead the path towards Lusterfield has been all but silence, both of you has had something to ponder, and perhaps, a new perspective on each other."
    "你甚至不敢再看塞巴斯一眼。回到卢斯特菲尔德的路上，你们几乎一路无言；你们两人都有些事情需要思考，或许也对彼此有了新的看法。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_f2602b3b:

    # "Outside the shop, Ole is already greeting to two of you with a shocked look."
    "店外，奥利已经带着震惊的神情向你们两人打招呼。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_7d30c532:

    # o "You two are together? what happened-"
    o "你们俩在一起了？发生了什么——"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_98a662fb:

    # s "I'm going to bed."
    s "我要去睡觉了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_e5e0a6a8:

    # "Ole inquires Sebas, who ignores him and runs upstairs quickly. His attention quickly shifts to you."
    "奥利向塞巴斯问话，但塞巴斯没有理他，迅速跑上楼去。他的注意力很快转向了你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_1c98e1b0:

    # "In shame, you lower your head."
    "你羞愧地低下了头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_020687c5:

    # o "You saw the wagon?"
    o "你看到那辆马车了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_6186867a:

    # "You nod."
    "你点了点头。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_7df121d3:

    # o "Oh... no..."
    o "哦……不……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_cdbff688:

    # e "I'm sorry."
    e "对不起。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_31415978:

    # o "It's fine. I'll talk to Seb, don't fret about it. Everything will be back to normal tomorrow."
    o "没事。我会去和塞巴斯谈谈，你别担心。明天一切都会恢复正常。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_4118f6e9:

    # "Despite Ole's assurance, you do not believe it ends, if ever."
    "尽管奥利再三保证，你还是不相信这件事会结束，哪怕它终究会结束。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_fe675573:

    # "Without hesitation, you slip away through the thick grasses and run back to Lusterfield."
    "你毫不犹豫地钻进茂密的草丛，跑回了卢斯特菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_4ad037e2:

    # "You pant heavily, wondering about the safety of Sebas and the wagon."
    "你大口喘着气，担心着塞巴斯和那辆马车是否安全。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_1efff0b9:

    # "But, you can only hope they come out unscathed."
    "但你所能做的，也只有希望他们能毫发无伤地出来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_25b33f19:

    # "The conversation was cut off by the river monster, the night was so dim you couldn't even see it clearly, but it did have a shape resembling the guardian you saw."
    "河怪打断了谈话，夜色昏暗，甚至看不清它的模样，但它确实有几分像你见过的守护者。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_591a35c3:

    # "Either way, it seems that Sebas secretly met with the man, perhaps talking about the Vote and its consequences on Lusterfield."
    "不管怎样，看来塞巴斯曾偷偷和那个人见过面，也许是在谈论投票及其对卢斯特菲尔德的影响。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_5ebb8c28:

    # "Jog might want to hear that nonetheless."
    "乔格可能还是想听听这件事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_d7b15398:

    # s "That was the only thing I had of my mom's. And it vanished in thin air."
    s "那是我手头唯一一件和我妈有关的东西。可它就这么凭空消失了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_a16170db:

    # s "All those days, I thought it was fucking Jog's doing, Ole believed it too."
    s "那些日子里，我一直以为是该死的乔格干的，奥利也这么认为。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_8dbf1354:

    # ct "W-what are you implying, Sebas?"
    ct "你、你到底在暗示什么，塞巴斯？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_82efe361:

    # s "It was you all along. You fucking stole the plush from me."
    s "一直都是你。你他妈从我这里偷走了那个毛绒玩偶。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_3595b2b7:

    # ct "..."
    ct "……"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_6d009ace:

    # "Castor stammered, struggling to comprehend."
    "卡斯托尔结结巴巴地说着，竭力理解这一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_11fc30d9:

    # ct "How did you know?"
    ct "你是怎么知道的？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_e754f526:

    # s "I thought it was weird how he had the guts to make amends. So I started looking over and over again."
    s "我觉得他居然有胆子来弥补过错很奇怪，所以我开始一遍又一遍地搜查。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_4a196996:

    # s "And I saw one of your guards walking by the shop, looking around the village."
    s "我还看到你手下的一名卫兵从店铺旁走过，四处打量着村子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_ce712169:

    # s "I never thought there were anyone else who's petty enough to do this, but then I remembered that same guard disguised as customer on that day."
    s "我从没想过还会有其他人卑劣到这种地步，但随后我想起，那天那名卫兵曾伪装成顾客。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_5af6b5fb:

    # s "And then it dawned on me, that day your guard distracted me to check the storage so he can steal ma's plush away from me."
    s "我这才明白，那天你的卫兵故意引开我，让我去检查储藏室，好把我妈的毛绒玩偶偷走。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_2772e2e6:

    # s "Why?"
    s "为什么？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_6d5053af:

    # ct "In truth, I expected you would have known sooner. We made but no effort to hide that."
    ct "说实话，我以为你早该知道了。我们根本没费心遮掩。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_d440aff7:

    # s "That's worse!"
    s "那更糟糕！"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_211bd815:

    # ct "The only reason I took it, was when I asked your lizard valet. And, I know you still missed her."
    ct "我之所以把它拿走，只是因为我问过你那个蜥蜴侍从。而且我知道，你至今仍然想念她。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_c35e53ce:

    # s "So you took the only thing I had of her?"
    s "所以，你拿走了我手头唯一一件属于她的东西？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_a2702a8b:

    # "His voice wavered with a mix of disbelief and disappointment."
    "他的声音因难以置信和失望交织在一起而微微颤抖。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_4028eb2f:

    # ct "It was a plush sewn with pure gold threads, one that was only used by the royals."
    ct "那是用纯金线缝制的毛绒玩偶，只有王室才会使用这种金线。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_bdad0283:

    # ct "Anyone could have easily regonized the threads, and you have been careless."
    ct "任何人都能轻易认出那些金线，而你一直太不谨慎了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_78cbe5f0:

    # ct "And I thought getting rid of it could've allowed you to move on with your life."
    ct "我以为把它处理掉，或许能让你继续自己的生活。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_6df206bb:

    # ct "I knew not you loved the doll so much, at weeks time you turned the village on its head just to find it."
    ct "我没想到你竟如此珍爱那个玩偶，竟为了找它，几周时间就把整个村子搅得天翻地覆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_6b86fb6b:

    # ct "Listen, I'm sorry, Sivas."
    ct "听我说，对不起，西瓦斯。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Follow_Sebas_71276955:

    # s "That name is not for you. You're not my ma, Castor. I don't need to listen to you."
