    j "不管怎样，谢谢你陪我把这个计划过了一遍。我这辈子都不会主动去找奥利谈的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_fab4eaf3:

    # e "No problem."
    e "没事。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_243c2aa9:

    # j "For the record, you've got my vote. Mhmm, But I gotta go and think about some explaining on the spot when Lot come asking."
    j "先说清楚，你这票我收下了。嗯，不过洛特来问的时候，我得走了，还得想想当场该怎么解释。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_b9f6dcc7:

    # j "See ya."
    j "回头见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_f437a415:

    # "He waves at you until you begin moving once more."
    "他朝你挥手，直到你再次迈步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_21c33943:

    # j "Fair. Anyway, I'm past this whole curiosity now. While you were trying to stalk your precious roomie, I got my fair share of tough deal with Ole."
    j "也是。反正我已经不再好奇了。你还在试图跟踪你那宝贝室友时，我可已经和奥利好好周旋了一番。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_b94f9e53:

    # j "I planned to just hang out, catching up with each other. But that guy even got nervous when I talked about the weather."
    j "本来只想一起待着聊聊近况。可我一提天气，那家伙居然都紧张起来了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_0d7eb2c9:

    # j "So I went straight to the elephant in the room."
    j "所以我就直奔主题了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_ba2a7e6d:

    # j "That said, the talk was surprisingly peaceful, I mean at least after talking it out, he's finally chatting like a normal person."
    j "话说回来，聊得出奇地平和。至少把话说开之后，他终于像个正常人一样聊天了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_1aa067d8:

    # j "I don't even know why I asked at the first place, I never decided to work it out until when you asked about this whole vote."
    j "我甚至不知道自己当初为什么要问。要不是你问起这次投票，我根本没打算把事情解决。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_51bfb695:

    # e "You don't want to know about Seb now?"
    e "你现在不想知道塞布的事了？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_c5202a28:

    # j "It's not like you've got anything, but now that I got it out of my system, it's all good."
    j "也不是你有什么好说的，不过既然我已经把憋在心里的话说出来了，也就没事了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_f9a536ed:

    # e "Now I'm curious what Ole said to you that night."
    e "我现在倒好奇那天晚上奥利对你说了什么。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_b1cc3af9:

    # j "One thing about Ole is, he used to be scared of hanging out in the same tavern as we do, just stopped being there at one point. like, I'm not gonna eat his lizard ass or something."
    j "有件事关于奥利：他以前很怕和我们一起待在同一家酒馆，后来有一阵子干脆不来了。搞得好像我会吃了他那蜥蜴屁股似的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_6342f5b2:

    # j "Gettin' all that scales up my tongue, nah I'm very opposed to that."
    j "让那些鳞片爬满我的舌头？呸，我可完全不想那样。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_f3404a9a:

    # "Jog exclaims as he takes a huge bite out of the plum."
    "乔格喊了一声，同时狠狠咬下一大口李子。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_25a30bac:

    # j "The last time we talked, it was at that party Seb held, I was surprised Ole gave me that invitation, but face to face he's just been spewing the same type of bullshit as we last met."
    j "上次我们说话是在塞布举办的派对上。我没想到奥利会邀请我，但面对面时，他还是像我们上次见面那样，满嘴喷着同样的狗屁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_16fda6d6:

    # j "Hadn't talked to him since the lion flipped all over the place and kicked me out."
    j "自从那头狮子到处发疯闹腾、把我赶出去后，我就没再和他说过话。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_06392cf3:

    # j "But this time, he finally apologized, I don't know what took him so long, but he said he still didn't know who was the thief."
    j "但这次他终于道了歉。我也不知道他为什么拖了这么久，不过他说自己还是不知道小偷是谁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_455a0b1a:

    # j "I guess he was sorry for not talking as friends after all these years."
    j "我猜，他是为这么多年没像朋友一样和我说话而感到抱歉。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_daca8610:

    # j "Well, apologies accepted."
    j "嗯，道歉我接受了。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_caa59704:

    # e "Couldn't you, just talk to Ole at the first place?"
    e "你当初不能直接跟奥利谈谈吗？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_253f21ad:

    # j "Didn't bother, don't wanna. Big Ol's not the type to dwell over the past, neither am I. Why would I talk to someone who thinks I steal from them?"
    j "懒得，也不想。大奥尔不是那种会纠结过去的人，我也不是。一个觉得我偷了他东西的人，我干吗要跟他谈？"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_0d5774a4:

    # j "Either way, thanks for going through this plan with me, I wouldn't have talked to Ole in ten lifetimes."
    j "不管怎样，谢谢你陪我把这个计划过了一遍。我这辈子都不会主动去找奥利谈的。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_fab4eaf3:

    # e "No problem."
    e "没问题。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_243c2aa9:

    # j "For the record, you've got my vote. Mhmm, But I gotta go and think about some explaining on the spot when Lot come asking."
    j "先说清楚，我投你一票。嗯，不过我得走了，想想洛特来问时该怎么当场解释。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_b9f6dcc7:

    # j "See ya."
    j "回头见。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Report_Nothing_f437a415:

    # "He waves at you until you begin moving once more."
    "他朝你挥手，直到你再次迈步。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_0058e14b:

    # "Without enough time to react, you're stunned in place, too scared to move a muscle."
    "你还没来得及反应，便吓得僵在原地，连一根手指都不敢动。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_1b9120d0:

    # "But the light inside of the wagon is already enough to illuminate your prescence in the dark night."
    "但马车里的灯光已经足以在漆黑的夜里照出你的身影。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_4c3e6788:

    # "And consequently, you're still crouching on the side of the wagon when you see Sebas once more."
    "因此，当你再次看见塞巴斯时，你仍蹲在马车旁。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_58ad271b:

    # "He seems lost in thought, contemplating something as he silently walks back towards the village."
    "他似乎陷入沉思，一边想着什么，一边默默朝村子走回去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_6c0c9ebd:

    # "And suddenly, he turns around and your eyes meet."
    "突然，他转过身来，与你四目相对。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_44f4d25e:

    # "He didn't say anything, but you're certain he noticed you right away. His eyes only widen, and his mouth hangs open."
    "他什么也没说，但你确定他立刻就注意到了你。他双眼睁大，嘴巴也惊得张开。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_6989b2b0:

    # "The air seems frozen in place when your gaze locked, even seconds passed feels like years."
    "当你们的目光交汇时，空气仿佛凝固了；短短几秒，却像过去了数年。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_655550eb:

    # "Sebas slowly waves away the guard, you can't see what's in the front. But the wagon soon sets off, disappearing from behind you."
    "塞巴斯缓缓挥手示意守卫离开，你看不见车前的情况。但马车很快启程，消失在你身后。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_149116e8:

    # "Regardless, his gaze remains fixated onto yours, and you find yourself clutching the grasses in nervousness."
    "然而，他的目光始终紧锁着你的双眼，你则紧张地攥住身旁的草。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_061373f4:

    # "It's only after the wagon is completely out of your sight, does Sebas finally speak."
    "直到马车彻底消失在你的视线中，塞巴斯才终于开口。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_24509c42:

    # s "H-how much did you hear?" nointeract
    s "你、你听到了多少？" nointeract

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_7971006b:

    # e "J-just a little. I was just curious where you've been, Seb."
    e "只、只听到一点。我只是好奇你去了哪里，塞巴。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_eef13c5f:

    # "Sebas' eyes droops lower, he furrows his brows, giving you a sullen look."
    "塞巴斯垂下眼帘，皱起眉头，神情阴郁地看着你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_658fe550:

    # e "I- I followed you here, and heard everything inside the wagon."
    e "我、我跟着你来到这里，还听到了马车里的一切。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_ef1516b3:

    # "Sebas' still taking time to process whatever happened here, but his stare has soften."
    "塞巴斯仍在慢慢消化这里发生的一切，但他的目光已经柔和下来。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_e043d770:

    # s "Okay."
    s "好。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_b9e07ff6:

    # "Sebas mutters under his breath, his voice is much lower than what you normally hear from the lion."
    "塞巴斯低声喃喃，声音比你平时从这头狮子那里听到的低沉得多。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_f3fabdc1:

    # "Frustration and disappointment etch his face, and you sense the weight of his emotions."
    "挫败与失望刻在他的脸上，你感受到了他情绪的沉重。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_ca8ef0af:

    # "You catch a glimpse of Sebas looking away, he wants to forgive you so much even in face of the betrayal of his trust, but he's not able to."
    "你瞥见塞巴斯移开视线；即使面对你背叛他的信任，他也无比想要原谅你，却做不到。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_f447c7fb:

    # "Instead, he turns away without another word."
    "相反，他一言不发地转过身去。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Fail_9582a6f3:

    # "Quickly, you rise to your feet to chase after him, but he's already running back to Lusterfield, leaving you alone in the forest once more."
    "你连忙起身追赶，但他已经跑回了卢斯特菲尔德，再次把你独自留在森林里。"

translate schinese_rewrite Jog_Vote_Sebas_Escape_Success_fe675573:

    # "Without hesitation, you slip away through the thick grasses and run back to Lusterfield."
    "毫不犹豫地，你穿过茂密的草丛溜走，跑回了卢斯特菲尔德。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Voting_Opinion_175bc015:

    # e "M-master, how do you think about the vote...?"
    e "主、主人，你怎么看这次投票……？"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Voting_Opinion_ee6e5935:

    # e "Arty, how do you think about the vote in Lusterfield?"
    e "亚蒂，你怎么看卢斯特菲尔德的投票？"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Voting_Opinion_759114a3:

    # ar "Vote? What vote. Why hadn't I heard of that?"
    ar "投票？什么投票？我怎么从来没听说过？"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Voting_Opinion_5cecc702:

    # e "Aren't farmers also invited for the voting day? I really thought Amble or Jog would tell you about it."
    e "农夫们不是也会被邀请参加投票日吗？我还真以为安布或乔格会告诉你。"

translate schinese_rewrite Arthur_Voting_Opinion_a0ee09bd:

    # msg "Arthur's Vote currently working in progress, will be continued in the next update!"
    msg "亚瑟的投票目前还在制作中，后续内容将在下次更新中继续！"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_End_8d660a05:

    # e "That's all, thank you for chatting, Rahim."
    e "就这些了，谢谢你陪我聊天，雷希姆。"

translate schinese_rewrite Rahim_Dialogue_End_127b7e99:

    # r "Ok. Take care."
    r "嗯，保重。"
